window.ELEVATE_EN={t:{"Det har aldrig varit enklare att skapa en hemsida sj\xE4lv. Med verktyg som Wix, Squarespace och WordPress kan vem som\u2026":"It has never been easier to create a website yourself. With tools like Wix, Squarespace and WordPress, anyone can\u2026","Fr\xE5gan om vad en hemsida kostar f\xE5r svar som spretar fr\xE5n n\xE5gra hundralappar till hundratusentals kronor. Skillnaden\u2026":"Ask what a website costs and the answers range from a few hundred kronor to hundreds of thousands. The difference\u2026","En hemsida kan vara snygg och \xE4nd\xE5 inte ge en enda f\xF6rfr\xE5gan. Oftast beror det inte p\xE5 designen, utan p\xE5 att\u2026":"A website can look great and still not bring in a single enquiry. Usually it's not the design, but that visitors\u2026","Allt fler s\xF6ker inte l\xE4ngre bara p\xE5 Google, utan st\xE4ller fr\xE5gan direkt till en AI-assistent: \u201DVilken snickare i\u2026":"More and more people no longer just search on Google, but ask an AI assistant directly: \u201CWhich carpenter in Haninge\u2026","Alvhem St\xE4d i \xC4lv\xE4ngen hade en hemsida som fanns, men som inte gjorde n\xE5got. Vi byggde en ny fr\xE5n grunden. H\xE4r \xE4r\u2026":"Alvhem St\xE4d in \xC4lv\xE4ngen had a website that existed, but did nothing. We built a new one from scratch. Here is what\u2026","M\xE5nga hemsidor \xE4r som b\xE4st dagen de lanseras och sedan h\xE4nder ingenting p\xE5 tre \xE5r. Priserna \xE4r gamla, personalen har\u2026":"Many websites are at their best the day they launch and then nothing happens for three years. The prices are old,\u2026","En hemsida som laddar l\xE5ngsamt tappar bes\xF6kare innan de sett en enda bild, hur vacker den \xE4n \xE4r. Hastighet \xE4r\u2026":"A website that loads slowly loses visitors before they have seen a single picture, however beautiful it is. Speed is\u2026","En byggfirma lever p\xE5 f\xF6rtroende och p\xE5 att f\xE5 r\xE4tt f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar: tillr\xE4ckligt stora jobb, i r\xE4tt omr\xE5de, fr\xE5n\u2026":"A builder lives on trust and on getting the right enquiries: jobs big enough, in the right area, from customers\u2026","Fler f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar l\xE5ter bra tills h\xE4lften av dem g\xE4ller jobb ni inte g\xF6r, i omr\xE5den ni inte \xE5ker till. Ett bra\u2026":"More enquiries sounds good until half of them are for jobs you do not do, in areas you do not drive to. A good quote\u2026","Den som letar st\xE4dfirma vill veta tre saker: vad det kostar, om RUT-avdraget dras direkt och hur man kommer ig\xE5ng.\u2026":"Someone looking for a cleaning company wants to know three things: what it costs, whether the Swedish RUT tax\u2026","Den vanligaste texten p\xE5 svenska f\xF6retags hemsidor b\xF6rjar med \u201DVi \xE4r ett f\xF6retag med l\xE5ng erfarenhet och h\xF6g\u2026":"The most common copy on Swedish business websites starts with \u201CWe are a company with long experience and high\u2026","Kontaktsidan \xE4r ofta den n\xE4st mest bes\xF6kta sidan efter startsidan, och den som flest l\xE4mnar utan att g\xF6ra n\xE5got.\u2026":"The contact page is often the second most visited page after the start page, and the one most people leave without\u2026","Under semestern jobbar hemsidan \xE5t er n\xE4r ni inte g\xF6r det. Men bara om den s\xE4ger r\xE4tt saker. H\xE4r \xE4r det som brukar\u2026":"During the holidays the website works for you when you do not. But only if it says the right things. Here is what\u2026","Recensioner avg\xF6r ofta vem som f\xE5r samtalet n\xE4r kunden j\xE4mf\xF6r tre firmor p\xE5 kartan. De flesta n\xF6jda kunder skriver\u2026":"Reviews often decide who gets the call when a customer compares three firms on the map. Most happy customers still\u2026","De flesta som bes\xF6ker ett lokalt f\xF6retags hemsida g\xF6r det fr\xE5n mobilen, ofta p\xE5 v\xE4g n\xE5gonstans. \xC4nd\xE5 designas m\xE5nga\u2026":"Most people who visit a local business's website do it from the phone, often on the way somewhere. Yet many sites\u2026","Den leende kvinnan med headset finns p\xE5 tusen hemsidor. Bes\xF6karen k\xE4nner igen henne och slutar lita p\xE5 sidan. Ett\u2026":"The smiling woman with the headset is on a thousand websites. The visitor recognises her and stops trusting the\u2026","De flesta hantverkare f\xE5r sina f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar i telefon, mitt i ett jobb. Samtal missas, lappar f\xF6rsvinner och kunden\u2026":"Most tradespeople get their enquiries by phone, in the middle of a job. Calls are missed, notes get lost and the\u2026","En chatt p\xE5 hemsidan som svarar direkt l\xE5ter bra, men en d\xE5ligt gjord chatt skr\xE4mmer bort fler \xE4n den hj\xE4lper. H\xE4r\u2026":"A chat on the website that answers right away sounds good, but a badly made chat scares off more people than it\u2026","Allt fler fr\xE5gar en AI-assistent i st\xE4llet f\xF6r att googla: \u201DVilken elektriker i Uppsala kan komma den h\xE4r veckan?\u201D\u2026":"More and more people ask an AI assistant instead of googling: \u201CWhich electrician in Uppsala can come this week?\u201D The\u2026","De fr\xE5gor ni f\xE5r i telefon varje vecka \xE4r samma fr\xE5gor folk skriver in p\xE5 Google och st\xE4ller till AI-assistenter.\u2026":"The questions you get on the phone every week are the same questions people type into Google and ask AI assistants.\u2026","N\xE4r n\xE5gon s\xF6ker p\xE5 en tj\xE4nst och en ort visar Google f\xF6rst kartan med tre f\xF6retag. Att hamna d\xE4r kostar inget, men\u2026":"When someone searches for a service and a town, Google first shows the map with three businesses. Getting there\u2026","Dom\xE4nen \xE4r f\xF6retagets adress p\xE5 n\xE4tet. St\xE5r den p\xE5 byr\xE5n som byggde sidan, eller p\xE5 en anst\xE4lld som slutat, kan ni\u2026":"The domain is your business's address online. If it is registered to the agency that built the site, or to an\u2026","Januari \xE4r den lugnaste m\xE5naden f\xF6r m\xE5nga f\xF6retag, och den b\xE4sta att l\xE4gga en timme p\xE5 hemsidan. H\xE4r \xE4r fem saker\u2026":"January is the quietest month for many businesses, and the best one to spend an hour on the website. Here are five\u2026","Starta test":"Start test","Vi fixar det \u2192":"We fix it \u2192","Riktigt bra. Bara finputs kvar.":"Really good. Only polishing left.","Bra grund, n\xE5gra saker att fixa.":"A good base, a few things to fix.","Det finns tydliga vinster att h\xE4mta.":"There are clear gains to be had.","Sidan tappar bes\xF6kare. H\xE4r finns mycket att vinna.":"The page is losing visitors. There is a lot to gain here.","Hemsida f\xF6r hantverkare \u2013 med offertformul\xE4r":"Website for tradespeople \u2013 with a quote form","Offertsystem och offertformul\xE4r f\xF6r hemsidan":"Quote system and quote form for the website","Tryck p\xE5 en tid s\xE5 \xE4r m\xF6tet bokat":"Tap a time and the meeting is booked","Google Meet med Carl \u2013 l\xE4nken kommer i bekr\xE4ftelsen":"Google Meet with Carl \u2013 the link comes in the confirmation","Se alla tider \u2192":"See all times \u2192",Ledig:"Free","Upptagen i v\xE5r kalender. Alla tider \xE4r svensk tid.":"Taken in our calendar. All times are Swedish time.","och Markmontage BEAB AB \xE4r kunder hos oss. \xD6vriga namn \xE4r p\xE5hittade exempel.":"and Markmontage BEAB AB are clients of ours. The other names are fictional examples.","Boka ett kort m\xF6te":"Book a short meeting","Se lediga tider":"See available times","30 minuter om er hemsida via Google Meet. Kostnadsfritt, v\xE4lj en tid som passar.":"30 minutes about your website on Google Meet. Free of charge, pick a time that suits you.","Ladda ner som PDF":"Download as PDF","Skicka via offertf\xF6rfr\xE5gan":"Send as a quote request","N\xE4r passar det":"When suits","dig?":"you?","30 minuter om er hemsida: vad den ska ge er och hur ett uppl\xE4gg kan se ut. Det kostar ingenting, och du beh\xF6ver inte f\xF6rbereda n\xE5got. V\xE4lj en tid s\xE5 \xE4r det bokat.":"30 minutes about your website: what it should give you and what a setup could look like. It costs nothing, and you do not need to prepare anything. Pick a time and it is booked.","Se alla lediga tider":"See all free times","N\xE4sta lediga tider":"Next free times","H\xE4mtar tider \u2026":"Loading times \u2026","Google Meet eller telefon. Alla tider \xE4r svensk tid.":"Google Meet or phone. All times are Swedish time.","\xC4g din dom\xE4n och din e-post sj\xE4lv":"Own your domain and your e-mail yourself","\xC4g din dom\xE4n och din e-post sj\xE4lv | Elevate Studio":"Own your domain and your e-mail yourself | Elevate Studio","Dom\xE4nen \xE4r f\xF6retagets adress p\xE5 n\xE4tet. St\xE5r den p\xE5 byr\xE5n som byggde sidan, eller p\xE5 en anst\xE4lld som slutat, kan ni en dag st\xE5 utan b\xE5de hemsida och e-post. S\xE5 h\xE4r ser ni till att den \xE4r er.":"The domain is your business's address online. If it is registered to the agency that built the site, or to an employee who has left, you can one day be left without both website and e-mail. Here is how to make sure it is yours.","Kolla vem som st\xE5r som \xE4gare":"Check who is listed as the owner","Logga in hos den d\xE4r dom\xE4nen k\xF6ptes, ofta Loopia, One.com eller Binero. St\xE5r f\xF6retaget som \xE4gare med en e-postadress ni l\xE4ser? Om ni inte vet var den \xE4r k\xF6pt, fr\xE5ga den som byggde sidan. Svaret ska komma snabbt och utan f\xF6rbeh\xE5ll.":"Log in where the domain was bought, often Loopia, One.com or Binero. Is the company listed as the owner with an e-mail address you read? If you do not know where it was bought, ask whoever built the site. The answer should come quickly and without reservations.","E-posten ska f\xF6lja dom\xE4nen":"E-mail should follow the domain","Anv\xE4nd adresser p\xE5 er egen dom\xE4n, som info@ertforetag.se, inte en gratisadress.":"Use addresses on your own domain, like info@yourcompany.se, not a free address.","Ha minst tv\xE5 personer som kan logga in p\xE5 dom\xE4nen och e-posten.":"Have at least two people who can log in to the domain and the e-mail.","Skriv ner var dom\xE4nen \xE4r registrerad och n\xE4r den f\xF6rnyas.":"Write down where the domain is registered and when it renews.",'I v\xE5rt <a href="avtal.html">avtal</a> st\xE5r det svart p\xE5 vitt: best\xE4llaren \xE4ger sin dom\xE4n. Vi hj\xE4lper till att k\xF6pa och koppla den, men den registreras alltid p\xE5 er.':'Our <a href="avtal.html">agreement</a> says it in black and white: the customer owns their domain. We help buy and connect it, but it is always registered to you.',"I v\xE5rt":"Our",avtal:"agreement","st\xE5r det svart p\xE5 vitt: best\xE4llaren \xE4ger sin dom\xE4n. Vi hj\xE4lper till att k\xF6pa och koppla den, men den registreras alltid p\xE5 er.":"says it in black and white: the customer owns their domain. We help buy and connect it, but it is always registered to you.","D\xE4rf\xF6r ska hemsidan ha en sida med vanliga fr\xE5gor":"Why your website should have a FAQ page","D\xE4rf\xF6r ska hemsidan ha en sida med vanliga fr\xE5gor | Elevate Studio":"Why your website should have a FAQ page | Elevate Studio","De fr\xE5gor ni f\xE5r i telefon varje vecka \xE4r samma fr\xE5gor folk skriver in p\xE5 Google och st\xE4ller till AI-assistenter. Svarar hemsidan p\xE5 dem sparar ni samtal, och ni syns d\xE4r fr\xE5gorna st\xE4lls.":"The questions you get on the phone every week are the same questions people type into Google and ask AI assistants. If the website answers them you save calls, and you show up where the questions are asked.","Vilka fr\xE5gor":"Which questions","Vad kostar det? Ge ett spann eller ett exempel, inte \u201Dkontakta oss f\xF6r offert\u201D.":"What does it cost? Give a range or an example, not \u201Ccontact us for a quote\u201D.","Var jobbar ni? Skriv ut orterna.":"Where do you work? Spell out the towns.","Hur l\xE5ng tid tar det? Hur snabbt kan ni komma?":"How long does it take? How soon can you come?","Vad beh\xF6ver kunden g\xF6ra sj\xE4lv innan ni kommer?":"What does the customer need to do before you arrive?","Har ni F-skatt, f\xF6rs\xE4kring, garanti?":"Do you have the right tax registration, insurance, warranty?","S\xE5 skriver ni svaren":"How to write the answers","Kort fr\xE5ga som rubrik, ett till tre meningar som svar. Skriv det ni faktiskt s\xE4ger i telefon. Undvik att svara \u201Ddet beror p\xE5\u201D utan att s\xE4ga vad det beror p\xE5.":"A short question as the heading, one to three sentences as the answer. Write what you actually say on the phone. Avoid answering \u201Cit depends\u201D without saying what it depends on.","Det syns p\xE5 Google":"It shows on Google",'Fr\xE5gor och svar kan m\xE4rkas upp s\xE5 att Google visar dem direkt i s\xF6kresultatet, och AI-tj\xE4nster plockar g\xE4rna svar som \xE4r skrivna s\xE5 h\xE4r. Det ing\xE5r i den <a href="tjanster/seo-och-ai-optimering.html">SEO och AI-optimering</a> vi g\xF6r p\xE5 alla sidor vi bygger.':'Questions and answers can be marked up so Google shows them right in the search result, and AI services happily pick answers written this way. It is part of the <a href="tjanster/seo-och-ai-optimering.html">SEO and AI optimisation</a> we do on every site we build.',"Fr\xE5gor och svar kan m\xE4rkas upp s\xE5 att Google visar dem direkt i s\xF6kresultatet, och AI-tj\xE4nster plockar g\xE4rna svar som \xE4r skrivna s\xE5 h\xE4r. Det ing\xE5r i den":"Questions and answers can be marked up so Google shows them right in the search result, and AI services happily pick answers written this way. It is part of the","vi g\xF6r p\xE5 alla sidor vi bygger.":"we do on every site we build.","AI-chatt p\xE5 hemsidan: vad den kan, och vad den inte ska g\xF6ra":"AI chat on the website: what it can do, and what it should not","AI-chatt p\xE5 hemsidan: vad den kan, och vad den inte ska g\xF6ra | Elevate Studio":"AI chat on the website: what it can do, and what it should not | Elevate Studio","En chatt p\xE5 hemsidan som svarar direkt l\xE5ter bra, men en d\xE5ligt gjord chatt skr\xE4mmer bort fler \xE4n den hj\xE4lper. H\xE4r \xE4r vad en bra AI-chatt g\xF6r, och var gr\xE4nsen g\xE5r.":"A chat on the website that answers right away sounds good, but a badly made chat scares off more people than it helps. Here is what a good AI chat does, and where the line goes.","Det h\xE4r ska den klara":"This is what it should handle","Svara p\xE5 fr\xE5gor om era tj\xE4nster, omr\xE5den, priser och tider, utifr\xE5n det som st\xE5r p\xE5 hemsidan.":"Answer questions about your services, areas, prices and hours, based on what the website says.","St\xE4lla en f\xF6ljdfr\xE5ga n\xE4r det beh\xF6vs: vilken typ av jobb, var, n\xE4r.":"Ask a follow-up question when needed: what kind of job, where, when.","L\xE4mna \xF6ver: ta namn och telefonnummer och skicka till er, eller \xF6ppna bokningen.":"Hand over: take name and phone number and send it to you, or open the booking.","S\xE4ga att den inte vet, och h\xE4nvisa till telefon, i st\xE4llet f\xF6r att gissa.":"Say it does not know, and point to the phone, instead of guessing.","Det h\xE4r ska den inte g\xF6ra":"This is what it should not do","Lova priser eller tider som inte st\xE5r n\xE5gonstans.":"Promise prices or times that are not written anywhere.","L\xE5tsas vara en m\xE4nniska.":"Pretend to be a human.","Tjata. Ett litet \u201DFr\xE5gor?\u201D i h\xF6rnet r\xE4cker, inga popups.":"Nag. A small \u201CQuestions?\u201D in the corner is enough, no pop-ups.","S\xE5 bygger vi den":"How we build it",'V\xE5r <a href="tjanster/ai-chatt.html">AI-chatt</a> tr\xE4nas p\xE5 er hemsida och det ni ber\xE4ttar om jobbet. Den svarar p\xE5 svenska, l\xE4mnar \xF6ver till er n\xE4r intresset \xE4r tillr\xE4ckligt stort, och ni ser varje samtal i efterhand.':'Our <a href="tjanster/ai-chatt.html">AI chat</a> is trained on your website and what you tell us about the job. It answers in Swedish, hands over to you when the interest is strong enough, and you can see every conversation afterwards.',V\u00E5r:"Our","tr\xE4nas p\xE5 er hemsida och det ni ber\xE4ttar om jobbet. Den svarar p\xE5 svenska, l\xE4mnar \xF6ver till er n\xE4r intresset \xE4r tillr\xE4ckligt stort, och ni ser varje samtal i efterhand.":"is trained on your website and what you tell us about the job. It answers in Swedish, hands over to you when the interest is strong enough, and you can see every conversation afterwards.","Egna bilder sl\xE5r bildbanker, varje g\xE5ng":"Your own photos beat stock images, every time","Egna bilder sl\xE5r bildbanker, varje g\xE5ng | Elevate Studio":"Your own photos beat stock images, every time | Elevate Studio","Den leende kvinnan med headset finns p\xE5 tusen hemsidor. Bes\xF6karen k\xE4nner igen henne och slutar lita p\xE5 sidan. Ett suddigt foto p\xE5 er riktiga bil utanf\xF6r ett riktigt jobb s\xE4ger mer \xE4n alla bildbanker i v\xE4rlden.":"The smiling woman with the headset is on a thousand websites. The visitor recognises her and stops trusting the page. A slightly blurry photo of your real van outside a real job says more than every stock library in the world.","Bilder som fungerar":"Photos that work","Ni sj\xE4lva, p\xE5 jobbet, i arbetskl\xE4der.":"You, at work, in work clothes.","F\xF6re och efter p\xE5 riktiga jobb, tagna fr\xE5n samma vinkel.":"Before and after on real jobs, taken from the same angle.","Verkstaden, lagret, bilarna, verktygen.":"The workshop, the warehouse, the vans, the tools.","Kunder som godk\xE4nt att vara med, g\xE4rna med ett citat.":"Customers who have agreed to be shown, preferably with a quote.","S\xE5 tar ni dem med mobilen":"How to take them with the phone","Dagsljus, inte blixt. H\xE5ll telefonen stilla och ta tre bilder av varje motiv. Torka av linsen. Ta liggande bilder till datorn och st\xE5ende till mobilen. Det r\xE4cker l\xE5ngt. En fotograf en halvdag om \xE5ret \xE4r en bra investering f\xF6r resten.":"Daylight, not flash. Hold the phone still and take three shots of each subject. Wipe the lens. Take landscape shots for desktop and portrait for mobile. That goes a long way. A photographer for half a day once a year is a good investment for the rest.","Storleken spelar roll":"Size matters",'Bilder rakt fr\xE5n mobilen \xE4r f\xF6r stora f\xF6r webben och g\xF6r sidan l\xE5ngsam. Vi skalar ner och sparar alla bilder i r\xE4tt storlek n\xE4r vi bygger, s\xE5 att de laddar snabbt \xE4ven p\xE5 mobiln\xE4t. Se v\xE5ra <a href="byggda-hemsidor.html">byggda hemsidor</a> f\xF6r exempel p\xE5 sajter med kundernas egna bilder.':`Photos straight from the phone are too big for the web and make the page slow. We scale down and save every image in the right size when we build, so they load fast even on mobile data. See our <a href="byggda-hemsidor.html">websites we have built</a> for examples of sites with the customers' own photos.`,"Bilder rakt fr\xE5n mobilen \xE4r f\xF6r stora f\xF6r webben och g\xF6r sidan l\xE5ngsam. Vi skalar ner och sparar alla bilder i r\xE4tt storlek n\xE4r vi bygger, s\xE5 att de laddar snabbt \xE4ven p\xE5 mobiln\xE4t. Se v\xE5ra":"Photos straight from the phone are too big for the web and make the page slow. We scale down and save every image in the right size when we build, so they load fast even on mobile data. See our","byggda hemsidor":"websites we have built","f\xF6r exempel p\xE5 sajter med kundernas egna bilder.":"for examples of sites with the customers' own photos.","S\xE5 f\xE5r ni fler recensioner p\xE5 Google":"How to get more reviews on Google","S\xE5 f\xE5r ni fler recensioner p\xE5 Google | Elevate Studio":"How to get more reviews on Google | Elevate Studio","Recensioner avg\xF6r ofta vem som f\xE5r samtalet n\xE4r kunden j\xE4mf\xF6r tre firmor p\xE5 kartan. De flesta n\xF6jda kunder skriver \xE4nd\xE5 ingen, inte f\xF6r att de inte vill, utan f\xF6r att ingen bad dem. S\xE5 h\xE4r ber ni.":"Reviews often decide who gets the call when a customer compares three firms on the map. Most happy customers still write none, not because they do not want to, but because nobody asked. Here is how to ask.","Be direkt efter jobbet":"Ask right after the job","Samma dag eller dagen efter, n\xE4r kunden fortfarande \xE4r glad \xF6ver resultatet. Ett kort mejl eller sms: \u201DTack f\xF6r f\xF6rtroendet! Skulle du vilja skriva n\xE5gra rader om hur det gick? Det betyder mycket f\xF6r oss.\u201D Och en l\xE4nk som g\xE5r rakt till rutan d\xE4r man skriver, inte till er profil i allm\xE4nhet.":"The same day or the day after, while the customer is still pleased with the result. A short e-mail or text: \u201CThanks for the trust! Would you write a few lines about how it went? It means a lot to us.\u201D And a link that goes straight to the box where they write, not to your profile in general.","G\xF6r det l\xE4tt":"Make it easy","En l\xE4nk, ett klick. Ingen inloggning ut\xF6ver det Google-konto de redan har.":"One link, one click. No login beyond the Google account they already have.","F\xF6resl\xE5 vad de kan skriva om: vad som gjordes, hur kontakten var, om det blev som de t\xE4nkt.":"Suggest what they can write about: what was done, how the contact was, whether it turned out as expected.","Be inte alla samma vecka. Google tycker b\xE4ttre om en j\xE4mn str\xF6m \xE4n en klump.":"Do not ask everyone the same week. Google prefers a steady stream to a lump.","Svara p\xE5 varje recension":"Reply to every review","Ett \u201DTack Anna, kul att altanen blev som ni ville!\u201D visar n\xE4sta kund att ni bryr er. F\xE5r ni en d\xE5lig recension, svara lugnt och sakligt och erbjud att l\xF6sa det. Den som l\xE4ser bed\xF6mer svaret mer \xE4n klagom\xE5let.":"A \u201CThanks Anna, glad the deck turned out the way you wanted!\u201D shows the next customer that you care. If you get a bad review, reply calmly and factually and offer to sort it out. The reader judges the reply more than the complaint.",'I det <a href="tjanster/offertsystem.html">offertsystem</a> vi bygger finns ett f\xE4rdigt recensionsmejl som skickas med ett klick n\xE4r jobbet \xE4r klart.':'The <a href="tjanster/offertsystem.html">quote system</a> we build has a ready-made review e-mail that is sent with one click when the job is done.',"I det":"The","vi bygger finns ett f\xE4rdigt recensionsmejl som skickas med ett klick n\xE4r jobbet \xE4r klart.":"we build has a ready-made review e-mail that is sent with one click when the job is done.","Vad ska st\xE5 p\xE5 kontaktsidan?":"What should be on the contact page?","Vad ska st\xE5 p\xE5 kontaktsidan? | Elevate Studio":"What should be on the contact page? | Elevate Studio","Kontaktsidan \xE4r ofta den n\xE4st mest bes\xF6kta sidan efter startsidan, och den som flest l\xE4mnar utan att g\xF6ra n\xE5got. Oftast f\xF6r att den g\xF6r det sv\xE5rt. S\xE5 h\xE4r g\xF6r ni den enkel.":"The contact page is often the second most visited page after the start page, and the one most people leave without doing anything. Usually because it makes it hard. Here is how to make it easy.","Tre s\xE4tt att h\xF6ra av sig, synliga direkt":"Three ways to get in touch, visible right away","Telefonnummer som g\xE5r att trycka p\xE5, med namnet p\xE5 den som svarar.":"A phone number that can be tapped, with the name of the person who answers.","E-postadress p\xE5 er egen dom\xE4n.":"An e-mail address on your own domain.","Ett kort formul\xE4r: namn, telefon, vad det g\xE4ller. Inget mer.":"A short form: name, phone, what it concerns. Nothing more.","S\xE4g n\xE4r ni svarar":"Say when you answer","\u201DVi svarar samma dag p\xE5 vardagar\u201D tar bort os\xE4kerheten. Har ni telefontid, skriv ut den. Har ni inte det, skriv \u201Dring n\xE4r som helst, vi ringer tillbaka om vi inte kan svara\u201D.":"\u201CWe reply the same day on weekdays\u201D removes the uncertainty. If you have phone hours, spell them out. If not, write \u201Ccall any time, we call back if we cannot answer\u201D.","Visa var ni finns":"Show where you are","Ort och omr\xE5de ni jobbar i, g\xE4rna en karta om kunder bes\xF6ker er. Och ett foto p\xE5 den som svarar. Folk ringer hellre Anna \xE4n \u201Dkundtj\xE4nst\u201D.":"Town and the area you work in, preferably a map if customers visit you. And a photo of the person who answers. People would rather call Anna than \u201Ccustomer service\u201D.","Ta bort det som st\xF6r":"Remove what gets in the way",'Inga obligatoriska f\xE4lt f\xF6r organisationsnummer, inga captcha-pussel, inga tio val i en lista. Varje hinder kostar f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar. Titta p\xE5 v\xE5r egen <a href="kontakt.html">kontaktsida</a>: ring, mejla eller skriv, tre knappar och ett formul\xE4r.':'No mandatory fields for company registration numbers, no captcha puzzles, no ten choices in a list. Every obstacle costs enquiries. Look at our own <a href="kontakt.html">contact page</a>: call, e-mail or write, three buttons and one form.',"Inga obligatoriska f\xE4lt f\xF6r organisationsnummer, inga captcha-pussel, inga tio val i en lista. Varje hinder kostar f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar. Titta p\xE5 v\xE5r egen":"No mandatory fields for company registration numbers, no captcha puzzles, no ten choices in a list. Every obstacle costs enquiries. Look at our own",kontaktsida:"contact page",": ring, mejla eller skriv, tre knappar och ett formul\xE4r.":": call, e-mail or write, three buttons and one form.","Hemsida f\xF6r st\xE4dfirma: det som ska finnas":"A website for a cleaning company: what it needs","Hemsida f\xF6r st\xE4dfirma: det som ska finnas | Elevate Studio":"A website for a cleaning company: what it needs | Elevate Studio","Den som letar st\xE4dfirma vill veta tre saker: vad det kostar, om RUT-avdraget dras direkt och hur man kommer ig\xE5ng. En hemsida f\xF6r en st\xE4dfirma ska svara p\xE5 det innan bes\xF6karen hunnit scrolla.":"Someone looking for a cleaning company wants to know three things: what it costs, whether the Swedish RUT tax deduction is applied directly and how to get started. A cleaning company's website should answer that before the visitor has scrolled.","En sida per tj\xE4nst":"One page per service","Hemst\xE4dning, storst\xE4dning, flyttst\xE4dning och kontorsst\xE4dning \xE4r fyra olika s\xF6kningar. Varje tj\xE4nst beh\xF6ver en egen sida med pris, vad som ing\xE5r och en knapp f\xF6r att boka. D\xE5 hittar Google r\xE4tt sida f\xF6r r\xE4tt s\xF6kning.":"Home cleaning, deep cleaning, move-out cleaning and office cleaning are four different searches. Each service needs its own page with price, what is included and a button to book. Then Google finds the right page for the right search.","Priset, med RUT":"The price, with RUT","Skriv timpriset efter RUT-avdrag, och vad det blir f\xF6r en vanlig l\xE4genhet. En kalkyl d\xE4r kunden fyller i kvadratmeter och ser priset direkt tar bort det vanligaste sk\xE4let att inte h\xF6ra av sig.":"Write the hourly price after the RUT deduction, and what it comes to for an ordinary flat. A calculator where the customer enters square metres and sees the price right away removes the most common reason for not getting in touch.",F\u00F6rtroende:"Trust","Samma st\xE4dare varje g\xE5ng, om ni erbjuder det.":"The same cleaner every time, if you offer it.","F\xF6rs\xE4kring och n\xF6jd kund-garanti, i klartext.":"Insurance and a satisfaction guarantee, in plain words.","Recensioner fr\xE5n Google, och riktiga bilder p\xE5 teamet.":"Reviews from Google, and real photos of the team.","Ett riktigt exempel":"A real example",'S\xE5 byggde vi hemsidan f\xF6r <a href="projekt/alvhem-stad.html">Alvhem St\xE4d</a> i \xC4lv\xE4ngen: film i toppen, en sida per st\xE4dtj\xE4nst med pris, en kalkyl som r\xE4knar av RUT direkt och bokning av uppstartsm\xF6te fr\xE5n varje sida.':'That is how we built the website for <a href="projekt/alvhem-stad.html">Alvhem St\xE4d</a> in \xC4lv\xE4ngen: a film at the top, one page per cleaning service with a price, a calculator that deducts RUT right away and booking of a start-up meeting from every page.',"S\xE5 byggde vi hemsidan f\xF6r":"That is how we built the website for","i \xC4lv\xE4ngen: film i toppen, en sida per st\xE4dtj\xE4nst med pris, en kalkyl som r\xE4knar av RUT direkt och bokning av uppstartsm\xF6te fr\xE5n varje sida.":"in \xC4lv\xE4ngen: a film at the top, one page per cleaning service with a price, a calculator that deducts RUT right away and booking of a start-up meeting from every page.",Branscher:"Industries","Hemsida f\xF6r byggfirma: r\xE4tt sorts jobb":"A website for a builder: the right kind of jobs","Hemsida f\xF6r byggfirma: r\xE4tt sorts jobb | Elevate Studio":"A website for a builder: the right kind of jobs | Elevate Studio","En byggfirma lever p\xE5 f\xF6rtroende och p\xE5 att f\xE5 r\xE4tt f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar: tillr\xE4ckligt stora jobb, i r\xE4tt omr\xE5de, fr\xE5n kunder som \xE4r redo att b\xF6rja. Hemsidan ska sortera fram dem.":"A builder lives on trust and on getting the right enquiries: jobs big enough, in the right area, from customers ready to start. The website should sort them out.","Visa jobben, inte verktygen":"Show the jobs, not the tools","Ett galleri med f\xE4rdiga projekt, g\xE4rna filtrerat p\xE5 k\xF6k, badrum, totalrenovering och utomhus, \xE4r det som s\xE4ljer. F\xF6re och efter fr\xE5n samma vinkel. Ort och ungef\xE4rlig tid f\xF6r varje projekt.":"A gallery of finished projects, preferably filtered by kitchen, bathroom, full renovation and outdoors, is what sells. Before and after from the same angle. Town and rough duration for each project.","Ber\xE4tta hur det g\xE5r till":"Explain how it works","Kontakt: kunden ber\xE4ttar om projektet.":"Contact: the customer describes the project.","Kostnadsfritt hembes\xF6k: ni tittar p\xE5 plats.":"Free home visit: you look on site.","Fast offert innan arbetet b\xF6rjar.":"Fixed quote before the work begins.","Genomg\xE5ng n\xE4r jobbet \xE4r klart.":"Walk-through when the job is done.","Offert p\xE5 varje sida":"A quote button on every page","Knappen \u201DF\xE5 gratis offert\u201D ska finnas i toppen, i varje tj\xE4nstesektion och l\xE4ngst ner. Den som best\xE4mt sig ska aldrig beh\xF6va leta.":"The \u201CGet a free quote\u201D button should be at the top, in every service section and at the bottom. Someone who has decided should never have to search.",'<a href="byggda-hemsidor.html">Haninge Byggteam AB</a> i Stockholm fick en hemsida byggd runt just det: offertknapp i varje del av sidan, ett projektgalleri med filter, \u201DS\xE5 arbetar vi\u201D i fyra steg och deras 5,0 i Google-betyg redan i toppen.':'<a href="byggda-hemsidor.html">Haninge Byggteam AB</a> in Stockholm got a website built around exactly that: a quote button in every part of the page, a project gallery with filters, \u201CHow we work\u201D in four steps and their 5.0 Google rating right at the top.',"Haninge Byggteam AB":"Haninge Byggteam AB","i Stockholm fick en hemsida byggd runt just det: offertknapp i varje del av sidan, ett projektgalleri med filter, \u201DS\xE5 arbetar vi\u201D i fyra steg och deras 5,0 i Google-betyg redan i toppen.":"in Stockholm got a website built around exactly that: a quote button in every part of the page, a project gallery with filters, \u201CHow we work\u201D in four steps and their 5.0 Google rating right at the top.","Vad h\xE4nder med hemsidan efter lansering?":"What happens to the website after launch?","Vad h\xE4nder med hemsidan efter lansering? | Elevate Studio":"What happens to the website after launch? | Elevate Studio","M\xE5nga hemsidor \xE4r som b\xE4st dagen de lanseras och sedan h\xE4nder ingenting p\xE5 tre \xE5r. Priserna \xE4r gamla, personalen har bytts ut och den senaste nyheten \xE4r fr\xE5n lanseringen. S\xE5 h\xE4r h\xE5ller ni sidan levande utan att det tar tid.":"Many websites are at their best the day they launch and then nothing happens for three years. The prices are old, the staff has changed and the latest news is from the launch. Here is how to keep the site alive without it taking time.","En g\xE5ng i m\xE5naden, tio minuter":"Once a month, ten minutes","L\xE4gg upp ett nytt jobb med en bild.":"Post a new job with a photo.","Kolla att priser och \xF6ppettider st\xE4mmer.":"Check that prices and opening hours are correct.","L\xE4s recensionerna p\xE5 Google och svara.":"Read the Google reviews and reply.","En g\xE5ng om \xE5ret":"Once a year","Byt ut bilder som b\xF6rjat k\xE4nnas gamla.":"Replace photos that have started to feel old.","Testa hastigheten och att allt fungerar i mobilen.":"Test the speed and that everything works on the phone.","L\xE4s igenom texterna: st\xE4mmer det fortfarande med vad ni g\xF6r?":"Read through the copy: does it still match what you do?","Det ni inte ska beh\xF6va t\xE4nka p\xE5":"What you should not have to think about","S\xE4kerhetsuppdateringar, certifikat, s\xE4kerhetskopior och att servern \xE4r uppe. Det ska n\xE5gon annan sk\xF6ta. En sida byggd utan tunga till\xE4gg har dessutom v\xE4ldigt lite som kan g\xE5 s\xF6nder.":"Security updates, certificates, backups and keeping the server up. Someone else should handle that. A site built without heavy plugins also has very little that can break.","S\xE5 funkar det hos oss":"How it works with us",'Drift och en l\xE5g \xE5rsavgift ing\xE5r, och \xE4ndringar g\xF6r vi \xE5t er. L\xE4s mer om <a href="tjanster/support-och-underhall.html">support och underh\xE5ll</a> och vad som ing\xE5r i <a href="priser.html">priserna</a>.':'Hosting and a low yearly fee are included, and we make the changes for you. Read more about <a href="tjanster/support-och-underhall.html">support and maintenance</a> and what is included in <a href="priser.html">the prices</a>.',"Drift och en l\xE5g \xE5rsavgift ing\xE5r, och \xE4ndringar g\xF6r vi \xE5t er. L\xE4s mer om":"Hosting and a low yearly fee are included, and we make the changes for you. Read more about","support och underh\xE5ll":"support and maintenance","och vad som ing\xE5r i":"and what is included in",priserna:"the prices",Support:"Support","F\xF6re och efter: Alvhem St\xE4ds nya hemsida":"Before and after: Alvhem St\xE4d's new website","F\xF6re och efter: Alvhem St\xE4ds nya hemsida | Elevate Studio":"Before and after: Alvhem St\xE4d's new website | Elevate Studio","Alvhem St\xE4d i \xC4lv\xE4ngen hade en hemsida som fanns, men som inte gjorde n\xE5got. Vi byggde en ny fr\xE5n grunden. H\xE4r \xE4r vad som \xE4ndrades och varf\xF6r.":"Alvhem St\xE4d in \xC4lv\xE4ngen had a website that existed, but did nothing. We built a new one from scratch. Here is what changed and why.","Det som var problemet":"What the problem was","Tj\xE4nsterna l\xE5g samlade p\xE5 en sida, priserna saknades och enda s\xE4ttet att komma i kontakt var ett formul\xE4r l\xE4ngst ner. Den som s\xF6kte p\xE5 \u201Dflyttst\xE4dning \xC4lv\xE4ngen\u201D hittade ingen sida om just det.":"The services sat together on one page, prices were missing and the only way to get in touch was a form at the bottom. Someone searching for \u201Cmove-out cleaning \xC4lv\xE4ngen\u201D found no page about exactly that.","Det vi gjorde":"What we did","Film i toppen som visar jobbet.":"A film at the top that shows the work.","En egen sida f\xF6r varje st\xE4dtj\xE4nst, med pris.":"A page of its own for every cleaning service, with a price.","En priskalkyl som r\xE4knar av RUT-avdraget direkt.":"A price calculator that deducts the RUT tax reduction right away.","Bokning av uppstartsm\xF6te fr\xE5n varje sida.":"Booking of a start-up meeting from every page.","Allt anpassat f\xF6r mobilen f\xF6rst.":"Everything built for mobile first.","Se det sj\xE4lv":"See it yourself",'P\xE5 <a href="projekt/alvhem-stad.html">projektsidan</a> kan ni dra i ett reglage och j\xE4mf\xF6ra den gamla sidan med den nya. Fler sajter vi byggt finns under <a href="byggda-hemsidor.html">Hemsidor vi byggt</a>.':'On the <a href="projekt/alvhem-stad.html">project page</a> you can drag a slider and compare the old site with the new one. More sites we have built are under <a href="byggda-hemsidor.html">Websites we have built</a>.',"kan ni dra i ett reglage och j\xE4mf\xF6ra den gamla sidan med den nya. Fler sajter vi byggt finns under":"you can drag a slider and compare the old site with the new one. More sites we have built are under","Fem saker att fixa p\xE5 hemsidan i januari | Elevate Studio":"Five things to fix on your website in January | Elevate Studio","En l\xE5ngsam sida tappar bes\xF6kare innan den ens har laddat. Stora bilder \xE4r den vanligaste orsaken. V\xE5rt verktyg":"A slow page loses visitors before it has even loaded. Large images are the most common cause. Our tool","ger ett betyg p\xE5 prestanda, tillg\xE4nglighet och SEO p\xE5 ungef\xE4r en halv minut.":"grades performance, accessibility and SEO in about half a minute.","Vi g\xE5r igenom hemsidan gratis och s\xE4ger vad som \xE4r v\xE4rt att \xE4ndra. Och beh\xF6ver ni en ny:":"We go through the website for free and tell you what is worth changing. And if you need a new one:","v\xE5ra priser":"our prices","\xE4r fasta, fr\xE5n 3 000 kr.":"are fixed, from 3,000 kr.","Google-f\xF6retagsprofil: det viktigaste ni kan g\xF6ra gratis | Elevate Studio":"Google Business Profile: the most important thing you can do for free | Elevate Studio","Samma f\xF6retagsnamn, samma adress, samma telefonnummer. Och hemsidan ska ha tydliga sidor f\xF6r de tj\xE4nster ni angett i profilen. Det \xE4r s\xE5 Google kopplar ihop dem. L\xE4s mer om hur vi jobbar med":"Same business name, same address, same phone number. And the website should have clear pages for the services you listed in the profile. That is how Google connects them. Read more about how we work with",".":".","Vad \xE4r AI-optimering, och varf\xF6r pratar alla om det? | Elevate Studio":"What is AI optimisation, and why is everyone talking about it? | Elevate Studio","Grundl\xE4ggande SEO och AI-optimering ing\xE5r i alla hemsidor vi bygger. L\xE4s mer om":"Basic SEO and AI optimisation are included in every website we build. Read more about","hur vi g\xF6r":"how we do it","Bokningssystem f\xF6r hantverkare: slipp telefonen i bilen | Elevate Studio":"Booking systems for tradespeople: stop taking calls in the van | Elevate Studio","Vi bygger":"We build",bokningssystem:"booking systems","som en del av hemsidan, till fast pris. Det kopplas till er kalender och fungerar i mobilen.":"as part of the website, at a fixed price. It connects to your calendar and works on the phone.","Mobilen f\xF6rst: s\xE5 ser kunderna faktiskt er hemsida | Elevate Studio":"Mobile first: how customers actually see your website | Elevate Studio",P\u00E5:"On the",projektsidan:"projects page","kan ni se samma hemsida p\xE5 dator och mobil, sida vid sida.":"you can see the same website on desktop and mobile, side by side.","Sommarkoll p\xE5 hemsidan innan semestern | Elevate Studio":"A summer check of the website before the holidays | Elevate Studio","Ett automatiskt svar p\xE5 f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar, med samma information och ett nummer f\xF6r akuta \xE4renden om ni har ett, g\xF6r att kunden k\xE4nner sig sedd. Har ni en":"An automatic reply to enquiries, with the same information and a number for urgent matters if you have one, makes the customer feel seen. If you have an","svarar den p\xE5 vanliga fr\xE5gor \xE4ven n\xE4r ni ligger i h\xE4ngmattan.":"it answers common questions even while you are in the hammock.","Texter som kunder faktiskt l\xE4ser | Elevate Studio":"Copy customers actually read | Elevate Studio","Varje sida ska sluta med en sak att g\xF6ra: ring, boka, skicka en f\xF6rfr\xE5gan. En knapp, inte tre. Vi skriver texterna till de hemsidor vi bygger tillsammans med kunden, utifr\xE5n hur de sj\xE4lva pratar om jobbet. L\xE4s mer om":"Every page should end with one thing to do: call, book, send an enquiry. One button, not three. We write the copy for the websites we build together with the customer, based on how they talk about the job themselves. Read more about","hur vi bygger hemsidor":"how we build websites","Offertfl\xF6de: f\xE5 in r\xE4tt f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar, inte bara fler | Elevate Studio":"Quote flow: get the right enquiries, not just more | Elevate Studio",V\u00E5rt:"Our",offertsystem:"quote system","ger er en lista med alla f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar, status p\xE5 varje, och en offert som PDF n\xE4r ni \xE4r redo att skicka den.":"gives you a list of every enquiry, a status on each, and a quote as a PDF when you are ready to send it.","Snabb hemsida sl\xE5r snygg hemsida | Elevate Studio":"A fast website beats a pretty one | Elevate Studio","K\xF6r sidan genom":"Run the page through",". Ni f\xE5r ett betyg f\xF6r prestanda och en lista p\xE5 vad som drar ner det. Betyget f\xF6r mobilen \xE4r det som r\xE4knas.":". You get a performance grade and a list of what drags it down. The mobile grade is the one that counts.","De hemsidor vi bygger \xE4r statiska sidor utan tunga till\xE4gg, med bilder i r\xE4tt storlek och snabb leverans \xF6ver hela v\xE4rlden. Det \xE4r en av anledningarna till att vi kan h\xE5lla":"The websites we build are static pages without heavy plugins, with images in the right size and fast delivery worldwide. It is one of the reasons we can keep",": det finns inget som g\xE5r s\xF6nder och beh\xF6ver lappas.":": there is nothing that breaks and needs patching.","Fem saker att fixa p\xE5 hemsidan i januari":"Five things to fix on your website in January","Januari \xE4r den lugnaste m\xE5naden f\xF6r m\xE5nga f\xF6retag, och den b\xE4sta att l\xE4gga en timme p\xE5 hemsidan. H\xE4r \xE4r fem saker som n\xE4stan alltid g\xE5r att f\xF6rb\xE4ttra, i den ordning de brukar ge mest.":"January is the quietest month for many businesses, and the best one to spend an hour on the website. Here are five things that almost always can be improved, in the order they usually pay off.","1. Kolla att telefonnumret g\xE5r att trycka p\xE5":"1. Check that the phone number can be tapped","\xD6ppna hemsidan i mobilen och tryck p\xE5 numret. Ringer det inte direkt \xE4r det ett vanligt textf\xE4lt, och d\xE5 tappar ni samtal varje dag. Samma sak med e-postadressen: den ska \xF6ppna mejlprogrammet.":"Open the website on your phone and tap the number. If it does not call right away it is a plain text field, and you lose calls every day. Same with the e-mail address: it should open the mail app.","2. Uppdatera det som har \xE4ndrats":"2. Update what has changed","\xD6ppettider, priser och vilka omr\xE5den ni jobbar i.":"Opening hours, prices and the areas you work in.","Personer som slutat eller b\xF6rjat.":"People who have left or joined.","\xC5rtalet i sidfoten, om det st\xE5r d\xE4r.":"The year in the footer, if it is there.","Bilder som inte l\xE4ngre visar hur det ser ut hos er.":"Photos that no longer show what your place looks like.","3. L\xE4s texten som en kund":"3. Read the copy as a customer would","Bes\xF6karen vill veta tre saker inom n\xE5gra sekunder: vad g\xF6r ni, var g\xF6r ni det och hur tar jag kontakt. St\xE5r det inte i toppen av startsidan, flytta dit det. Allt annat kan komma l\xE4ngre ner.":"A visitor wants to know three things within a few seconds: what you do, where you do it and how to get in touch. If that is not at the top of the start page, move it there. Everything else can come further down.","4. Testa hastigheten":"4. Test the speed",'En l\xE5ngsam sida tappar bes\xF6kare innan den ens har laddat. Stora bilder \xE4r den vanligaste orsaken. V\xE5rt verktyg <a href="testa.html">Testa din sajt</a> ger ett betyg p\xE5 prestanda, tillg\xE4nglighet och SEO p\xE5 ungef\xE4r en halv minut.':'A slow page loses visitors before it has even loaded. Large images are the most common cause. Our tool <a href="testa.html">Test your site</a> grades performance, accessibility and SEO in about half a minute.',"5. Be om en recension":"5. Ask for a review","N\xF6jda kunder fr\xE5n h\xF6sten har inte gl\xF6mt er \xE4n. Ett kort mejl med l\xE4nk till er Google-profil r\xE4cker. Recensionerna syns b\xE5de p\xE5 Google och, om ni l\xE4gger in dem, p\xE5 hemsidan.":"Happy customers from the autumn have not forgotten you yet. A short e-mail with a link to your Google profile is enough. The reviews show both on Google and, if you add them, on the website.","Vill ni ha hj\xE4lp?":"Want help?",'Vi g\xE5r igenom hemsidan gratis och s\xE4ger vad som \xE4r v\xE4rt att \xE4ndra. Och beh\xF6ver ni en ny: <a href="priser.html">v\xE5ra priser</a> \xE4r fasta, fr\xE5n 3 000 kr.':'We go through the website for free and tell you what is worth changing. And if you need a new one: <a href="priser.html">our prices</a> are fixed, from 3,000 kr.',"Google-f\xF6retagsprofil: det viktigaste ni kan g\xF6ra gratis":"Google Business Profile: the most important thing you can do for free","N\xE4r n\xE5gon s\xF6ker p\xE5 en tj\xE4nst och en ort visar Google f\xF6rst kartan med tre f\xF6retag. Att hamna d\xE4r kostar inget, men kr\xE4ver att er f\xF6retagsprofil \xE4r komplett och levande. S\xE5 h\xE4r g\xF6r ni.":"When someone searches for a service and a town, Google first shows the map with three businesses. Getting there costs nothing, but your business profile has to be complete and alive. Here is how.","Fyll i allt":"Fill in everything","R\xE4tt kategori f\xF6rst, till exempel Byggfirma eller St\xE4dfirma, och g\xE4rna fler kategorier f\xF6r det ni ocks\xE5 g\xF6r.":"The right category first, for example Builder or Cleaning service, and more categories for what else you do.","Omr\xE5de ni jobbar i, \xF6ppettider och telefonnummer som st\xE4mmer med hemsidan.":"The area you work in, opening hours and a phone number that matches the website.","L\xE4nk till hemsidan, helst till startsidan.":"A link to the website, preferably the start page.","Egna bilder: verkstaden, bilarna, teamet, f\xE4rdiga jobb.":"Your own photos: the workshop, the vans, the team, finished jobs.","Recensioner v\xE4ger tyngst":"Reviews weigh the most","Antalet recensioner och hur nya de \xE4r p\xE5verkar placeringen mer \xE4n n\xE5got annat ni kan styra sj\xE4lva. Be varje n\xF6jd kund om en recension, direkt efter avslutat jobb, med en l\xE4nk som g\xE5r rakt till rutan d\xE4r de skriver. Svara p\xE5 alla recensioner, \xE4ven de korta.":"The number of reviews and how recent they are affect your position more than anything else you control. Ask every happy customer for a review right after the job, with a link straight to the box where they write. Reply to every review, even the short ones.","H\xE5ll profilen levande":"Keep the profile alive","L\xE4gg upp ett inl\xE4gg d\xE5 och d\xE5: ett nytt jobb, en ny tj\xE4nst, ett tips. Det beh\xF6ver inte vara l\xE5ngt. Google ser att profilen sk\xF6ts, och kunder ser att ni finns.":"Post now and then: a new job, a new service, a tip. It does not have to be long. Google sees that the profile is maintained, and customers see that you exist.","Hemsidan och profilen ska s\xE4ga samma sak":"The website and the profile should say the same thing",'Samma f\xF6retagsnamn, samma adress, samma telefonnummer. Och hemsidan ska ha tydliga sidor f\xF6r de tj\xE4nster ni angett i profilen. Det \xE4r s\xE5 Google kopplar ihop dem. L\xE4s mer om hur vi jobbar med <a href="tjanster/seo-och-ai-optimering.html">SEO och AI-optimering</a>.':'Same business name, same address, same phone number. And the website should have clear pages for the services you listed in the profile. That is how Google connects them. Read more about how we work with <a href="tjanster/seo-och-ai-optimering.html">SEO and AI optimisation</a>.',SEO:"SEO","Vad \xE4r AI-optimering, och varf\xF6r pratar alla om det?":"What is AI optimisation, and why is everyone talking about it?","Allt fler fr\xE5gar en AI-assistent i st\xE4llet f\xF6r att googla: \u201DVilken elektriker i Uppsala kan komma den h\xE4r veckan?\u201D Svaret bygger p\xE5 det som finns att l\xE4sa om f\xF6retagen p\xE5 n\xE4tet. AI-optimering, ibland kallat AIO, handlar om att g\xF6ra ert f\xF6retag l\xE4tt att f\xF6rst\xE5 och \xE5terge f\xF6r de h\xE4r tj\xE4nsterna.":"More and more people ask an AI assistant instead of googling: \u201CWhich electrician in Uppsala can come this week?\u201D The answer is built from what can be read about the businesses online. AI optimisation, sometimes called AIO, is about making your business easy for these services to understand and repeat.","Vad AI-tj\xE4nsterna faktiskt l\xE4ser":"What the AI services actually read","Text p\xE5 hemsidan, i klartext. Inte text i bilder.":"Text on the website, as plain text. Not text inside images.","Strukturerad data: en osynlig beskrivning av f\xF6retaget som anger namn, ort, tj\xE4nster och telefonnummer p\xE5 ett s\xE4tt maskiner f\xF6rst\xE5r.":"Structured data: an invisible description of the business stating name, town, services and phone number in a way machines understand.","Er Google-profil och recensionerna d\xE4r.":"Your Google profile and the reviews on it.","Vanliga fr\xE5gor med raka svar.":"Frequently asked questions with straight answers.","S\xE5 skriver ni f\xF6r b\xE5de m\xE4nniskor och AI":"How to write for both people and AI","Skriv som ni skulle svara i telefon. \u201DVi bygger altaner i Uppsala och Knivsta, de flesta jobb tar en till tv\xE5 veckor, och vi ger alltid fast pris.\u201D Den meningen kan en AI \xE5terge ordagrant. \u201DVi levererar kundanpassade l\xF6sningar med h\xF6g kvalitet\u201D kan den inte g\xF6ra n\xE5got av.":"Write the way you would answer on the phone. \u201CWe build decks in Uppsala and Knivsta, most jobs take one to two weeks, and we always quote a fixed price.\u201D An AI can repeat that sentence word for word. \u201CWe deliver tailored solutions of high quality\u201D gives it nothing to work with.","Det \xE4r samma jobb som vanlig SEO":"It is the same job as ordinary SEO","Tydliga tj\xE4nstesidor, orten utskriven, snabb sida och en komplett Google-profil. Det som g\xF6r att Google hittar er g\xF6r att AI-tj\xE4nsterna g\xF6r det ocks\xE5. Skillnaden \xE4r att AI:n g\xE4rna vill ha fullst\xE4ndiga meningar och svar p\xE5 fr\xE5gor, inte bara nyckelord.":"Clear service pages, the town spelled out, a fast page and a complete Google profile. What makes Google find you makes the AI services find you too. The difference is that the AI prefers full sentences and answers to questions, not just keywords.",'Grundl\xE4ggande SEO och AI-optimering ing\xE5r i alla hemsidor vi bygger. L\xE4s mer om <a href="tjanster/seo-och-ai-optimering.html">hur vi g\xF6r</a>.':'Basic SEO and AI optimisation are included in every website we build. Read more about <a href="tjanster/seo-och-ai-optimering.html">how we do it</a>.',AI:"AI","Bokningssystem f\xF6r hantverkare: slipp telefonen i bilen":"Booking systems for tradespeople: stop taking calls in the van","De flesta hantverkare f\xE5r sina f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar i telefon, mitt i ett jobb. Samtal missas, lappar f\xF6rsvinner och kunden ringer n\xE4sta firma. Ett bokningssystem p\xE5 hemsidan l\xE5ter kunden v\xE4lja tid sj\xE4lv, dygnet runt, och ni ser allt samlat.":"Most tradespeople get their enquiries by phone, in the middle of a job. Calls are missed, notes get lost and the customer calls the next company. A booking system on the website lets the customer pick a time themselves, around the clock, and you see everything in one place.","Vad som ska g\xE5 att boka":"What should be bookable","Ett kostnadsfritt hembes\xF6k eller platsbes\xF6k, i tider ni sj\xE4lva best\xE4mmer.":"A free home visit or site visit, at times you decide.","Ett kort telefonm\xF6te f\xF6r att g\xE5 igenom ett projekt.":"A short phone call to go through a project.","F\xF6r vissa branscher sj\xE4lva jobbet: f\xF6nsterputs, st\xE4dning, service.":"In some trades the job itself: window cleaning, cleaning, servicing.","Det som g\xF6r att det funkar i praktiken":"What makes it work in practice","Kalendern visar bara tider ni faktiskt \xE4r lediga, kopplad till den kalender ni redan anv\xE4nder.":"The calendar only shows times you are actually free, connected to the calendar you already use.","Kunden f\xE5r en bekr\xE4ftelse direkt, med tid och adress, och en p\xE5minnelse dagen innan.":"The customer gets a confirmation right away, with time and address, and a reminder the day before.","Ni f\xE5r ett mejl eller sms per bokning, med namn, telefonnummer och vad det g\xE4ller.":"You get an e-mail or text per booking, with name, phone number and what it concerns.","Det g\xE5r att boka fr\xE5n varje sida, inte bara kontaktsidan.":"It can be booked from every page, not just the contact page.","Vad det inneb\xE4r f\xF6r kunden":"What it means for the customer","Den som sitter med ett l\xE4ckande tak klockan nio p\xE5 kv\xE4llen vill inte v\xE4nta till morgonen. Kan hen boka ett bes\xF6k direkt \xE4r chansen stor att ni f\xE5r jobbet, oavsett vem som har b\xE4st pris.":"Someone with a leaking roof at nine in the evening does not want to wait until morning. If they can book a visit right away, chances are you get the job, whoever has the best price.",'Vi bygger <a href="tjanster/bokningssystem.html">bokningssystem</a> som en del av hemsidan, till fast pris. Det kopplas till er kalender och fungerar i mobilen.':'We build <a href="tjanster/bokningssystem.html">booking systems</a> as part of the website, at a fixed price. It connects to your calendar and works on the phone.',Bokning:"Booking",Hantverkare:"Tradespeople","Mobilen f\xF6rst: s\xE5 ser kunderna faktiskt er hemsida":"Mobile first: how customers actually see your website","De flesta som bes\xF6ker ett lokalt f\xF6retags hemsida g\xF6r det fr\xE5n mobilen, ofta p\xE5 v\xE4g n\xE5gonstans. \xC4nd\xE5 designas m\xE5nga sidor p\xE5 en stor sk\xE4rm och krymps sedan ner. Resultatet \xE4r sm\xE5 knappar, text som inte g\xE5r att l\xE4sa och menyer som inte g\xE5r att \xF6ppna.":"Most people who visit a local business's website do it from the phone, often on the way somewhere. Yet many sites are designed on a big screen and then shrunk down. The result is tiny buttons, unreadable text and menus that will not open.","S\xE5 testar ni p\xE5 tv\xE5 minuter":"How to test it in two minutes","\xD6ppna hemsidan i mobilen utan att zooma. G\xE5r texten att l\xE4sa?":"Open the website on the phone without zooming. Can you read the text?","G\xE5r det att trycka p\xE5 telefonnumret och p\xE5 knappen f\xF6r att skicka en f\xF6rfr\xE5gan med tummen?":"Can you tap the phone number and the enquiry button with your thumb?","Syns vad ni g\xF6r och var ni finns innan man scrollar?":"Can you see what you do and where you are before scrolling?","Laddar sidan p\xE5 mobiln\xE4t, inte bara p\xE5 wifi?":"Does the page load on mobile data, not just on wifi?","Vad mobilen f\xF6rst betyder n\xE4r vi bygger":"What mobile first means when we build","Vi ritar mobilversionen f\xF6rst och l\xE5ter datorversionen v\xE4xa ur den. Det tvingar fram prioriteringar: det viktigaste h\xF6gst upp, en sak per sk\xE4rm, stora tryckytor. Datorversionen blir sedan en luftigare variant av samma sida, inte en annan sida.":"We draw the mobile version first and let the desktop version grow out of it. That forces priorities: the most important thing at the top, one thing per screen, big tap targets. The desktop version then becomes a roomier variant of the same page, not a different page.","Google m\xE4ter mobilversionen":"Google measures the mobile version","Google bed\xF6mer er sida utifr\xE5n hur den fungerar i mobilen, inte p\xE5 datorn. En sida som \xE4r l\xE5ngsam eller sv\xE5rl\xE4st i mobilen hamnar l\xE4ngre ner i resultaten, hur bra den \xE4n ser ut p\xE5 en stor sk\xE4rm.":"Google judges your page by how it works on the phone, not on the desktop. A page that is slow or hard to read on the phone ends up further down in the results, however good it looks on a big screen.",'P\xE5 <a href="projekt/index.html">projektsidan</a> kan ni se samma hemsida p\xE5 dator och mobil, sida vid sida.':'On the <a href="projekt/index.html">projects page</a> you can see the same website on desktop and mobile, side by side.',"Sommarkoll p\xE5 hemsidan innan semestern":"A summer check of the website before the holidays","Under semestern jobbar hemsidan \xE5t er n\xE4r ni inte g\xF6r det. Men bara om den s\xE4ger r\xE4tt saker. H\xE4r \xE4r det som brukar beh\xF6va \xE4ndras innan ni st\xE4nger.":"During the holidays the website works for you when you do not. But only if it says the right things. Here is what usually needs changing before you close.","Skriv ut n\xE4r ni \xE4r tillbaka":"Say when you are back","En rad h\xF6gst upp p\xE5 startsidan r\xE4cker: \u201DVi har semester 13 juli till 3 augusti och svarar p\xE5 alla f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar n\xE4r vi \xE4r tillbaka.\u201D Den som skickar en f\xF6rfr\xE5gan vet d\xE5 varf\xF6r det dr\xF6jer, och v\xE4ljer inte bort er.":"One line at the top of the start page is enough: \u201CWe are on holiday 13 July to 3 August and answer all enquiries when we are back.\u201D Whoever sends an enquiry then knows why it takes time, and does not rule you out.","L\xE5t formul\xE4ret svara \xE5t er":"Let the form answer for you",'Ett automatiskt svar p\xE5 f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar, med samma information och ett nummer f\xF6r akuta \xE4renden om ni har ett, g\xF6r att kunden k\xE4nner sig sedd. Har ni en <a href="tjanster/ai-chatt.html">AI-chatt</a> svarar den p\xE5 vanliga fr\xE5gor \xE4ven n\xE4r ni ligger i h\xE4ngmattan.':'An automatic reply to enquiries, with the same information and a number for urgent matters if you have one, makes the customer feel seen. If you have an <a href="tjanster/ai-chatt.html">AI chat</a> it answers common questions even while you are in the hammock.',"Passa p\xE5 att samla in jobb f\xF6r h\xF6sten":"Use the time to line up autumn jobs","L\xE4gg till en rad om att ni tar emot bokningar f\xF6r augusti och september.":"Add a line saying you are taking bookings for August and September.","Lyft de tj\xE4nster som s\xE4ljer b\xE4st p\xE5 h\xF6sten.":"Highlight the services that sell best in the autumn.","L\xE4gg upp bilder p\xE5 v\xE5rens jobb medan de \xE4r f\xE4rska.":"Post photos of the spring's jobs while they are fresh.","Efter semestern":"After the holidays","Ta bort semesterraden f\xF6rsta dagen tillbaka. En hemsida som i september fortfarande s\xE4ger att ni har semester ser ut som att ingen bryr sig om den.":"Remove the holiday line on the first day back. A website that still says you are on holiday in September looks like nobody cares about it.",Tips:"Tips","Texter som kunder faktiskt l\xE4ser":"Copy customers actually read","Den vanligaste texten p\xE5 svenska f\xF6retags hemsidor b\xF6rjar med \u201DVi \xE4r ett f\xF6retag med l\xE5ng erfarenhet och h\xF6g kvalitet\u201D. Ingen kund har n\xE5gonsin valt en firma p\xE5 grund av den meningen. S\xE5 h\xE4r skriver ni i st\xE4llet.":"The most common copy on Swedish business websites starts with \u201CWe are a company with long experience and high quality\u201D. No customer has ever chosen a firm because of that sentence. Here is how to write instead.","B\xF6rja med kundens fr\xE5ga":"Start with the customer's question","Bes\xF6karen har ett problem: ett badrum som ska renoveras, ett kontor som ska st\xE4das. B\xF6rja d\xE4r. \u201DSka ni renovera badrummet? Vi g\xF6r allt fr\xE5n rivning till kakel, i Uppsala med omnejd, till fast pris.\u201D Nu vet kunden att hen \xE4r p\xE5 r\xE4tt sida.":"The visitor has a problem: a bathroom to renovate, an office to clean. Start there. \u201CRenovating the bathroom? We do everything from demolition to tiling, in Uppsala and around, at a fixed price.\u201D Now the customer knows they are on the right page.","Korta meningar, konkreta ord":"Short sentences, concrete words","Skriv \u201Dvi kommer inom tv\xE5 dagar\u201D i st\xE4llet f\xF6r \u201Dsnabb service\u201D.":"Write \u201Cwe come within two days\u201D instead of \u201Cfast service\u201D.","Skriv \u201Dfast pris innan vi b\xF6rjar\u201D i st\xE4llet f\xF6r \u201Dkonkurrenskraftiga priser\u201D.":"Write \u201Cfixed price before we start\u201D instead of \u201Ccompetitive prices\u201D.","Skriv \u201DAnna svarar i telefon\u201D i st\xE4llet f\xF6r \u201Dpersonlig service\u201D.":"Write \u201CAnna answers the phone\u201D instead of \u201Cpersonal service\u201D.","En tanke per mening. Stryk varje ord som inte beh\xF6vs.":"One thought per sentence. Cut every word that is not needed.","Rubriker som g\xE5r att skumma":"Headings you can skim","De flesta l\xE4ser inte, de skummar. Rubrikerna ska d\xE4rf\xF6r ber\xE4tta hela historien sj\xE4lva: Vad vi g\xF6r, Var vi jobbar, Vad det kostar, S\xE5 kommer ni ig\xE5ng. Den som bara l\xE4ser rubrikerna ska \xE4nd\xE5 f\xF6rst\xE5 vad ni erbjuder.":"Most people do not read, they skim. The headings should therefore tell the whole story on their own: What we do, Where we work, What it costs, How to get started. Someone who reads only the headings should still understand what you offer.","Avsluta med n\xE4sta steg":"End with the next step",'Varje sida ska sluta med en sak att g\xF6ra: ring, boka, skicka en f\xF6rfr\xE5gan. En knapp, inte tre. Vi skriver texterna till de hemsidor vi bygger tillsammans med kunden, utifr\xE5n hur de sj\xE4lva pratar om jobbet. L\xE4s mer om <a href="tjanster/hemsidor.html">hur vi bygger hemsidor</a>.':'Every page should end with one thing to do: call, book, send an enquiry. One button, not three. We write the copy for the websites we build together with the customer, based on how they talk about the job themselves. Read more about <a href="tjanster/hemsidor.html">how we build websites</a>.',"Offertfl\xF6de: f\xE5 in r\xE4tt f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar, inte bara fler":"Quote flow: get the right enquiries, not just more","Fler f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar l\xE5ter bra tills h\xE4lften av dem g\xE4ller jobb ni inte g\xF6r, i omr\xE5den ni inte \xE5ker till. Ett bra offertformul\xE4r sorterar innan ni lyfter luren, och ger er det underlag ni beh\xF6ver f\xF6r att svara snabbt.":"More enquiries sounds good until half of them are for jobs you do not do, in areas you do not drive to. A good quote form sorts before you pick up the phone, and gives you what you need to answer quickly.","Fr\xE5ga om det som avg\xF6r":"Ask about what matters","Vilken tj\xE4nst det g\xE4ller, som ett val i en lista, inte fritext.":"Which service it concerns, as a choice in a list, not free text.","Var jobbet ska g\xF6ras, s\xE5 ni direkt ser om det \xE4r inom ert omr\xE5de.":"Where the job is, so you see right away if it is within your area.","N\xE4r kunden vill ha det gjort.":"When the customer wants it done.","G\xE4rna en bild. Ett foto p\xE5 badrummet s\xE4ger mer \xE4n tre stycken text.":"Preferably a photo. A picture of the bathroom says more than three paragraphs.","Men inte mer \xE4n s\xE5":"But no more than that","Varje extra f\xE4lt g\xF6r att f\xE4rre skickar. Namn, telefon, tj\xE4nst, ort och ett fritextf\xE4lt r\xE4cker n\xE4stan alltid. Resten tar ni i samtalet.":"Every extra field means fewer people send. Name, phone, service, town and a free text field are almost always enough. The rest you take in the call.","Svara innan konkurrenten":"Answer before the competitor","Den som fr\xE5gar tre firmor v\xE4ljer ofta den som svarar f\xF6rst. Ett automatiskt svar direkt, \u201DTack, vi ringer dig i dag eller i morgon\u201D, k\xF6per er tid. Sedan ska f\xF6rfr\xE5gan ligga n\xE5gonstans d\xE4r ni ser den: inte bara i en inkorg som fylls p\xE5 med annat.":"Someone who asks three firms often picks the one that answers first. An automatic reply right away, \u201CThanks, we will call you today or tomorrow\u201D, buys you time. Then the enquiry needs to sit somewhere you see it: not just in an inbox that fills up with other things.",'V\xE5rt <a href="tjanster/offertsystem.html">offertsystem</a> ger er en lista med alla f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar, status p\xE5 varje, och en offert som PDF n\xE4r ni \xE4r redo att skicka den.':'Our <a href="tjanster/offertsystem.html">quote system</a> gives you a list of every enquiry, a status on each, and a quote as a PDF when you are ready to send it.',"Snabb hemsida sl\xE5r snygg hemsida":"A fast website beats a pretty one","En hemsida som laddar l\xE5ngsamt tappar bes\xF6kare innan de sett en enda bild, hur vacker den \xE4n \xE4r. Hastighet \xE4r dessutom en av de saker Google v\xE4ger in n\xE4r resultaten rankas. H\xE4r \xE4r vad som brukar g\xF6ra sidor l\xE5ngsamma, och vad som g\xE5r att g\xF6ra.":"A website that loads slowly loses visitors before they have seen a single picture, however beautiful it is. Speed is also one of the things Google weighs when ranking results. Here is what usually makes pages slow, and what can be done.","De vanligaste bovarna":"The usual suspects","Bilder rakt fr\xE5n mobilkameran, flera megabyte styck, som visas i frim\xE4rksstorlek.":"Photos straight from the phone camera, several megabytes each, shown at stamp size.","Till\xE4gg och skript som laddas p\xE5 varje sida men bara anv\xE4nds p\xE5 en.":"Plugins and scripts loaded on every page but used on one.","Typsnitt och bibliotek som h\xE4mtas fr\xE5n flera olika st\xE4llen.":"Fonts and libraries fetched from several different places.","Ett webbhotell som delas med hundratals andra sajter.":"Web hosting shared with hundreds of other sites.","Vad som g\xE5r att g\xF6ra":"What can be done","Bilder ska skalas ner till den storlek de visas i och sparas i ett modernt format. Skript som inte beh\xF6vs ska bort. Sidan ska ligga p\xE5 en server n\xE4ra bes\xF6karna. Mycket av det h\xE4r g\xE5r att fixa p\xE5 en befintlig sida, resten kr\xE4ver att sidan byggs om.":"Images should be scaled down to the size they are shown at and saved in a modern format. Scripts that are not needed should go. The page should sit on a server close to the visitors. Much of this can be fixed on an existing site, the rest requires rebuilding it.","M\xE4t innan ni gissar":"Measure before you guess",'K\xF6r sidan genom <a href="testa.html">Testa din sajt</a>. Ni f\xE5r ett betyg f\xF6r prestanda och en lista p\xE5 vad som drar ner det. Betyget f\xF6r mobilen \xE4r det som r\xE4knas.':'Run the page through <a href="testa.html">Test your site</a>. You get a performance grade and a list of what drags it down. The mobile grade is the one that counts.',"S\xE5 bygger vi":"How we build",'De hemsidor vi bygger \xE4r statiska sidor utan tunga till\xE4gg, med bilder i r\xE4tt storlek och snabb leverans \xF6ver hela v\xE4rlden. Det \xE4r en av anledningarna till att vi kan h\xE5lla <a href="priser.html">fasta priser</a>: det finns inget som g\xE5r s\xF6nder och beh\xF6ver lappas.':'The websites we build are static pages without heavy plugins, with images in the right size and fast delivery worldwide. It is one of the reasons we can keep <a href="priser.html">fixed prices</a>: there is nothing that breaks and needs patching.',"Bes\xF6k Alvhem St\xE4d":"Visit Alvhem St\xE4d","Alvhem St\xE4d: fr\xE5n":"Alvhem St\xE4d: from","Dra i reglaget och j\xE4mf\xF6r Alvhem St\xE4ds gamla hemsida med den nya vi byggt.":"Drag the slider and compare Alvhem St\xE4d's old website with the new one we built.","Hemsidor vi":"Websites we have",byggt:"built","Riktiga kunder, riktiga sajter. Klicka p\xE5 ett kort s\xE5 \xF6ppnas hemsidan h\xE4r p\xE5 sidan.":"Real customers, real sites. Click a card and the website opens right here.","Haninge Byggteam AB logotyp":"Haninge Byggteam AB logo","Alvhem St\xE4d logotyp":"Alvhem St\xE4d logo","Markmontage BEAB AB logotyp":"Markmontage BEAB AB logo","Dator och mobil, samma sajt. Klicka p\xE5 ett kort s\xE5 \xF6ppnas hemsidan h\xE4r p\xE5 sidan, i dator- eller mobilvy.":"Desktop and mobile, the same site. Click a card and the website opens right here, in desktop or mobile view.","Haninge Byggteam renoverar k\xF6k, badrum och hela villor i Stockholm och p\xE5 S\xF6dert\xF6rn. Hemsidan \xE4r byggd runt en enda sak: att den som tittar ska be om en offert. D\xE4rf\xF6r ligger knappen F\xE5 gratis offert i varje del av sidan, projektgalleriet g\xE5r att filtrera p\xE5 k\xF6k, badrum, totalrenovering och utomhus, och deras 5,0 i Google-betyg syns redan i toppen.":"Haninge Byggteam renovates kitchens, bathrooms and whole houses in Stockholm and S\xF6dert\xF6rn. The website is built around one thing: that the visitor asks for a quote. So the Get a free quote button sits in every part of the page, the project gallery filters by kitchen, bathroom, full renovation and outdoors, and their 5.0 Google rating shows right at the top.","Alvhem St\xE4d erbjuder hemst\xE4dning, storst\xE4dning, flyttst\xE4dning och kontorsst\xE4dning till fasta priser. Sajten \xF6ppnar med en film som visar jobbet, varje st\xE4dtj\xE4nst har en egen sida med pris, och en kalkyl r\xE4knar av RUT-avdraget direkt s\xE5 kunden ser vad det kostar. Uppstartsm\xF6tet bokas fr\xE5n vilken sida som helst.":"Alvhem St\xE4d offers home cleaning, deep cleaning, move-out cleaning and office cleaning at fixed prices. The site opens with a film that shows the work, every service has its own page with a price, and a calculator deducts the Swedish RUT tax reduction right away so the customer sees the cost. The start-up meeting can be booked from any page.","Markmontage har gjort schakt, dr\xE4nering, grundl\xE4ggning och VA-arbeten sedan 2002 med 18 anst\xE4llda. Hemsidan presenterar sju tj\xE4nster p\xE5 egna sidor, visar utf\xF6rda uppdrag med egna bilder fr\xE5n arbetsplatserna och f\xF6rklarar steg f\xF6r steg hur ett markprojekt g\xE5r till, fr\xE5n kostnadsfritt hembes\xF6k till fast offert.":"Markmontage has done excavation, drainage, foundations and water and sewer work since 2002 with 18 employees. The website presents seven services on their own pages, shows completed jobs with their own photos from the sites and explains step by step how a groundworks project goes, from a free home visit to a fixed quote.","Bes\xF6k haningebyggteam.se":"Visit haningebyggteam.se","Bes\xF6k alvhemstad.se":"Visit alvhemstad.se","Bes\xF6k Markmontage BEAB AB":"Visit Markmontage BEAB AB","Haninge Byggteam AB p\xE5 en dator":"Haninge Byggteam AB on a desktop","Haninge Byggteam AB p\xE5 en mobil":"Haninge Byggteam AB on a phone","Alvhem St\xE4d p\xE5 en dator":"Alvhem St\xE4d on a laptop","Alvhem St\xE4d p\xE5 en mobil":"Alvhem St\xE4d on a phone","Markmontage BEAB AB p\xE5 en dator":"Markmontage BEAB AB on a desktop","Markmontage BEAB AB p\xE5 en mobil":"Markmontage BEAB AB on a phone","V\xE4ldigt n\xF6jd med hemsidan som Elevate Studio byggt \xE5t oss! Snygg design, smidig kontakt och bra hj\xE4lp hela v\xE4gen. Rekommenderas varmt till f\xF6retag som beh\xF6ver en ny hemsida.":"Very happy with the website Elevate Studio built for us! Great design, easy contact and good help all the way. Warmly recommended to companies that need a new website.","Hemsidor vi byggt":"Websites we have built","Hemsidor vi byggt \u2013 riktiga kunder, riktiga sajter":"Websites we have built \u2013 real customers, real sites","Ett urval av hemsidor vi byggt \xE5t f\xF6retag. Klicka p\xE5 en s\xE5 \xF6ppnas den h\xE4r p\xE5 sidan, i dator- eller mobilvy.":"A selection of websites we have built for companies. Click one and it opens right here, in desktop or mobile view.",F\u00F6rhandsvisa:"Preview",Dator:"Desktop",Mobil:"Mobile","\xD6ppna sajten":"Open the site",St\u00E4ng:"Close","St\xE4ng f\xF6rhandsvisningen":"Close the preview","Sajten gick inte att visa h\xE4r. \xD6ppna den i en ny flik i st\xE4llet.":"The site could not be shown here. Open it in a new tab instead.","Se hemsidor som Elevate Studio har byggt \xE5t riktiga f\xF6retag: byggfirma, st\xE4dfirma och markentreprenad. Bes\xF6k sajterna och se hur de fungerar p\xE5 dator och mobil.":"See websites Elevate Studio has built for real companies: a builder, a cleaning company and a groundworks contractor. Visit the sites and see how they work on desktop and mobile.","Varje hemsida \xE4r byggd fr\xE5n grunden f\xF6r f\xF6retaget bakom den: egna texter, egna bilder och kontakt eller offert p\xE5 varje sida. Vill ni se hur er egen skulle kunna se ut? H\xF6r av er, s\xE5 g\xF6r vi ett f\xF6rsta utkast.":"Every website is built from scratch for the company behind it: its own copy, its own photos and contact or quote on every page. Want to see what yours could look like? Get in touch and we will make a first draft.","Byggfirma i Stockholm":"Builder in Stockholm","St\xE4dfirma i \xC4lv\xE4ngen":"Cleaning company in \xC4lv\xE4ngen","Mark- och grundarbeten i Kung\xE4lv och G\xF6teborg":"Groundworks in Kung\xE4lv and Gothenburg","L\xE4s om projektet":"Read about the project","V\xE5ra kunder":"Our customers",Kunder:"Customers","Se hemsidor vi byggt":"See websites we have built",Projekt:"Projects","Vad vi g\xF6r":"What we do",Priser:"Prices",Kontakt:"Contact","Senaste nytt":"Latest news",Start:"Home","Fel 404":"Error 404","Syns ni n\xE4r kunder fr\xE5gar AI?":"Do you show up when customers ask AI?","Allt fler fr\xE5gar en AI-assistent i st\xE4llet f\xF6r att googla. Vi bygger hemsidan s\xE5 att b\xE5de Google och AI-tj\xE4nster beskriver er r\xE4tt.":"More and more people ask an AI assistant instead of googling. We build your website so that both Google and AI services describe you correctly.","L\xE4s mer":"Read more",Hemsidor:"Websites","Snabba, mobilanpassade hemsidor som visar vad ni g\xF6r och g\xF6r det enkelt f\xF6r kunderna att h\xF6ra av sig.":"Fast, mobile-friendly websites that show what you do and make it easy for customers to get in touch.","AI-chatt":"AI chat","En AI-chatt p\xE5 hemsidan som svarar p\xE5 kundernas vanliga fr\xE5gor, dygnet runt.":"An AI chat on your website that answers your customers' common questions, around the clock.",Bokningssystem:"Booking system","Ett bokningssystem p\xE5 hemsidan d\xE4r kunderna sj\xE4lva v\xE4ljer en tid som passar \u2013 med notiser till er via e-post och SMS.":"A booking system on your website where customers pick a time that suits them \u2013 with notifications to you by email and text message.",Offertsystem:"Quote system","Ett offertfl\xF6de p\xE5 hemsidan d\xE4r kunden beskriver jobbet steg f\xF6r steg, s\xE5 att ni f\xE5r allt ni beh\xF6ver f\xF6r att svara direkt.":"A quote form on your website where the customer describes the job step by step, so you get everything you need to reply right away.","SEO och AI-optimering":"SEO and AI optimisation","S\xF6kmotoroptimering och AI-optimering s\xE5 att kunderna hittar er \u2013 p\xE5 Google och n\xE4r de fr\xE5gar en AI.":"Search engine optimisation and AI optimisation so customers find you \u2013 on Google and when they ask an AI.","Support och underh\xE5ll":"Support and maintenance","Vi tar hand om \xE4ndringar, uppdateringar och uppf\xF6ljning s\xE5 att ni kan fokusera p\xE5 ert jobb.":"We take care of changes, updates and follow-up so you can focus on your work.",Meny:"Menu","Alla tj\xE4nster":"All services",Plattformar:"Platforms","Testa din sajt":"Test your site",Tj\u00E4nster:"Services","Om oss":"About us","Exempel p\xE5 webbavtal":"Example web agreement","Spr\xE5k / Language":"Spr\xE5k / Language","Har ni ett projekt p\xE5 g\xE5ng?":"Got a project in mind?","Vi svarar s\xE5 fort vi kan.":"We reply as soon as we can.","H\xF6r av er":"Get in touch","Hoppsan.":"Oops.","Den h\xE4r adressen leder ingenstans!":"This address leads nowhere!","Ingen fara, vi hittar r\xE4tt till slut.":"No worries, we'll find our way.","Medan vi letar efter sidan kan du passa p\xE5 att titta p\xE5 n\xE5gra av v\xE5ra exempel.":"While we look for the page, why not have a look at some of our examples.","Se exempel":"See examples","Hemsidor som ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar \u2013 byggda i Uppsala, f\xF6r f\xF6retag i hela Sverige.":"Websites that bring in enquiries \u2013 built in Uppsala, for businesses all over Sweden.","H\xF6r av er s\xE5 tar vi ett f\xF6rsta m\xF6te.":"Get in touch and we'll set up a first meeting.","F\xE5 v\xE5rt nyhetsbrev":"Get our newsletter","E-postadress":"Email address","N\xE4r du skickar formul\xE4ret godk\xE4nner du v\xE5r":"By sending the form you accept our",integritetspolicy:"privacy policy","Tekniken vi anv\xE4nder":"Our technology","Webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala":"Web agency in Uppsala","Hemsida f\xF6r hantverkare":"Websites for tradespeople","Billig hemsida":"Affordable website","Ring oss":"Call us","Ring 076-022 83 61":"Call +46 76 022 83 61","Vi bygger snabba, mobilanpassade hemsidor f\xF6r f\xF6retag i alla storlekar \u2013 med fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr. Webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala, kunder i hela Sverige.":"We build fast, mobile-friendly websites for businesses of every size \u2013 at a fixed price from SEK 3,000. Web agency in Uppsala, customers across Sweden.","Bygger ni hemsidor f\xF6r alla typer av f\xF6retag?":"Do you build websites for all kinds of businesses?","Ja. Vi bygger hemsidor f\xF6r f\xF6retag i alla storlekar \u2013 fr\xE5n enmansf\xF6retag till st\xF6rre bolag med flera avdelningar och system som ska kopplas ihop. St\xF6rre projekt f\xE5r ett fast pris i en offert.":"Yes. We build websites for businesses of every size \u2013 from sole traders to larger companies with several departments and systems to connect. Larger projects get a fixed price in a quote.","Vilka passar offertsystemet f\xF6r?":"Who is the quote system for?","Alla f\xF6retag som beh\xF6ver veta mer om jobbet innan de kan ge ett pris \u2013 till exempel byggf\xF6retag, konsulter, byr\xE5er och industrif\xF6retag.":"Any business that needs to know more about the job before giving a price \u2013 for example construction companies, consultants, agencies and industrial companies.","Elevate Studio \xE4r ett litet team i Uppsala som bygger hemsidor som ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar \u2013 f\xF6r f\xF6retag i alla storlekar, i hela Sverige.":"Elevate Studio is a small team in Uppsala building websites that bring in enquiries \u2013 for businesses of every size, across Sweden.","Vi \xE4r ett team i Uppsala som bygger hemsidor \xE5t f\xF6retag i alla storlekar i hela Sverige \u2013 med fast pris, snabba leveranser och personlig kontakt.":"We are a team in Uppsala building websites for businesses of every size across Sweden \u2013 with fixed prices, fast delivery and personal contact.","Elevate Studio bygger hemsidor f\xF6r f\xF6retag i alla storlekar och kopplar p\xE5 bokning, offertsystem, AI-chatt, SEO och support. Fast pris, webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala.":"Elevate Studio builds websites for businesses of every size and adds booking systems, quote systems, AI chat, SEO and support. Fixed prices, web agency in Uppsala.","Webbyr\xE5 i Stockholm":"Web agency in Stockholm","Webbyr\xE5 Stockholm \u2013 hemsidor till fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr":"Web agency Stockholm \u2013 websites at a fixed price from SEK 3,000","Webbyr\xE5 f\xF6r f\xF6retag i Stockholm":"Web agency for businesses in Stockholm","Webbyr\xE5 f\xF6r f\xF6retag i":"Web agency for businesses in","Vi \xE4r en liten webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala som bygger hemsidor som ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar \u2013 f\xF6r f\xF6retag i Stockholm, i hela Stockholms l\xE4n och i resten av Sverige.":"We are a small web agency in Uppsala building websites that bring in enquiries \u2013 for businesses in Stockholm, across Stockholm County and the rest of Sweden.","Webbyr\xE5 f\xF6r Stockholm \u2013 med bas i Uppsala":"A web agency for Stockholm \u2013 based in Uppsala","Vi finns i Uppsala, fyrtio minuter fr\xE5n Stockholm, och bygger hemsidor \xE5t f\xF6retag i hela Stockholmsomr\xE5det. De flesta m\xF6ten sker p\xE5 distans, men vi kommer g\xE4rna till er n\xE4r det beh\xF6vs. Ni pratar med samma person fr\xE5n f\xF6rsta m\xF6tet till uppf\xF6ljningen varje m\xE5nad \u2013 inga mellanh\xE4nder och inga l\xE5nga mejltr\xE5dar.":"We are in Uppsala, forty minutes from Stockholm, and build websites for businesses across the Stockholm area. Most meetings are remote, but we are happy to come to you when needed. You talk to the same person from the first meeting to the monthly follow-up \u2013 no middlemen and no long e-mail threads.","Det h\xE4r g\xF6r vi \xE5t er":"This is what we do for you","Syns n\xE4r kunder i Stockholm s\xF6ker":"Be seen when customers in Stockholm search","Stockholm \xE4r den tuffaste marknaden i Sverige att synas p\xE5. D\xE4rf\xF6r bygger vi sidan s\xE5 att Google f\xF6rst\xE5r exakt vilka tj\xE4nster ni erbjuder och i vilka omr\xE5den \u2013 och s\xE5 att AI-tj\xE4nster som ChatGPT kan beskriva er r\xE4tt n\xE4r n\xE5gon fr\xE5gar efter ett f\xF6retag som ert i Stockholm.":"Stockholm is the hardest market in Sweden to be seen in. So we build the site so that Google understands exactly which services you offer and in which areas \u2013 and so that AI services such as ChatGPT describe you correctly when someone asks for a business like yours in Stockholm.","Vi hj\xE4lper f\xF6retag i hela Stockholms l\xE4n":"We help businesses across Stockholm County","Stockholm, Solna, Sundbyberg, Nacka, T\xE4by, Sollentuna, Huddinge, J\xE4rf\xE4lla, Sigtuna och Norrt\xE4lje \u2013 och f\xF6rst\xE5s Uppsala. Vi tr\xE4ffas d\xE4r det passar er eller p\xE5 distans.":"Stockholm, Solna, Sundbyberg, Nacka, T\xE4by, Sollentuna, Huddinge, J\xE4rf\xE4lla, Sigtuna and Norrt\xE4lje \u2013 and of course Uppsala. We meet wherever suits you, or remotely.","Finns ni i Stockholm?":"Are you in Stockholm?","Vi finns i Uppsala och jobbar med f\xF6retag i hela Stockholmsomr\xE5det. M\xF6ten sker p\xE5 distans eller p\xE5 plats hos er n\xE4r det beh\xF6vs.":"We are in Uppsala and work with businesses across the Stockholm area. Meetings are remote or at your place when needed.","Vad kostar en hemsida f\xF6r ett f\xF6retag i Stockholm?":"What does a website cost for a business in Stockholm?","Samma fasta priser som \xF6verallt: Starter 3 000 kr och Pro 6 000 kr i startavgift, plus en l\xE5g \xE5rsavgift. St\xF6rre projekt f\xE5r ett fast pris i en offert innan vi b\xF6rjar.":"The same fixed prices as everywhere: Starter SEK 3,000 and Pro SEK 6,000 in start-up fee, plus a low annual fee. Larger projects get a fixed price in a quote before we start.","Hur snabbt kan vi f\xE5 en hemsida?":"How quickly can we get a website?","Ni ser ett f\xF6rsta utkast efter ungef\xE4r en dag. Hur snabbt sidan g\xE5r live beror mest p\xE5 n\xE4r vi har f\xE5tt texter, bilder och \xE5tkomst.":"You see a first draft after about a day. How quickly the site goes live depends mostly on when we have received texts, pictures and access.","Kan ni hj\xE4lpa oss att synas i Stockholm?":"Can you help us be seen in Stockholm?","Ja. Grundl\xE4ggande SEO och AI-optimering ing\xE5r i alla hemsidor, och vi bygger sidan s\xE5 att den tydligt visar vilka tj\xE4nster ni erbjuder och var.":"Yes. Basic SEO and AI optimisation are included in every website, and we build the site so that it clearly shows which services you offer and where.","Mer om SEO och AI":"More about SEO and AI","Se tekniken":"See the technology","Nya funktioner och st\xF6rre ombyggnationer efter leverans offereras separat.":"New features and larger rebuilds after delivery are quoted separately.","\xC5rsavgiften p\xE5 99 kr forts\xE4tter \xE5rsvis om inte avtalet s\xE4gs upp.":"The annual fee of SEK 99 continues yearly unless the agreement is terminated.","En insamlingsorganisation som ville f\xE5 fler m\xE5nadsgivare \u2013 med ett enklare givarfl\xF6de och tydliga resultat.":"A fundraising organisation that wanted more monthly donors \u2013 with a simpler giving flow and clear results.","Om cookies p\xE5 elevatestudio.nu | Elevate Studio":"About cookies on elevatestudio.nu | Elevate Studio","Kontakta oss \u2013 webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala | Elevate Studio":"Contact us \u2013 web agency in Uppsala | Elevate Studio","Om oss \u2013 webbyr\xE5n bakom Elevate Studio i Uppsala":"About us \u2013 the web agency behind Elevate Studio in Uppsala","Hemsidor f\xF6r f\xF6retag i Uppsala \u2013 webbdesign till fast pris":"Websites for businesses in Uppsala \u2013 web design at a fixed price","Senaste nytt om hemsidor, SEO och AI | Elevate Studio":"Latest news on websites, SEO and AI | Elevate Studio","Tekniken vi bygger hemsidor med | Elevate Studio":"The technology we build websites with | Elevate Studio","M\xF6te om en ny hemsida \u2013 tre personer kring ett bord med laptops":"Meeting about a new website \u2013 three people around a table with laptops",Integritetspolicy:"Privacy policy",Cookies:"Cookies","In English":"In English","Elevate Studio \xE4r ett varum\xE4rke som tillh\xF6r PJM Projekteffektivitet AB, org.nr 556969-4358 \xB7 Developed by Isak Mattsson":"Elevate Studio is a brand owned by PJM Projekteffektivitet AB, company reg. no. 556969-4358 \xB7 Developed by Isak Mattsson","Fr\xE5gor?":"Questions?","Fr\xE5ga oss":"Ask us","Snabba svar fr\xE5n v\xE5r FAQ \u2013 eller ett svar fr\xE5n oss via mejl.":"Quick answers from our FAQ \u2013 or an answer from us by email.","Din fr\xE5ga":"Your question","Elevate Studio \u2013 Senaste nytt":"Elevate Studio \u2013 Latest news",Startsida:"Home page",Huvudmeny:"Main menu","\xD6ppna meny":"Open menu",Br\u00F6dsmulor:"Breadcrumbs","St\xE4ng meny":"Close menu","Din e-postadress":"Your email address",Prenumerera:"Subscribe","Fr\xE5ga Elevate Studio":"Ask Elevate Studio","Skriv en fr\xE5ga \u2026":"Type a question \u2026",Skicka:"Send","404 \u2013 Sidan finns inte | Elevate Studio":"404 \u2013 Page not found | Elevate Studio","S\xE5 h\xE4r ser en offert fr\xE5n oss ut. Namn, organisationsnummer och datum \xE4r borttagna.":"This is what a quote from us looks like. Names, company registration numbers and dates have been removed.","WEBBUTVECKLING / OFFERT":"WEB DEVELOPMENT / QUOTE","OFFERT NR":"QUOTE NO.","Datum:":"Date:","| Giltig till:":"| Valid until:","1. Parter":"1. Parties","Producent: Elevate Studio":"Supplier: Elevate Studio","Producentens f\xF6retr\xE4dare:":"Supplier's representative:","Best\xE4llare:":"Client:","Best\xE4llarens f\xF6retr\xE4dare:":"Client's representative:","2. Uppdragets omfattning (specifikation)":"2. Scope of the assignment (specification)","Utveckling och leverans av en modern, responsiv webbplats f\xF6r Best\xE4llaren.":"Development and delivery of a modern, responsive website for the Client.","I uppdraget ing\xE5r:":"The assignment includes:","Webbdesign och mobilanpassning utifr\xE5n verksamhetens behov.":"Web design and mobile optimisation based on the needs of the business.","Kontaktfunktion, presentation av verksamhet och projekt samt bildmaterial som kunden tillhandah\xE5ller.":"Contact function, presentation of the business and projects, and images supplied by the client.","Grundl\xE4ggande s\xF6kmotoroptimering (SEO) och AI-optimering (AIO).":"Basic search engine optimisation (SEO) and AI optimisation (AIO).","Tv\xE5 korrekturv\xE4ndor f\xF6re leverans.":"Two rounds of revisions before delivery.","Upp till 10 timmars support och webbplatsredigering per m\xE5nad under det f\xF6rsta \xE5ret.":"Up to 10 hours of support and website editing per month during the first year.","3. Driftmilj\xF6":"3. Hosting environment","Best\xE4llaren \xE4ger sin dom\xE4n. Hosting, drift och eventuella externa avgifter specificeras separat om inget annat skriftligen \xF6verenskommits.":"The Client owns its domain. Hosting, operation and any external fees are specified separately unless otherwise agreed in writing.","4. Leverans":"4. Delivery","Leveransdatum bekr\xE4ftas separat och f\xF6ruts\xE4tter att n\xF6dv\xE4ndigt underlag och \xE5tkomst tillhandah\xE5lls.":"The delivery date is confirmed separately and requires that the necessary material and access are provided.","ELEVATE STUDIO | OFFERT":"ELEVATE STUDIO | QUOTE","Sida 1 av 2":"Page 1 of 2","OFFERT / VILLKOR OCH GODK\xC4NNANDE":"QUOTE / TERMS AND APPROVAL","5. Fast pris och betalning":"5. Fixed price and payment",Post:"Item","Pris (exkl. moms)":"Price (excl. VAT)","Webbutveckling \u2013 fast startavgift":"Web development \u2013 fixed start-up fee","3 000 kr":"SEK 3,000",\u00C5rsavgift:"Annual fee","99 kr/\xE5r":"SEK 99/year","Webbredigering och support, upp till 10 tim/m\xE5n f\xF6rsta \xE5ret":"Website editing and support, up to 10 hrs/month the first year",Ing\u00E5r:"Included","Totalt f\xF6rsta \xE5ret":"Total first year","3 099 kr":"SEK 3,099","Under de f\xF6rsta 12 m\xE5naderna fr\xE5n leverans ing\xE5r upp till 10 timmars redigeringssupport per m\xE5nad. Supporten kan anv\xE4ndas f\xF6r text- och bild\xE4ndringar, layoutjusteringar, nya funktioner eller st\xF6rre ombyggnationer av webbplatsen.":"During the first 12 months from delivery, up to 10 hours of editing support per month are included. The support can be used for text and image changes, layout adjustments, new features or larger rebuilds of the website.","Nya funktioner och st\xF6rre ombyggnationer utf\xF6rs inom den tillg\xE4ngliga m\xE5nadstiden. Arbete ut\xF6ver 10 timmar under en m\xE5nad f\xF6ruts\xE4tter separat \xF6verenskommelse. Outnyttjade timmar f\xF6rs inte \xF6ver till n\xE4sta m\xE5nad.":"New features and larger rebuilds are carried out within the available monthly hours. Work beyond 10 hours in a month requires a separate agreement. Unused hours are not carried over to the next month.","Efter f\xF6rsta \xE5ret upph\xF6r den inkluderade timsupporten. Fortsatt support och utveckling kan avtalas separat. \xC5rsavgiften p\xE5 99 kr forts\xE4tter \xE5rsvis om inte avtalet s\xE4gs upp.":"After the first year, the included hourly support ends. Continued support and development can be agreed separately. The annual fee of SEK 99 continues each year unless the agreement is terminated.","Startavgift och f\xF6rsta \xE5rsavgift faktureras vid drifts\xE4ttning. Betalningsvillkor: 30 dagar. Samtliga priser anges exklusive moms.":"The start-up fee and the first annual fee are invoiced at launch. Payment terms: 30 days. All prices are excluding VAT.","6. Godk\xE4nnande av offert":"6. Approval of the quote","Best\xE4llaren kan acceptera denna offert genom att svara p\xE5 mejlet med f\xF6ljande text:":"The Client can accept this quote by replying to the email with the following text:","Jag godk\xE4nner offert nr":"I approve quote no.","och best\xE4ller tj\xE4nsterna enligt offertens villkor.":"and order the services according to the terms of the quote.","Genom godk\xE4nnandet accepterar best\xE4llaren uppdragets omfattning, priser, betalningsvillkor och \xF6vriga villkor i denna offert.":"By approving, the Client accepts the scope of the assignment, prices, payment terms and other terms in this quote.","Sida 2 av 2":"Page 2 of 2","Exempel p\xE5 webbavtal | Elevate Studio":"Example web agreement | Elevate Studio","Prisv\xE4rd hemsida till fast pris":"Affordable website at a fixed price","Prisv\xE4rd hemsida":"Affordable website","till fast pris":"at a fixed price","En hemsida beh\xF6ver inte kosta tiotusentals kronor. Hos oss f\xE5r ni en snabb, mobilanpassad hemsida till fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr.":"A website doesn't have to cost tens of thousands of kronor. With us you get a fast, mobile-friendly website at a fixed price from SEK 3,000.","Det h\xE4r ing\xE5r i Starter":"What's included in Starter","Webbdesign och mobilanpassning utifr\xE5n er verksamhet.":"Web design and mobile optimisation based on your business.","Kontaktfunktion och presentation av verksamhet och projekt.":"Contact function and presentation of the business and projects.","Grundl\xE4ggande SEO och AI-optimering.":"Basic SEO and AI optimisation.","Upp till 10 timmars support och redigering per m\xE5nad f\xF6rsta \xE5ret.":"Up to 10 hours of support and editing per month the first year.","Vad kostar det efter\xE5t?":"What does it cost afterwards?","Startavgiften \xE4r 3 000 kr. D\xE4refter betalar ni en \xE5rsavgift p\xE5 99\u2013199 kr per \xE5r. Hosting och eventuella externa avgifter st\xE5r specificerade i offerten, s\xE5 att ni vet exakt vad som g\xE4ller.":"The start-up fee is SEK 3,000. After that you pay an annual fee of SEK 99\u2013199 per year. Hosting and any external fees are specified in the quote, so you know exactly what applies.","Beh\xF6ver ni mer?":"Need more?","Pro f\xF6r 6 000 kr l\xE4gger till bokning eller offertfl\xF6de, AI-chatt och notiser via e-post och SMS. St\xF6rre projekt f\xE5r ett fast pris i en offert.":"Pro for SEK 6,000 adds booking or a quote form, AI chat and notifications by email and text message. Larger projects get a fixed price in a quote.","Fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr":"Fixed price from SEK 3,000","Se vad som ing\xE5r i Starter, Pro och Elite \u2013 och hur avtalet ser ut.":"See what's included in Starter, Pro and Elite \u2013 and what the agreement looks like.","Se priser":"See prices","Exempel p\xE5 avtal":"Example agreement",Vanliga:"Frequently asked",fr\u00E5gor:"questions","Varf\xF6r \xE4r det s\xE5 billigt?":"Why is it so cheap?","Vi \xE4r ett litet team med l\xE5ga omkostnader och bygger effektivt \u2013 d\xE4rf\xF6r kan vi h\xE5lla ett l\xE5gt fast pris.":"We are a small team with low overheads and we build efficiently \u2013 that's why we can keep a low fixed price.","Finns det dolda avgifter?":"Are there any hidden fees?","Nej. Startavgift och \xE5rsavgift st\xE5r i offerten, och hosting och eventuella externa avgifter specificeras d\xE4r ocks\xE5.":"No. The start-up fee and annual fee are in the quote, and hosting and any external fees are specified there too.","\xC4ger vi hemsidans dom\xE4n?":"Do we own the website's domain?","Ja. Dom\xE4nen \xE4r och f\xF6rblir er.":"Yes. The domain is and remains yours.","Ska vi bygga n\xE5got tillsammans?":"Shall we build something together?","Ber\xE4tta kort vad ni funderar p\xE5, s\xE5 h\xF6r vi av oss s\xE5 fort vi kan.":"Tell us briefly what you have in mind, and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.","Kontakta oss":"Contact us","Billig hemsida f\xF6r f\xF6retag \u2013 fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr":"Affordable website for businesses \u2013 fixed price from SEK 3,000","Billig hemsida f\xF6r f\xF6retag utan att sn\xE5la p\xE5 kvaliteten: mobilanpassad, SEO-optimerad och med support f\xF6rsta \xE5ret. Fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr exkl. moms.":"An affordable business website without cutting corners: mobile-friendly, SEO-optimised and with support the first year. Fixed price from SEK 3,000 excl. VAT.","Om cookies":"About cookies","Vi anv\xE4nder inga cookies.":"We don't use any cookies.","Inga cookies":"No cookies","Webbplatsen s\xE4tter inga cookies, varken egna eller fr\xE5n andra. D\xE4rf\xF6r finns det heller ingen cookieruta att godk\xE4nna.":"This website sets no cookies, neither our own nor anyone else's. That's why there is no cookie banner to accept.","Ingen statistik eller annonsering":"No statistics or advertising","Vi anv\xE4nder inga analysverktyg som Google Analytics och inga annonssp\xE5rare.":"We don't use analytics tools like Google Analytics, and no ad trackers.",Formul\u00E4r:"Forms","Det du skriver i ett formul\xE4r skickas till oss n\xE4r du trycker p\xE5 skicka. L\xE4s mer i v\xE5r integritetspolicy.":"What you write in a form is sent to us when you press send. Read more in our privacy policy.","Om cookies | Elevate Studio":"About cookies | Elevate Studio","Elevate Studios webbplats s\xE4tter inga cookies och anv\xE4nder inga analys- eller annonsverktyg.":"Elevate Studio's website sets no cookies and uses no analytics or advertising tools.","Hemsida f\xF6r":"Websites for",hantverkare:"tradespeople","F\xF6r snickare, elektriker, r\xF6rmokare, m\xE5lare och byggf\xF6retag: en hemsida som visar vad ni g\xF6r och g\xF6r det enkelt f\xF6r kunderna att beg\xE4ra offert.":"For carpenters, electricians, plumbers, painters and builders: a website that shows what you do and makes it easy for customers to request a quote.","Det h\xE4r beh\xF6ver en hantverkare p\xE5 sin hemsida":"What a tradesperson needs on their website","En tydlig rubrik som s\xE4ger vad ni g\xF6r och var ni jobbar.":"A clear headline that says what you do and where you work.","En egen sida f\xF6r varje tj\xE4nst \u2013 till exempel badrum, k\xF6k eller tak.":"A separate page for each service \u2013 for example bathrooms, kitchens or roofs.","Bilder p\xE5 riktiga jobb som visar vad ni kan.":"Photos of real jobs that show what you can do.","Telefonnummer och offertknapp p\xE5 varje sida.":"Phone number and a quote button on every page.","En sida som fungerar perfekt p\xE5 mobilen, d\xE4r de flesta kunder s\xF6ker.":"A site that works perfectly on mobile, where most customers search.","Offertformul\xE4r som sparar tid":"Quote forms that save time","Med ett offertfl\xF6de beskriver kunden jobbet steg f\xF6r steg och kan bifoga bilder. Ni f\xE5r en komplett f\xF6rfr\xE5gan och slipper ringa tillbaka f\xF6r att fr\xE5ga om grundl\xE4ggande saker.":"With a quote form, the customer describes the job step by step and can attach photos. You get a complete enquiry and don't have to call back to ask about the basics.","Synas n\xE4r kunderna s\xF6ker lokalt":"Be found when customers search locally","Vi bygger sidan s\xE5 att Google f\xF6rst\xE5r vilka tj\xE4nster ni erbjuder och p\xE5 vilka orter \u2013 och s\xE5 att AI-tj\xE4nster kan beskriva er r\xE4tt n\xE4r n\xE5gon fr\xE5gar efter en hantverkare i n\xE4rheten.":"We build the site so that Google understands which services you offer and in which areas \u2013 and so that AI services can describe you correctly when someone asks for a tradesperson nearby.","Vad kostar en hemsida f\xF6r hantverkare?":"What does a website for tradespeople cost?","Starter kostar 3 000 kr och Pro, med offertfl\xF6de eller bokning, 6 000 kr i startavgift plus en l\xE5g \xE5rsavgift.":"Starter costs SEK 3,000 and Pro, with a quote form or booking, SEK 6,000 as a start-up fee, plus a low annual fee.","Kan kunderna skicka bilder i offertformul\xE4ret?":"Can customers send photos in the quote form?","Ja, kunden kan bifoga bilder eller beskrivningar direkt i f\xF6rfr\xE5gan.":"Yes, the customer can attach photos or descriptions directly in the enquiry.","Har ni ett exempel?":"Do you have an example?","Ja, Lindvik Bygg \xE4r en hemsida vi har byggt som visar hur en hemsida f\xF6r ett byggf\xF6retag kan se ut.":"Yes, Lindvik Bygg is a website we have built that shows what a website for a construction company can look like.","Hemsida f\xF6r hantverkare \u2013 med offertformul\xE4r | Elevate Studio":"Websites for tradespeople \u2013 with quote forms | Elevate Studio","Hemsida f\xF6r snickare, elektriker, r\xF6rmokare, m\xE5lare och byggf\xF6retag \u2013 med offertformul\xE4r, tj\xE4nstesidor och synlighet p\xE5 Google. Fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr.":"Websites for carpenters, electricians, plumbers, painters and builders \u2013 with quote forms, service pages and visibility on Google. Fixed price from SEK 3,000.","Hemsidor som":"Websites that","ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar":"bring in enquiries","Snabba, mobilanpassade hemsidor med bokning, offertfl\xF6de och AI-chatt \u2013 till fast pris. Ni pratar alltid med samma person.":"Fast, mobile-friendly websites with booking, quote forms and AI chat \u2013 at a fixed price. You always talk to the same person.","Boka ett m\xF6te":"Book a meeting","En hemsida som":"A website that","jobbar \xE5t er":"works for you","Vi bygger snabba, mobilanpassade hemsidor med tydliga tj\xE4nstesidor och en v\xE4g till kontakt p\xE5 varje sida.":"We build fast, mobile-friendly websites with clear service pages and a way to get in touch on every page.","Sedan kopplar vi p\xE5 det som sparar tid \xE5t er \u2013 bokning, offertfl\xF6den och AI-chatt \u2013 och ser till att ni syns p\xE5 Google och n\xE4r kunder fr\xE5gar AI.":"Then we add what saves you time \u2013 booking, quote forms and AI chat \u2013 and make sure you show up on Google and when customers ask AI.","Efter lansering tar vi hand om \xE4ndringar och uppf\xF6ljning.":"After launch we take care of changes and follow-up.","Se alla tj\xE4nster":"See all services","En chatt som svarar p\xE5 vanliga fr\xE5gor \u2013 \xE4ven n\xE4r ni inte hinner.":"A chat that answers common questions \u2013 even when you're too busy.","L\xE5t kunderna boka tid direkt p\xE5 hemsidan \u2013 dygnet runt.":"Let customers book a time directly on your website \u2013 around the clock.","S\xE5 kan det se ut":"What it can look like","Hemsidor som k\xE4nns r\xE4tt":"Websites that feel right","p\xE5 alla sk\xE4rmar":"on every screen","Vi bygger mobilen f\xF6rst och finputsar varje sk\xE4rmstorlek. Lindvik Bygg \xE4r en hemsida vi har byggt f\xF6r att visa hur det kan se ut \u2013 p\xE5 dator och mobil.":"We build for mobile first and polish every screen size. Lindvik Bygg is a website we have built to show what it can look like \u2013 on desktop and mobile.","Se alla projekt":"See all projects","Klicka runt p\xE5 Lindvik Bygg":"Click around Lindvik Bygg","Dator och mobil":"Desktop and mobile","\u2013 samma sajt, anpassad f\xF6r varje sk\xE4rm":"\u2013 the same site, adapted to every screen","Exempel p\xE5 projekt":"Example projects","Fler exempel":"More examples",Exempel:"Example","Kunderna i exemplen \xE4r p\xE5hittade och visar hur vi arbetar.":"The clients in the examples are fictional and show how we work.","Kunder och":"Clients and",exempel:"examples","Haninge Byggteam AB \xE4r kund hos oss. \xD6vriga namn \xE4r p\xE5hittade exempel som visar hur vi arbetar.":"Haninge Byggteam AB is a client of ours. The other names are fictional examples that show how we work.",Senaste:"Latest",nytt:"news","Alla artiklar":"All articles",Guide:"Guide","Vad kostar en hemsida \u2013 och vad betalar du egentligen f\xF6r?":"What does a website cost \u2013 and what are you actually paying for?","27 oktober 2026":"27 October 2026","Fem saker som f\xE5r bes\xF6kare att h\xF6ra av sig":"Five things that make visitors get in touch","20 oktober 2026":"20 October 2026","S\xE5 syns ditt f\xF6retag n\xE4r kunder fr\xE5gar AI":"How your business shows up when customers ask AI","13 oktober 2026":"13 October 2026",S\u00E5:"How","jobbar vi":"we work","Fem steg fr\xE5n f\xF6rsta m\xF6tet till en hemsida som ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar \u2013 och som blir b\xE4ttre varje m\xE5nad. Vi tar hand om det tekniska, ni bidrar med kunskapen om ert f\xF6retag.":"Five steps from the first meeting to a website that brings in enquiries \u2013 and gets better every month. We take care of the technical side, you bring the knowledge about your business.","Boka ett f\xF6rsta m\xF6te":"Book a first meeting","Se hur ett avtal ser ut":"See what an agreement looks like","F\xF6rsta m\xF6tet":"First meeting","Vi l\xE4r k\xE4nna f\xF6retaget":"We get to know your business","Ett kort m\xF6te om era tj\xE4nster, era kunder och vilka aff\xE4rer ni vill ha fler av.":"A short meeting about your services, your customers and which deals you want more of.","Utkast p\xE5 en dag":"Draft in a day","Vi bygger hemsidan":"We build the website","Mobilanpassad design med tydliga tj\xE4nstesidor och en v\xE4g till kontakt p\xE5 varje sida.":"Mobile-friendly design with clear service pages and a way to get in touch on every page.","F\xF6re lansering":"Before launch","Vi kopplar p\xE5 smarta funktioner":"We add smart features","Offertfl\xF6de, bokning, AI-chatt och notiser via e-post och SMS aktiveras och testas.":"Quote forms, booking, AI chat and notifications by email and text message are switched on and tested.",Lanseringsdagen:"Launch day","Hemsidan b\xF6rjar ge f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar":"The website starts bringing in enquiries","Sidan lanseras, indexeras av Google och tar emot f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar med status och historik.":"The site is launched, indexed by Google and receives enquiries with status and history.","Varje m\xE5nad":"Every month","Vi f\xF6rb\xE4ttrar \xF6ver tid":"We improve over time","Vi f\xF6ljer upp vad som ger kunder och justerar texter, erbjudanden och fl\xF6den l\xF6pande.":"We follow up on what brings in customers and adjust texts, offers and flows continuously.","Vi \xE4r":"We are","Vi \xE4r ett team i Uppsala som bygger hemsidor \xE5t f\xF6retag i hela Sverige \u2013 med fast pris, snabba leveranser och personlig kontakt.":"We are a team in Uppsala building websites for businesses all over Sweden \u2013 with fixed prices, fast delivery and a personal touch.","Ni pratar med samma person fr\xE5n f\xF6rsta m\xF6tet till uppf\xF6ljningen varje m\xE5nad. Inga mellanh\xE4nder, inga l\xE5nga mejltr\xE5dar \u2013 bara n\xE5gon som kan ert f\xF6retag och svarar n\xE4r ni ringer.":"You talk to the same person from the first meeting to the monthly follow-up. No middlemen, no long email threads \u2013 just someone who knows your business and answers when you call.","Recension p\xE5 Google":"Review on Google (translated from Swedish)","Hemmacykel \xB7 Recension p\xE5 Google":"Hemmacykel \xB7 Review on Google (translated from Swedish)","Gjorde en v\xE4ldigt bra och professionell hemsida \xE5t oss. Mycket n\xF6jd med detta. Kan varmt rekommendera!":"They made a really good and professional website for us. Very happy with it. Warmly recommended!","V\xE4l utf\xF6rt arbete med v\xE5r hemsida, vi m\xE4rker redan skillnad p\xE5 infl\xF6de av f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar till v\xE5ra tj\xE4nster.":"Well-executed work on our website \u2013 we're already noticing a difference in the number of enquiries for our services.","Har ni jobbat med oss?":"Have you worked with us?","Vi blir glada f\xF6r en recension p\xE5 Google \u2013 det hj\xE4lper andra f\xF6retag att hitta oss.":"We'd be grateful for a review on Google \u2013 it helps other businesses find us.","L\xE4mna en recension":"Leave a review","Hur presterar":"How does","din sajt?":"your site perform?","G\xF6r ett gratis djuptest p\xE5 cirka 30 sekunder och se direkt vad som kan f\xF6rb\xE4ttras \u2013 och hur vi fixar det.":"Run a free in-depth test in about 30 seconds and see right away what can be improved \u2013 and how we fix it.",Webbadress:"Web address","Testa nu":"Test now","Vad kostar en hemsida?":"What does a website cost?","Ni f\xE5r ett fast pris innan vi b\xF6rjar. Starter kostar 3 000 kr och Pro 6 000 kr i startavgift, plus en l\xE5g \xE5rsavgift. St\xF6rre projekt f\xE5r ett fast pris i en offert.":"You get a fixed price before we start. Starter costs SEK 3,000 and Pro SEK 6,000 as a start-up fee, plus a low annual fee. Larger projects get a fixed price in a quote.","Se v\xE5ra priser":"See our prices",eller:"or","ett exempel p\xE5 hur ett avtal ser ut":"an example of what an agreement looks like","Hur l\xE5ng tid tar det?":"How long does it take?","Ni ser ett f\xF6rsta utkast av hemsidan redan efter ungef\xE4r en dag. Sedan finjusterar vi tillsammans tills ni \xE4r n\xF6jda. Hur snabbt den g\xE5r live beror mest p\xE5 n\xE4r vi har f\xE5tt texter, bilder och \xE5tkomst.":"You see a first draft of the website after about a day. Then we fine-tune it together until you're happy. How quickly it goes live depends mostly on when we have the texts, images and access.","Bygger ni hemsidor f\xF6r hantverkare?":"Do you build websites for tradespeople?","Ja. Vi bygger hemsidor f\xF6r snickare, elektriker, r\xF6rmokare, m\xE5lare, byggf\xF6retag och andra hantverkare \u2013 ofta med ett offertformul\xE4r s\xE5 att kunderna kan beskriva jobbet direkt.":"Yes. We build websites for carpenters, electricians, plumbers, painters, builders and other tradespeople \u2013 often with a quote form so customers can describe the job directly.","Jobbar ni bara i Uppsala?":"Do you only work in Uppsala?","Nej. Vi finns i Uppsala men bygger hemsidor \xE5t f\xF6retag i hela Sverige. M\xF6ten g\xE5r lika bra p\xE5 distans.":"No. We're based in Uppsala but build websites for businesses all over Sweden. Meetings work just as well remotely.","Vad beh\xF6ver vi bidra med?":"What do we need to contribute?","Kunskapen om ert f\xF6retag: vad ni g\xF6r, vilka kunder ni vill ha och de bilder och texter ni redan har. Ni f\xE5r tv\xE5 korrekturv\xE4ndor innan sidan lanseras, s\xE5 att allt blir r\xE4tt.":"The knowledge about your business: what you do, which customers you want and the images and texts you already have. You get two rounds of revisions before the site launches, so everything is right.","Ing\xE5r support efter lansering?":"Is support included after launch?","Ja. Under f\xF6rsta \xE5ret ing\xE5r upp till 10 timmars support och redigering per m\xE5nad \u2013 till exempel text- och bild\xE4ndringar, layoutjusteringar eller nya funktioner.":"Yes. During the first year, up to 10 hours of support and editing per month are included \u2013 for example text and image changes, layout adjustments or new features.","Syns hemsidan p\xE5 Google?":"Will the website show up on Google?","Grundl\xE4ggande s\xF6kmotoroptimering (SEO) och AI-optimering ing\xE5r, s\xE5 att sidan g\xE5r att hitta b\xE5de p\xE5 Google och i AI-tj\xE4nster som svarar p\xE5 fr\xE5gor.":"Basic search engine optimisation (SEO) and AI optimisation are included, so the site can be found both on Google and in AI services that answer questions.","Kan ni koppla p\xE5 bokning, offertformul\xE4r eller AI-chatt?":"Can you add booking, quote forms or AI chat?","Ja. Vi bygger bokningssystem, offertsystem, AI-chatt och notiser via e-post och SMS \u2013 och testar allt innan lansering.":"Yes. We build booking systems, quote systems, AI chat and notifications by email and text message \u2013 and test everything before launch.","Vem \xE4ger dom\xE4nen?":"Who owns the domain?","Ni. Dom\xE4nen \xE4r och f\xF6rblir er. Hosting och eventuella externa avgifter st\xE5r specificerade i offerten.":"You do. The domain is and remains yours. Hosting and any external fees are specified in the quote.","Hur godk\xE4nner vi offerten?":"How do we approve the quote?","Ni svarar p\xE5 mejlet med offerten och skriver att ni godk\xE4nner den. Inga kr\xE5ngliga underskrifter.":"You reply to the email with the quote and write that you approve it. No complicated signatures.","En digital studio med r\xF6tterna i":"A digital studio with its roots in","Funderar ni p\xE5 ett nytt projekt eller beh\xF6ver ni hj\xE4lp med n\xE5got som redan finns? Mejla oss p\xE5":"Thinking about a new project or need help with something that already exists? Email us at","kontakta n\xE5gon av oss direkt":"contact one of us directly","eller skriv n\xE5gra rader i formul\xE4ret, s\xE5 \xE5terkommer vi s\xE5 fort vi kan.":"or write a few lines in the form, and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.","Hej! Jag vill g\xE4rna bli kontaktad.":"Hi! I'd like to be contacted.",Namn:"Name","E-post":"Email",Telefon:"Phone",F\u00F6retag:"Company",Tj\u00E4nst:"Service","Vad \xE4r ni intresserade av?":"What are you interested in?","Vet inte \xE4n \u2013 vill ha r\xE5d":"Not sure yet \u2013 would like advice",Meddelande:"Message","Skisser och laptop p\xE5 ett skrivbord under arbetet med en hemsida":"Sketches and a laptop on a desk while working on a website","Team med laptops runt ett bord, sett ovanifr\xE5n":"A team with laptops around a table, seen from above","Lindvik Bygg p\xE5 en dator":"Lindvik Bygg on a computer","Lindvik Bygg p\xE5 en mobil":"Lindvik Bygg on a mobile","Kunder och exempel":"Clients and examples","M\xE4nniskor runt ett bord i ett f\xF6rsta m\xF6te":"People around a table at a first meeting","Team som skissar p\xE5 en hemsida ovanifr\xE5n":"A team sketching a website, seen from above","Utvecklare som skriver kod vid tv\xE5 sk\xE4rmar":"A developer writing code at two screens","Person med headset som tar emot en f\xF6rfr\xE5gan":"A person with a headset receiving an enquiry","H\xE4nder som pekar p\xE5 diagram \xF6ver resultat":"Hands pointing at charts of results","Ett team som arbetar tillsammans vid ett tr\xE4bord med datorer och v\xE4xter":"A team working together at a wooden table with computers and plants","Skiss av en hemsida i ett anteckningsblock bredvid en mobil":"A website sketch in a notebook next to a mobile phone","Kaffe och en laptop p\xE5 ett skrivbord":"Coffee and a laptop on a desk",Kundrecensioner:"Customer reviews",F\u00F6reg\u00E5ende:"Previous",N\u00E4sta:"Next","dittforetag.se":"yourcompany.com","Webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala \u2013 hemsidor som ger kunder | Elevate Studio":"Web agency in Uppsala \u2013 websites that bring in customers | Elevate Studio","S\xE5 hanterar vi personuppgifter n\xE4r du kontaktar oss eller bes\xF6ker v\xE5r webbplats.":"How we handle personal data when you contact us or visit our website.","N\xE4r du kontaktar oss":"When you contact us","Personuppgiftsansvarig \xE4r PJM Projekteffektivitet AB (org.nr 556969-4358), som Elevate Studio \xE4r ett varum\xE4rke f\xF6r. Det du skriver i v\xE5ra formul\xE4r \u2013 namn, e-post, telefon, f\xF6retag och meddelande \u2013 skickas till info@elevatestudio.nu och sparas i v\xE5rt kundregister. Mejl fr\xE5n oss, som bekr\xE4ftelser och nyhetsbrev, skickas fr\xE5n info@elevatestudio.nu via e-posttj\xE4nsten Brevo. Anm\xE4ler du dig till nyhetsbrevet sparas din e-post i Brevo tills du avslutar prenumerationen, vilket du kan g\xF6ra med en l\xE4nk i varje utskick. Vi anv\xE4nder uppgifterna bara f\xF6r att svara dig och skicka det du har bett om, och sparar dem inte l\xE4ngre \xE4n vi beh\xF6ver.":"The data controller is PJM Projekteffektivitet AB (company reg. no. 556969-4358), which owns the Elevate Studio brand. What you write in our forms \u2013 name, email, phone, company and message \u2013 is sent to info@elevatestudio.nu and stored in our customer register. Emails from us, such as confirmations and newsletters, are sent from info@elevatestudio.nu via the email service Brevo. If you sign up for the newsletter, your email is stored in Brevo until you unsubscribe, which you can do with a link in every mailing. We only use the data to answer you and send what you have asked for, and we don't keep it longer than we need to.","Ingen sp\xE5rning":"No tracking","Webbplatsen s\xE4tter inga cookies och anv\xE4nder inga analys- eller annonsverktyg. Vi f\xF6ljer inte vad du g\xF6r h\xE4r.":"This website sets no cookies and uses no analytics or advertising tools. We don't follow what you do here.","Dina r\xE4ttigheter":"Your rights","Du har r\xE4tt att f\xE5 veta vilka uppgifter vi har om dig, och att f\xE5 dem r\xE4ttade eller raderade. Mejla info@elevatestudio.nu s\xE5 hj\xE4lper vi dig. Du kan ocks\xE5 v\xE4nda dig till Integritetsskyddsmyndigheten (IMY).":"You have the right to know what data we hold about you, and to have it corrected or deleted. Email info@elevatestudio.nu and we'll help you. You can also contact the Swedish Authority for Privacy Protection (IMY).","Integritetspolicy | Elevate Studio":"Privacy policy | Elevate Studio","S\xE5 hanterar Elevate Studio personuppgifter fr\xE5n kontaktformul\xE4r och nyhetsbrev.":"How Elevate Studio handles personal data from contact forms and newsletters.","L\xE5t oss prata om":"Let's talk about","er hemsida":"your website","Ring, mejla eller skriv n\xE5gra rader. Vi svarar s\xE5 fort vi kan \u2013 och f\xF6rsta m\xF6tet kostar ingenting.":"Call, email or write a few lines. We reply as soon as we can \u2013 and the first meeting is free.","Mejla oss":"Email us","Skriv till oss":"Write to us","Fyll i formul\xE4ret":"Fill in the form","F\xF6rs\xE4ljning & kundkontakt":"Sales & customer relations","F\xF6rs\xE4ljning & AI-utveckling":"Sales & AI development","F\xF6rs\xE4ljning & aff\xE4rsutveckling":"Sales & business development","Skriv till":"Write to",oss:"us","Ber\xE4tta kort vad ni funderar p\xE5, s\xE5 \xE5terkommer vi s\xE5 fort vi kan. Meddelandet g\xE5r direkt till info@elevatestudio.nu.":"Tell us briefly what you have in mind, and we'll get back to you as soon as we can. The message goes straight to info@elevatestudio.nu.","Efter att ni":"After you've",kontaktpersoner:"contact people","h\xF6rt av er":"been in touch","Vi h\xF6r av oss":"We get back to you","Vi l\xE4ser er f\xF6rfr\xE5gan och \xE5terkommer s\xE5 fort vi kan \u2013 oftast med ett f\xF6rslag p\xE5 tid f\xF6r ett kort m\xF6te.":"We read your enquiry and get back to you as soon as we can \u2013 usually with a suggested time for a short meeting.","Vi pratar om ert f\xF6retag, era kunder och vad hemsidan ska ge. Det kostar ingenting.":"We talk about your business, your customers and what the website should achieve. It's free of charge.","Ni f\xE5r en offert":"You get a quote","Ett fast pris och en tydlig plan p\xE5 tv\xE5 sidor. Ni godk\xE4nner genom att svara p\xE5 mejlet.":"A fixed price and a clear plan on two pages. You approve by replying to the email.","Alla fr\xE5gor":"All questions","Starter kostar 3 000 kr och Pro 6 000 kr i startavgift, plus en l\xE5g \xE5rsavgift. St\xF6rre projekt f\xE5r ett fast pris i en offert.":"Starter costs SEK 3,000 and Pro SEK 6,000 as a start-up fee, plus a low annual fee. Larger projects get a fixed price in a quote.","M\xE5ste vi finnas i Uppsala?":"Do we have to be in Uppsala?","Nej. Vi finns i Uppsala men jobbar med f\xF6retag i hela Sverige \u2013 m\xF6ten g\xE5r lika bra p\xE5 distans.":"No. We're based in Uppsala but work with businesses all over Sweden \u2013 meetings work just as well remotely.","Kontakt | Elevate Studio":"Contact | Elevate Studio","Kontakta Elevate Studio i Uppsala. Ring eller mejla Carl, Isak eller Oscar, skriv till info@elevatestudio.nu eller fyll i formul\xE4ret.":"Contact Elevate Studio in Uppsala. Call or email Carl, Isak or Oscar, write to info@elevatestudio.nu or fill in the form.","Elevate Studio \xE4r ett litet team i Uppsala som bygger hemsidor som ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar \u2013 f\xF6r f\xF6retag i hela Sverige.":"Elevate Studio is a small team in Uppsala building websites that bring in enquiries \u2013 for businesses all over Sweden.","Vi startade Elevate Studio f\xF6r att det ska vara enkelt f\xF6r f\xF6retag att f\xE5 en hemsida som faktiskt ger kunder. M\xE5nga f\xF6retag har en hemsida som ser okej ut men som inte ger n\xE5gra f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar \u2013 eller ingen hemsida alls, f\xF6r att det k\xE4nns dyrt och kr\xE5ngligt. Vi vill \xE4ndra p\xE5 det: ett fast pris innan vi b\xF6rjar, ett f\xF6rsta utkast redan efter ungef\xE4r en dag och samma kontaktperson hela v\xE4gen.":"We started Elevate Studio to make it easy for businesses to get a website that actually brings in customers. Many businesses have a website that looks okay but doesn't bring in any enquiries \u2013 or no website at all, because it feels expensive and complicated. We want to change that: a fixed price before we start, a first draft after about a day and the same contact person all the way.","Fast pris":"Fixed price","Ni vet vad det kostar innan vi b\xF6rjar. Allt st\xE5r i en tydlig offert p\xE5 tv\xE5 sidor.":"You know what it costs before we start. Everything is in a clear two-page quote.","Samma kontaktperson":"Same contact person","Inga mellanh\xE4nder. Ni pratar med n\xE5gon som kan ert f\xF6retag.":"No middlemen. You talk to someone who knows your business.","Ni \xE4ger er dom\xE4n":"You own your domain","Dom\xE4nen \xE4r och f\xF6rblir er \u2013 oavsett vad som h\xE4nder.":"The domain is and remains yours \u2013 whatever happens.","Bolaget bakom":"The company behind","Org.nr 556969-4358":"Company reg. no. 556969-4358","Elevate Studio \xE4r ett varum\xE4rke som tillh\xF6r PJM Projekteffektivitet AB. Det betyder ett litet, snabbt team mot er som kund \u2013 med ett etablerat bolag i ryggen.":"Elevate Studio is a brand owned by PJM Projekteffektivitet AB. That means a small, fast team for you as a client \u2013 with an established company behind it.","Starter, Pro och Elite \u2013 vad som ing\xE5r och vad det kostar.":"Starter, Pro and Elite \u2013 what's included and what it costs.","S\xE5 ser avtalet ut":"What the agreement looks like","Ett exempel p\xE5 v\xE5r offert, att l\xE4sa eller ladda ner.":"An example of our quote, to read or download.","Se avtalet":"See the agreement","HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Node.js, Python och Playwright.":"HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Node.js, Python and Playwright.","Om oss | Elevate Studio":"About us | Elevate Studio","Elevate Studio \xE4r en webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala och ett varum\xE4rke som tillh\xF6r PJM Projekteffektivitet AB. Vi bygger hemsidor med bokning, offertfl\xF6de och AI-chatt till fast pris.":"Elevate Studio is a web agency in Uppsala and a brand owned by PJM Projekteffektivitet AB. We build websites with booking, quote forms and AI chat at a fixed price.","Enkla,":"Simple,","fasta priser":"fixed prices","Ni vet kostnaden innan vi b\xF6rjar. Alla priser anges exklusive moms.":"You know the cost before we start. All prices are excluding VAT.","startavgift + 99\u2013199 kr/\xE5r":"start-up fee + SEK 99\u2013199/year","En snygg, snabb hemsida som visar vad ni g\xF6r och g\xF6r det enkelt att kontakta er.":"A sleek, fast website that shows what you do and makes it easy to contact you.","Webbdesign och mobilanpassning":"Web design and mobile optimisation","Kontaktfunktion och presentation av verksamhet och projekt":"Contact function and presentation of the business and projects","Grundl\xE4ggande SEO och AI-optimering":"Basic SEO and AI optimisation","Tv\xE5 korrekturv\xE4ndor f\xF6re leverans":"Two rounds of revisions before delivery","Upp till 10 timmars support och redigering per m\xE5nad f\xF6rsta \xE5ret":"Up to 10 hours of support and editing per month the first year","Kom ig\xE5ng":"Get started","6 000 kr":"SEK 6,000","startavgift + 299\u2013399 kr/\xE5r":"start-up fee + SEK 299\u2013399/year","F\xF6r er som vill att hemsidan ska jobba \u2013 ta emot f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar, bokningar och fr\xE5gor \xE5t er.":"For those who want the website to work \u2013 taking enquiries, bookings and questions for you.","Allt i Starter":"Everything in Starter","Offertfl\xF6de eller bokning direkt p\xE5 sidan":"Quote form or booking directly on the site","AI-chatt som svarar p\xE5 vanliga fr\xE5gor":"AI chat that answers common questions","Notiser via e-post och SMS":"Notifications by email and text message","F\xF6rfr\xE5gningar med status och historik":"Enquiries with status and history","V\xE4lj Pro":"Choose Pro",Offert:"Quote","pris efter behov":"price on request","N\xE5got ut\xF6ver det vanliga? St\xF6rre sajter, egna system eller integrationer \u2013 vi tar fram ett uppl\xE4gg och ett fast pris.":"Something out of the ordinary? Larger sites, custom systems or integrations \u2013 we put together a plan and a fixed price.","Allt i Pro":"Everything in Pro","Skr\xE4ddarsydd design och struktur":"Tailored design and structure","Integrationer med era system":"Integrations with your systems","Egna funktioner efter behov":"Custom features as needed","Fast pris i en offert innan vi b\xF6rjar":"Fixed price in a quote before we start","Ber\xE4tta om projektet":"Tell us about the project","Ni f\xE5r allt i en tydlig offert p\xE5 tv\xE5 sidor \u2013 vad som ing\xE5r, n\xE4r det levereras och vad det kostar. Ni godk\xE4nner genom att svara p\xE5 mejlet.":"You get everything in a clear two-page quote \u2013 what's included, when it's delivered and what it costs. You approve by replying to the email.","Se exempel p\xE5 webbavtal":"See an example web agreement","Os\xE4kra p\xE5 vilket som passar?":"Not sure which one suits you?","Boka ett kort m\xF6te s\xE5 hj\xE4lper vi er att v\xE4lja \u2013 utan att ni f\xF6rbinder er till n\xE5got.":"Book a short meeting and we'll help you choose \u2013 with no obligation.","Vad kostar en hemsida? Priser fr\xE5n 3 000 kr | Elevate Studio":"What does a website cost? Prices from SEK 3,000 | Elevate Studio","Vad kostar en hemsida? Fasta priser: Starter 3 000 kr, Pro 6 000 kr och Elite efter offert. Support ing\xE5r f\xF6rsta \xE5ret. Alla priser exkl. moms.":"What does a website cost? Fixed prices: Starter SEK 3,000, Pro SEK 6,000 and Elite on request. Support included the first year. All prices excl. VAT.","Gratis djuptest":"Free in-depth test","Skriv in din adress s\xE5 testar vi sidan i en riktig webbl\xE4sare p\xE5 cirka 30 sekunder. Du f\xE5r betyg f\xF6r prestanda, tillg\xE4nglighet, b\xE4sta praxis och SEO \u2013 och konkreta f\xF6rslag p\xE5 hur allt kan \xE5tg\xE4rdas.":"Enter your address and we'll test the page in a real browser in about 30 seconds. You get scores for performance, accessibility, best practices and SEO \u2013 and concrete suggestions on how everything can be fixed.",Enhet:"Device","Starta djuptest":"Start in-depth test","Startar \u2026":"Starting \u2026","Testet tar oftast 20\u201340 sekunder. St\xE4ng inte sidan.":"The test usually takes 20\u201340 seconds. Don't close the page.",Prestanda:"Performance","Hur snabbt sidan visas och blir klickbar, s\xE4rskilt p\xE5 mobil.":"How quickly the page appears and becomes clickable, especially on mobile.",Tillg\u00E4nglighet:"Accessibility","Om alla kan anv\xE4nda sidan \u2013 kontraster, rubriker, etiketter och mer.":"Whether everyone can use the page \u2013 contrast, headings, labels and more.","SEO & kvalitet":"SEO & quality","Om Google f\xF6rst\xE5r sidan och om den f\xF6ljer moderna riktlinjer f\xF6r s\xE4kerhet.":"Whether Google understands the page and whether it follows modern security guidelines.","Vill du hellre att vi tittar \xE5t dig?":"Would you rather we took a look for you?","Vi g\xF6r g\xE4rna en personlig genomg\xE5ng av din sajt och ber\xE4ttar vad som ger mest effekt.":"We're happy to do a personal review of your site and tell you what will have the most impact.","Testa din sajt | Elevate Studio":"Test your site | Elevate Studio","Skriv in din adress s\xE5 testar vi sidan i en riktig webbl\xE4sare p\xE5 cirka 30 sekunder. Du f\xE5r betyg f\xF6r prestanda, tillg\xE4nglighet, b\xE4sta praxis och SEO \u2013 och \u2026":"Enter your address and we'll test the page in a real browser in about 30 seconds. You get scores for performance, accessibility, best practices and SEO \u2013 and \u2026","Webbyr\xE5 i":"Web agency in","Vi \xE4r en liten webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala som bygger hemsidor som ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar \u2013 f\xF6r f\xF6retag i Uppsala och i hela Sverige.":"We are a small web agency in Uppsala building websites that bring in enquiries \u2013 for businesses in Uppsala and all over Sweden.","Lokal webbyr\xE5 \u2013 samma kontaktperson hela v\xE4gen":"Local web agency \u2013 the same contact person all the way","Som f\xF6retag i Uppsala kan ni tr\xE4ffa oss p\xE5 plats, men det g\xE5r lika bra att ses p\xE5 distans. Ni pratar med samma person fr\xE5n f\xF6rsta m\xF6tet till uppf\xF6ljningen varje m\xE5nad \u2013 inga mellanh\xE4nder och inga l\xE5nga mejltr\xE5dar.":"As a business in Uppsala you can meet us in person, but meeting remotely works just as well. You talk to the same person from the first meeting to the monthly follow-up \u2013 no middlemen and no long email threads.","Det h\xE4r bygger vi":"What we build","Snabba, mobilanpassade hemsidor med tydliga tj\xE4nstesidor och kontakt p\xE5 varje sida.":"Fast, mobile-friendly websites with clear service pages and contact on every page.","Bokningssystem och offertformul\xE4r direkt p\xE5 hemsidan.":"Booking systems and quote forms directly on the website.","AI-chatt som svarar p\xE5 kundernas vanliga fr\xE5gor.":"AI chat that answers your customers' common questions.","SEO och AI-optimering s\xE5 att ni syns p\xE5 Google och i AI-s\xF6k.":"SEO and AI optimisation so you show up on Google and in AI search.","Support och underh\xE5ll efter lansering.":"Support and maintenance after launch.","Fast pris och tydligt avtal":"Fixed price and a clear agreement","Starter kostar 3 000 kr och Pro 6 000 kr i startavgift, plus en l\xE5g \xE5rsavgift. St\xF6rre projekt f\xE5r ett fast pris i en offert. Ni f\xE5r allt p\xE5 tv\xE5 sidor och godk\xE4nner genom att svara p\xE5 mejlet.":"Starter costs SEK 3,000 and Pro SEK 6,000 as a start-up fee, plus a low annual fee. Larger projects get a fixed price in a quote. You get everything on two pages and approve by replying to the email.","Kan vi tr\xE4ffas i Uppsala?":"Can we meet in Uppsala?","Ja. Vi finns i Uppsala och tr\xE4ffar g\xE4rna kunder p\xE5 plats. M\xF6ten g\xE5r ocks\xE5 bra p\xE5 distans.":"Yes. We're based in Uppsala and happy to meet clients in person. Meetings also work well remotely.","Bygger ni hemsidor f\xF6r f\xF6retag utanf\xF6r Uppsala?":"Do you build websites for businesses outside Uppsala?","Ja. Vi bygger hemsidor \xE5t f\xF6retag i hela Sverige.":"Yes. We build websites for businesses all over Sweden.","Webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala \u2013 hemsidor till fast pris | Elevate Studio":"Web agency in Uppsala \u2013 websites at a fixed price | Elevate Studio","Elevate Studio \xE4r en webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala som bygger hemsidor f\xF6r f\xF6retag till fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr. M\xF6t oss p\xE5 plats i Uppsala eller p\xE5 distans.":"Elevate Studio is a web agency in Uppsala building business websites at a fixed price from SEK 3,000. Meet us in person in Uppsala or remotely.","AI-chatt f\xF6r":"AI chat for","Det h\xE4r g\xF6r vi":"What we do","M\xE5nga kunder har samma fr\xE5gor: vad kostar det, n\xE4r kan ni komma, g\xF6r ni det h\xE4r? En AI-chatt svarar direkt utifr\xE5n informationen om ert f\xF6retag, s\xE5 att ni slipper svara p\xE5 samma sak om och om igen \u2013 och kunden f\xE5r svar medan intresset finns.":"Many customers have the same questions: what does it cost, when can you come, do you do this? An AI chat answers right away based on the information about your business, so you don't have to answer the same thing over and over \u2013 and the customer gets an answer while they're still interested.","Boka ett samtal":"Book a call","Det h\xE4r":"What's",ing\u00E5r:"included","Svarar dygnet runt":"Answers around the clock","Kunderna f\xE5r svar direkt, \xE4ven p\xE5 kv\xE4llar och helger.":"Customers get answers right away, even in the evenings and at weekends.","Bygger p\xE5 er information":"Based on your information","Chatten utg\xE5r fr\xE5n era tj\xE4nster, priser och villkor.":"The chat works from your services, prices and terms.","L\xE4mnar \xF6ver till er":"Hands over to you","N\xE4r kunden vill g\xE5 vidare skickas f\xF6rfr\xE5gan till er via e-post eller SMS.":"When the customer wants to go further, the enquiry is sent to you by email or text message.","Testad f\xF6re lansering":"Tested before launch","Vi testar chatten med riktiga fr\xE5gor innan den g\xE5r live.":"We test the chat with real questions before it goes live.","Ni f\xE5r ett fast pris i en offert innan vi b\xF6rjar. Se vad som ing\xE5r i v\xE5ra paket.":"You get a fixed price in a quote before we start. See what's included in our packages.","Vad svarar AI-chatten p\xE5?":"What does the AI chat answer?","Chatten svarar p\xE5 vanliga fr\xE5gor utifr\xE5n informationen om ert f\xF6retag \u2013 till exempel tj\xE4nster, priser, villkor och hur man bokar.":"The chat answers common questions based on the information about your business \u2013 for example services, prices, terms and how to book.","Vad h\xE4nder om chatten inte kan svara?":"What happens if the chat can't answer?","D\xE5 skickas fr\xE5gan vidare till er via e-post eller SMS, s\xE5 att ni kan svara kunden sj\xE4lva.":"Then the question is passed on to you by email or text message, so you can answer the customer yourselves.","Ing\xE5r AI-chatt i paketen?":"Is AI chat included in the packages?","AI-chatt ing\xE5r i Pro och Elite.":"AI chat is included in Pro and Elite.","Fler tj\xE4nster":"More services","H\xE4nder som skriver p\xE5 en laptop":"Hands typing on a laptop","AI-chatt f\xF6r hemsidan \u2013 svarar kunderna dygnet runt":"AI chat for your website \u2013 answers customers around the clock","En AI-chatt p\xE5 hemsidan som svarar p\xE5 kundernas vanliga fr\xE5gor dygnet runt och skickar vidare f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar till er via e-post eller SMS.":"An AI chat on your website that answers your customers' common questions around the clock and passes enquiries on to you by email or text message.","Bokningssystem f\xF6r":"Booking system for",hemsidan:"your website","Varje g\xE5ng en kund m\xE5ste ringa eller mejla fram och tillbaka f\xF6r att hitta en tid finns en risk att de ger upp. Med bokning direkt p\xE5 sidan kan kunden boka p\xE5 en g\xE5ng, \xE4ven n\xE4r ni inte svarar i telefon.":"Every time a customer has to call or email back and forth to find a time, there's a risk they give up. With booking directly on the site, the customer can book straight away, even when you can't answer the phone.","Bokning dygnet runt":"Booking around the clock","Kunden v\xE4ljer en ledig tid direkt p\xE5 sidan, n\xE4r det passar dem.":"The customer picks an available time directly on the site, whenever it suits them.","Ni f\xE5r besked direkt n\xE4r en ny bokning kommer in.":"You're notified as soon as a new booking comes in.","Bekr\xE4ftelse till kunden":"Confirmation to the customer","Kunden f\xE5r en bekr\xE4ftelse s\xE5 att ingen missar tiden.":"The customer gets a confirmation so nobody misses the appointment.","Status och historik":"Status and history","H\xE5ll koll p\xE5 alla bokningar p\xE5 ett st\xE4lle.":"Keep track of all bookings in one place.","Kan kunderna boka utan att ringa?":"Can customers book without calling?","Ja. Kunden v\xE4ljer en ledig tid direkt p\xE5 hemsidan och ni f\xE5r en notis via e-post eller SMS.":"Yes. The customer picks an available time directly on the website and you get a notification by email or text message.","Ing\xE5r bokning i paketen?":"Is booking included in the packages?","Bokning eller offertfl\xF6de ing\xE5r i Pro och Elite.":"Booking or a quote form is included in Pro and Elite.","Person som arbetar vid ett skrivbord med laptop":"A person working at a desk with a laptop","Bokningssystem f\xF6r hemsidan \u2013 l\xE5t kunderna boka online":"Booking system for your website \u2013 let customers book online","L\xE5t kunderna boka tid direkt p\xE5 er hemsida. Bokningssystem med notiser via e-post och SMS \u2013 fr\xE5n Elevate Studio i Uppsala.":"Let customers book a time directly on your website. A booking system with notifications by email and text message \u2013 from Elevate Studio in Uppsala.","Hemsidor f\xF6r":"Websites for",f\u00F6retag:"businesses","En hemsida ska inte bara se bra ut \u2013 den ska ge er nya kunder. Vi bygger sidor med tydliga tj\xE4nstesidor, en v\xE4g till kontakt p\xE5 varje sida och en struktur som Google f\xF6rst\xE5r. Ni f\xE5r ett fast pris innan vi b\xF6rjar och ser ett f\xF6rsta utkast redan efter ungef\xE4r en dag.":"A website shouldn't just look good \u2013 it should bring you new customers. We build sites with clear service pages, a way to get in touch on every page and a structure Google understands. You get a fixed price before we start and see a first draft after about a day.","Design efter er verksamhet":"Design based on your business","En design som passar ert f\xF6retag och era kunder \u2013 inte en mall som ser ut som alla andras.":"A design that suits your business and your customers \u2013 not a template that looks like everyone else's.",Mobilanpassning:"Mobile optimisation","De flesta bes\xF6kare kommer fr\xE5n telefonen. Sidan fungerar lika bra p\xE5 mobil som p\xE5 dator.":"Most visitors come from their phones. The site works just as well on mobile as on desktop.",Tj\u00E4nstesidor:"Service pages","En egen sida f\xF6r varje tj\xE4nst g\xF6r det l\xE4ttare f\xF6r b\xE5de kunder och Google att hitta r\xE4tt.":"A separate page for each service makes it easier for both customers and Google to find the right thing.","Kontakt p\xE5 varje sida":"Contact on every page","Telefon, mejl och formul\xE4r \xE4r alltid ett klick bort.":"Phone, email and form are always one click away.","Vad kostar en hemsida hos er?":"What does a website from you cost?","Hur l\xE5ng tid tar det att bygga en hemsida?":"How long does it take to build a website?","Kan ni g\xF6ra om v\xE5r gamla hemsida?":"Can you redo our old website?","Ja. Vi kan bygga en ny sida fr\xE5n grunden och flytta \xF6ver det inneh\xE5ll som fungerar fr\xE5n den gamla.":"Yes. We can build a new site from scratch and move over the content that works from the old one.","Hemsidor f\xF6r f\xF6retag i Uppsala och hela Sverige | Elevate Studio":"Websites for businesses in Uppsala and all of Sweden | Elevate Studio","Vi bygger snabba, mobilanpassade hemsidor f\xF6r f\xF6retag och hantverkare \u2013 med fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr. Webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala, kunder i hela Sverige.":"We build fast, mobile-friendly websites for businesses and tradespeople \u2013 at a fixed price from SEK 3,000. Web agency in Uppsala, clients all over Sweden.","Vad vi":"What we",g\u00F6r:"do","Hemsidor som ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar \u2013 och de smarta funktionerna runt omkring. Allt fr\xE5n samma lilla team i Uppsala.":"Websites that bring in enquiries \u2013 and the smart features around them. All from the same small team in Uppsala.","Mobilanpassad design med tydliga tj\xE4nstesidor. Ett f\xF6rsta utkast ser ni efter ungef\xE4r en dag.":"Mobile-friendly design with clear service pages. You see a first draft after about a day.","Offertfl\xF6de, bokning, AI-chatt och notiser testas f\xF6re lansering.":"Quote forms, booking, AI chat and notifications are tested before launch.","Sidan lanseras och indexeras av Google.":"The site is launched and indexed by Google.","Vi f\xF6ljer upp vad som ger kunder och justerar l\xF6pande.":"We follow up on what brings in customers and adjust continuously.","Tj\xE4nster \u2013 hemsidor, bokning, offert, AI-chatt och SEO":"Services \u2013 websites, booking, quotes, AI chat and SEO","Elevate Studio bygger hemsidor f\xF6r f\xF6retag och kopplar p\xE5 bokningssystem, offertsystem, AI-chatt, SEO och support. Fast pris, webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala.":"Elevate Studio builds business websites and adds booking systems, quote systems, AI chat, SEO and support. Fixed price, web agency in Uppsala.","Offertsystem f\xF6r":"Quote system for","En vag f\xF6rfr\xE5gan betyder ofta flera mejl fram och tillbaka innan ni kan r\xE4kna p\xE5 jobbet. Med ett offertfl\xF6de f\xE5r kunden svara p\xE5 r\xE4tt fr\xE5gor fr\xE5n b\xF6rjan \u2013 och ni f\xE5r en komplett f\xF6rfr\xE5gan som g\xE5r att svara p\xE5 samma dag.":"A vague enquiry often means several emails back and forth before you can price the job. With a quote form, the customer answers the right questions from the start \u2013 and you get a complete enquiry you can reply to the same day.","Fr\xE5gor steg f\xF6r steg":"Questions step by step","Kunden svarar p\xE5 de fr\xE5gor ni beh\xF6ver f\xF6r att kunna l\xE4mna ett pris.":"The customer answers the questions you need to be able to give a price.","Bilder och underlag":"Photos and details","Kunden kan bifoga bilder eller beskrivningar direkt i f\xF6rfr\xE5gan.":"The customer can attach photos or descriptions directly in the enquiry.","Ni f\xE5r besked direkt n\xE4r en ny f\xF6rfr\xE5gan kommer in.":"You're notified as soon as a new enquiry comes in.","Se vilka f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar som \xE4r besvarade och vilka som v\xE4ntar.":"See which enquiries have been answered and which are waiting.","Vad \xE4r ett offertsystem p\xE5 hemsidan?":"What is a quote system on a website?","Ett formul\xE4r d\xE4r kunden beskriver jobbet steg f\xF6r steg, s\xE5 att ni f\xE5r alla uppgifter ni beh\xF6ver f\xF6r att kunna l\xE4mna ett pris.":"A form where the customer describes the job step by step, so you get all the details you need to give a price.","Passar det f\xF6r hantverkare?":"Is it suitable for tradespeople?","Ja. Offertfl\xF6den passar s\xE4rskilt bra f\xF6r hantverkare och andra tj\xE4nstef\xF6retag som beh\xF6ver veta mer om jobbet innan de kan ge ett pris.":"Yes. Quote forms are especially good for tradespeople and other service businesses that need to know more about the job before they can give a price.","Kollegor som tittar p\xE5 en laptop tillsammans":"Colleagues looking at a laptop together","Offertsystem och offertformul\xE4r f\xF6r hemsidan | Elevate Studio":"Quote systems and quote forms for your website | Elevate Studio","Ett offertformul\xE4r d\xE4r kunden beskriver jobbet steg f\xF6r steg, s\xE5 att ni f\xE5r kompletta f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar. Perfekt f\xF6r hantverkare och tj\xE4nstef\xF6retag.":"A quote form where the customer describes the job step by step, so you get complete enquiries. Perfect for tradespeople and service businesses.","SEO och":"SEO and","AI-optimering":"AI optimisation","Det spelar ingen roll hur bra hemsidan \xE4r om ingen hittar den. Vi bygger sidan s\xE5 att Google och AI-tj\xE4nster f\xF6rst\xE5r vad ni g\xF6r, var ni finns och vilka fr\xE5gor ni kan svara p\xE5. Grundl\xE4ggande SEO och AI-optimering ing\xE5r i alla hemsidor vi bygger.":"It doesn't matter how good the website is if nobody finds it. We build the site so that Google and AI services understand what you do, where you are and which questions you can answer. Basic SEO and AI optimisation are included in every website we build.","Teknisk grund":"Technical foundation","Snabba sidor, r\xE4tt rubriker, beskrivningar och strukturerad data som s\xF6kmotorer l\xE4ser.":"Fast pages, the right headings, descriptions and structured data that search engines read.","Lokala s\xF6kningar":"Local searches","Tydlig information om var ni finns och vilka orter ni jobbar i.":"Clear information about where you are and which areas you work in.","Inneh\xE5ll och struktur som g\xF6r det l\xE4tt f\xF6r AI-tj\xE4nster att beskriva er r\xE4tt.":"Content and structure that make it easy for AI services to describe you correctly.","Svar p\xE5 vanliga fr\xE5gor":"Answers to common questions","Svar p\xE5 det kunderna faktiskt s\xF6ker efter, direkt p\xE5 sidan.":"Answers to what customers actually search for, right on the page.","Ing\xE5r SEO i hemsidan?":"Is SEO included in the website?","Ja. Grundl\xE4ggande s\xF6kmotoroptimering och AI-optimering ing\xE5r i alla hemsidor vi bygger.":"Yes. Basic search engine optimisation and AI optimisation are included in every website we build.","Vad \xE4r AI-optimering?":"What is AI optimisation?","Att bygga sidan s\xE5 att AI-tj\xE4nster som ChatGPT kan f\xF6rst\xE5 och beskriva ert f\xF6retag r\xE4tt \u2013 med tydliga fakta, vanliga fr\xE5gor och strukturerad data.":"Building the site so that AI services like ChatGPT can understand and describe your business correctly \u2013 with clear facts, common questions and structured data.","SEO och AI-optimering \u2013 syns p\xE5 Google och i AI-s\xF6k":"SEO and AI optimisation \u2013 show up on Google and in AI search","S\xF6kmotoroptimering och AI-optimering s\xE5 att kunderna hittar ert f\xF6retag p\xE5 Google och n\xE4r de fr\xE5gar ChatGPT och andra AI-tj\xE4nster.":"Search engine optimisation and AI optimisation so customers find your business on Google and when they ask ChatGPT and other AI services.","Support och":"Support and",underh\u00E5ll:"maintenance","En hemsida \xE4r aldrig helt f\xE4rdig. Under f\xF6rsta \xE5ret ing\xE5r upp till 10 timmars support och redigering per m\xE5nad \u2013 f\xF6r text- och bild\xE4ndringar, layoutjusteringar eller nya funktioner. Vi f\xF6ljer ocks\xE5 upp vad som ger kunder och f\xF6resl\xE5r f\xF6rb\xE4ttringar.":"A website is never completely finished. During the first year, up to 10 hours of support and editing per month are included \u2013 for text and image changes, layout adjustments or new features. We also follow up on what brings in customers and suggest improvements.","10 timmar i m\xE5naden":"10 hours a month","Under f\xF6rsta \xE5ret ing\xE5r upp till 10 timmars support och redigering varje m\xE5nad.":"During the first year, up to 10 hours of support and editing are included every month.",\u00C4ndringar:"Changes","Nya texter, bilder, priser eller tj\xE4nster \u2013 s\xE4g till s\xE5 fixar vi det.":"New texts, images, prices or services \u2013 just tell us and we'll fix it.",Uppf\u00F6ljning:"Follow-up","Vi tittar p\xE5 vad som ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar och justerar det som kan bli b\xE4ttre.":"We look at what brings in enquiries and adjust what can be improved.","Ni pratar med samma person hela v\xE4gen, utan mellanh\xE4nder.":"You talk to the same person all the way, with no middlemen.","Vad ing\xE5r i supporten?":"What's included in the support?","Under f\xF6rsta \xE5ret ing\xE5r upp till 10 timmars support och redigering per m\xE5nad, till exempel text- och bild\xE4ndringar, layoutjusteringar eller nya funktioner.":"During the first year, up to 10 hours of support and editing per month are included, for example text and image changes, layout adjustments or new features.","Vad h\xE4nder efter f\xF6rsta \xE5ret?":"What happens after the first year?","Den inkluderade timsupporten upph\xF6r och \xE5rsavgiften forts\xE4tter. Fortsatt support och utveckling kan avtalas separat.":"The included hourly support ends and the annual fee continues. Continued support and development can be agreed separately.","Person med laptop som arbetar med webbplatsens drift":"A person with a laptop working on website operations","Support och underh\xE5ll av hemsida | Elevate Studio":"Website support and maintenance | Elevate Studio","\xC4ndringar, uppdateringar och uppf\xF6ljning av er hemsida. Upp till 10 timmars support per m\xE5nad ing\xE5r f\xF6rsta \xE5ret.":"Changes, updates and follow-up for your website. Up to 10 hours of support per month included the first year.","En kulturhistorisk f\xF6rening som ville g\xF6ra sitt arkiv tillg\xE4ngligt f\xF6r fler.":"A cultural heritage society that wanted to make its archive accessible to more people.",S\u00F6k:"Search",Webb:"Web",F\u00F6re:"Before",Efter:"After","P\xE5hittat exempelprojekt som visar hur vi arbetar.":"Fictional example project that shows how we work.",Utmaningen:"The challenge","F\xF6reningens samlingar fanns digitaliserade men var g\xF6mda bakom en f\xF6r\xE5ldrad s\xF6kfunktion som bara forskare orkade anv\xE4nda.":"The society's collections were digitised but hidden behind an outdated search function that only researchers had the patience to use.",L\u00F6sningen:"The solution","Vi tog fram en ny struktur d\xE4r samlingarna g\xE5r att utforska via teman, platser och tidsperioder, med en s\xF6kning som f\xF6rst\xE5r stavfel och gamla ortnamn.":"We created a new structure where the collections can be explored by theme, place and period, with a search that understands spelling mistakes and old place names.",Resultatet:"The result","Bes\xF6karna stannar l\xE4ngre och arkivet anv\xE4nds nu \xE4ven av skolor och sl\xE4ktforskare.":"Visitors stay longer, and the archive is now also used by schools and genealogists.","N\xE4sta projekt":"Next project",Kund:"Client","Kund hos oss":"A client of ours","Om kunden":"About the client","Det h\xE4r finns p\xE5 hemsidan":"What the website includes",St\u00E4dfirma:"Cleaning company","Alvhem St\xE4d":"Alvhem St\xE4d","Vi bygger mobilen f\xF6rst och finputsar varje sk\xE4rmstorlek. Alvhem St\xE4d \xE4r kund hos oss \u2013 s\xE5 h\xE4r ser deras hemsida ut p\xE5 dator och mobil. L\xE4ngre ner finns fler exempel p\xE5 hur vi arbetar.":"We build for mobile first and polish every screen size. Alvhem St\xE4d is a client of ours \u2013 this is what their website looks like on a laptop and a phone. Further down you will find more examples of how we work.","Vi bygger mobilen f\xF6rst och finputsar varje sk\xE4rmstorlek. Alvhem St\xE4d \xE4r kund hos oss \u2013 s\xE5 h\xE4r ser deras hemsida ut p\xE5 dator och mobil.":"We build for mobile first and polish every screen size. Alvhem St\xE4d is a client of ours \u2013 this is what their website looks like on a laptop and a phone.","Alvhem St\xE4d \xE4r kund hos oss. \xD6vriga exempel \xE4r p\xE5hittade och visar hur vi arbetar.":"Alvhem St\xE4d is a client of ours. The other examples are fictional and show how we work.","Haninge Byggteam AB och Alvhem St\xE4d \xE4r kunder hos oss. \xD6vriga namn \xE4r p\xE5hittade exempel som visar hur vi arbetar.":"Haninge Byggteam AB and Alvhem St\xE4d are clients of ours. The other names are fictional examples that show how we work.","St\xE4dfirma i \xC4lv\xE4ngen utanf\xF6r G\xF6teborg med hemst\xE4dning, storst\xE4dning, flyttst\xE4dning och kontorsst\xE4dning till fasta priser.":"Cleaning company in \xC4lv\xE4ngen outside Gothenburg offering home cleaning, deep cleaning, move-out cleaning and office cleaning at fixed prices.","Alvhem St\xE4d AB hj\xE4lper privatpersoner och f\xF6retag med regelbunden hemst\xE4dning, storst\xE4dning, flyttst\xE4dning och kontorsst\xE4dning. Fasta priser, RUT-avdrag direkt p\xE5 fakturan, n\xF6jd kund-garanti och samma st\xE4dare vid varje tillf\xE4lle.":"Alvhem St\xE4d AB helps households and businesses with regular home cleaning, deep cleaning, move-out cleaning and office cleaning. Fixed prices, the Swedish RUT tax deduction applied directly on the invoice, a satisfaction guarantee and the same cleaner every time.","Telefonnumret syns h\xF6gst upp p\xE5 varje sida":"The phone number is visible at the top of every page","Tj\xE4nster med tydliga priser och RUT-avdrag":"Services with clear prices and the RUT deduction","Kontaktformul\xE4r d\xE4r kunden v\xE4ljer typ av st\xE4dning och anger yta":"A contact form where the customer picks the type of cleaning and enters the floor area","Film i toppen som visar jobbet":"A video at the top that shows the work","Egen sida f\xF6r varje st\xE4dtj\xE4nst, med priser":"A page of its own for every cleaning service, with prices","Priskalkyl som r\xE4knar av RUT-avdraget direkt":"A price calculator that deducts the RUT tax reduction right away","Boka uppstartsm\xF6te fr\xE5n varje sida":"Book a start-up meeting from every page","Anpassad f\xF6r mobilen":"Built for mobile","Dra i reglaget och j\xE4mf\xF6r Alvhem St\xE4ds gamla hemsida med den nya.":"Drag the slider to compare Alvhem St\xE4d's old website with the new one.","Alvhem St\xE4ds gamla hemsida":"Alvhem St\xE4d's old website","Alvhem St\xE4ds nya hemsida":"Alvhem St\xE4d's new website","Alvhem St\xE4d \u2013 kund hos Elevate Studio":"Alvhem St\xE4d \u2013 a client of Elevate Studio","Dra f\xF6r att j\xE4mf\xF6ra f\xF6re och efter":"Drag to compare before and after","En ny e-handel f\xF6r reservdelar d\xE4r kunderna hittar r\xE4tt del p\xE5 n\xE5gra klick, oavsett bilmodell.":"A new online shop for spare parts where customers find the right part in a few clicks, whatever the car model.","E-handel":"E-commerce","Kunderna hade sv\xE5rt att veta vilka delar som passade deras bil. M\xE5nga ringde kundtj\xE4nst innan de v\xE5gade best\xE4lla, och andelen returer var h\xF6g.":"Customers found it hard to know which parts fitted their car. Many called customer service before daring to order, and the return rate was high.","Vi byggde en s\xF6kning d\xE4r kunden anger registreringsnummer och direkt f\xE5r se delar som passar. Kassan f\xF6renklades till ett steg och produktsidorna fick tydligare bilder och monteringsinformation.":"We built a search where the customer enters the registration number and immediately sees parts that fit. The checkout was simplified to one step, and the product pages got clearer images and fitting information.","F\xE4rre samtal till kundtj\xE4nst, f\xE4rre returer och en kassa som fler slutf\xF6r.":"Fewer calls to customer service, fewer returns and a checkout that more people complete.","Intran\xE4t och publika sajter f\xF6r medarbetare och kunder i m\xE5nga l\xE4nder.":"Intranet and public sites for employees and customers in many countries.",Intran\u00E4t:"Intranet","Ett internationellt industrif\xF6retag hade ett tiotal olika sajter och intran\xE4t som inte pratade med varandra.":"An international industrial company had around ten different sites and intranets that didn't talk to each other.","Vi samlade allt p\xE5 en gemensam plattform med ett designsystem, delade komponenter och ett gemensamt fl\xF6de f\xF6r \xF6vers\xE4ttningar.":"We brought everything together on a shared platform with a design system, shared components and a common workflow for translations.","Snabbare publicering, ett enhetligt varum\xE4rke och l\xE4gre f\xF6rvaltningskostnad.":"Faster publishing, a consistent brand and lower maintenance costs.","Vi bygger mobilen f\xF6rst. Lindvik Bygg \xE4r en hemsida vi har byggt f\xF6r att visa hur det kan se ut \u2013 p\xE5 dator och mobil. L\xE4ngre ner finns exempel p\xE5 hur vi arbetar.":"We build for mobile first. Lindvik Bygg is a website we have built to show what it can look like \u2013 on desktop and mobile. Further down you'll find examples of how we work.",Fr\u00E5n:"From",f\u00F6re:"before",till:"to",efter:"after","Dra i reglaget och se skillnaden mellan en typisk gammal hemsida och Lindvik Bygg. Mobil f\xF6rst, tydliga tj\xE4nster och kontakt p\xE5 varje sida.":"Drag the slider and see the difference between a typical old website and Lindvik Bygg. Mobile first, clear services and contact on every page.","Exempel p\xE5":"Example",projekt:"projects","En app och en webb som g\xF6r det enkelt och tryggt att s\xF6ka st\xF6d, n\xE4r som helst p\xE5 dygnet.":"An app and a website that make it easy and safe to seek support, any time of day or night.",App:"App","En filmfestival som beh\xF6vde samla biljetter, program och nyheter p\xE5 ett st\xE4lle.":"A film festival that needed to bring tickets, programme and news together in one place.","En insamlingsorganisation som ville f\xE5 fler m\xE5nadsgivare.":"A fundraising organisation that wanted more monthly donors.",Marknadsf\u00F6ring:"Marketing","Projekt och exempel p\xE5 hemsidor | Elevate Studio":"Projects and website examples | Elevate Studio","Se exempel p\xE5 hemsidor fr\xE5n Elevate Studio \u2013 Lindvik Bygg p\xE5 dator och mobil, f\xF6re och efter, och exempel p\xE5 hur vi arbetar.":"See website examples from Elevate Studio \u2013 Lindvik Bygg on desktop and mobile, before and after, and examples of how we work.","Se hemsidor fr\xE5n Elevate Studio \u2013 Alvhem St\xE4d p\xE5 dator och mobil, f\xF6re och efter, och exempel p\xE5 hur vi arbetar.":"See websites by Elevate Studio \u2013 Alvhem St\xE4d on a laptop and a phone, before and after, and examples of how we work.","Givarna ville k\xE4nna sig trygga med att pengarna g\xF6r nytta, och organisationen ville \xF6ka andelen m\xE5nadsgivare.":"Donors wanted to feel confident that the money makes a difference, and the organisation wanted to increase the share of monthly donors.","Vi f\xF6renklade givarfl\xF6det, lyfte fram konkreta resultat och byggde kampanjsidor som marknadsteamet kan skapa sj\xE4lva.":"We simplified the donation flow, highlighted concrete results and built campaign pages the marketing team can create themselves.","Fler m\xE5nadsgivare och kampanjer som lanseras p\xE5 dagar i st\xE4llet f\xF6r veckor.":"More monthly donors and campaigns launched in days instead of weeks.","Under festivalveckan \xF6kar trafiken tiofalt. Den gamla sajten gick ner varje \xE5r n\xE4r biljettsl\xE4ppet startade.":"During festival week, traffic increases tenfold. The old site went down every year when ticket sales opened.","Vi byggde en statiskt genererad sajt med cachning i flera lager och ett separat, skalbart fl\xF6de f\xF6r biljetter. Ett intran\xE4t hj\xE4lper personalen att h\xE5lla programmet uppdaterat.":"We built a statically generated site with multi-layer caching and a separate, scalable flow for tickets. An intranet helps the staff keep the programme up to date.","Sajten klarade festivalens toppar utan avbrott och programmet uppdateras nu i realtid.":"The site handled the festival's peaks without downtime, and the programme is now updated in real time.","En ideell st\xF6dlinje beh\xF6vde n\xE5 unga som inte ringer, men som g\xE4rna skriver. Tj\xE4nsten m\xE5ste vara diskret, trygg och fungera p\xE5 alla telefoner.":"A non-profit support line needed to reach young people who don't call but are happy to write. The service had to be discreet, safe and work on every phone.","Vi designade en chattbaserad tj\xE4nst med snabb utloggning, ingen sparad historik p\xE5 enheten och ett lugnt, inkluderande bildspr\xE5k.":"We designed a chat-based service with quick exit, no history saved on the device and a calm, inclusive visual style.","Fler tar kontakt via chatt, och volont\xE4rerna kan hj\xE4lpa fler samtidigt.":"More people get in touch via chat, and the volunteers can help more people at the same time.","En hemsida kan vara snygg och \xE4nd\xE5 inte ge en enda f\xF6rfr\xE5gan. Oftast beror det inte p\xE5 designen, utan p\xE5 att bes\xF6karen inte f\xF6rst\xE5r vad ni g\xF6r, inte litar p\xE5 er eller inte hittar hur man tar kontakt. H\xE4r \xE4r fem saker som g\xF6r st\xF6rst skillnad.":"A website can look great and still not bring in a single enquiry. Usually it's not the design, but that visitors don't understand what you do, don't trust you or can't find how to get in touch. Here are five things that make the biggest difference.","1. S\xE4g vad ni g\xF6r \u2013 direkt":"1. Say what you do \u2013 right away","Den f\xF6rsta rubriken ska ber\xE4tta vad ni erbjuder och var. \u201DBadrumsrenoveringar i Uppsala\u201D fungerar b\xE4ttre \xE4n \u201DKvalitet i varje detalj\u201D, b\xE5de f\xF6r bes\xF6karen och f\xF6r Google.":"The first headline should say what you offer and where. \u201CBathroom renovations in Uppsala\u201D works better than \u201CQuality in every detail\u201D, both for the visitor and for Google.","2. G\xF6r det l\xE4tt att ta kontakt":"2. Make it easy to get in touch","Telefonnummer och en knapp f\xF6r att h\xF6ra av sig ska synas p\xE5 varje sida, inte bara p\xE5 kontaktsidan. Ju f\xE4rre klick, desto fler f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar.":"A phone number and a button to get in touch should be visible on every page, not just the contact page. The fewer clicks, the more enquiries.","3. En sida per tj\xE4nst":"3. One page per service","En egen sida f\xF6r varje tj\xE4nst g\xF6r det enklare f\xF6r bes\xF6karen att hitta r\xE4tt \u2013 och f\xF6r Google att visa er n\xE4r n\xE5gon s\xF6ker p\xE5 just den tj\xE4nsten.":"A separate page for each service makes it easier for visitors to find the right thing \u2013 and for Google to show you when someone searches for that particular service.","4. Visa att ni \xE4r p\xE5 riktigt":"4. Show that you're real","Bilder p\xE5 riktiga jobb, recensioner fr\xE5n kunder och namnen p\xE5 dem som jobbar hos er bygger f\xF6rtroende snabbare \xE4n allm\xE4nna l\xF6ften.":"Photos of real jobs, reviews from customers and the names of the people who work for you build trust faster than general promises.","5. Snabb p\xE5 mobilen":"5. Fast on mobile","De flesta bes\xF6kare kommer fr\xE5n telefonen. En sida som laddar l\xE5ngsamt eller \xE4r sv\xE5r att anv\xE4nda p\xE5 liten sk\xE4rm tappar dem innan de ens l\xE4st rubriken. Du kan testa din egen sida gratis med v\xE5rt djuptest.":"Most visitors come from their phones. A site that loads slowly or is hard to use on a small screen loses them before they've even read the headline. You can test your own site for free with our in-depth test.",L\u00E4s:"Read",mer:"more","Fem saker som f\xE5r bes\xF6kare att h\xF6ra av sig | Elevate Studio":"Five things that make visitors get in touch | Elevate Studio","En hemsida kan vara snygg och \xE4nd\xE5 inte ge en enda f\xF6rfr\xE5gan. Oftast beror det inte p\xE5 designen, utan p\xE5 att bes\xF6karen inte f\xF6rst\xE5r vad ni g\xF6r, inte litar \u2026":"A website can look great and still not bring in a single enquiry. Usually it's not the design, but that visitors don't understand what you do, don't trust \u2026","Guider och tips om hemsidor, synlighet p\xE5 Google och i AI-s\xF6k, bokning, offertfl\xF6den och hur ni f\xE5r fler f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar.":"Guides and tips about websites, visibility on Google and in AI search, booking, quote forms and how to get more enquiries.","Senaste nytt | Elevate Studio":"Latest news | Elevate Studio","Allt fler s\xF6ker inte l\xE4ngre bara p\xE5 Google, utan st\xE4ller fr\xE5gan direkt till en AI-assistent: \u201DVilken snickare i Haninge kan bygga om mitt k\xF6k?\u201D Svaret bygger p\xE5 det som finns att l\xE4sa om ditt f\xF6retag p\xE5 n\xE4tet \u2013 och d\xE5 beh\xF6ver din hemsida s\xE4ga r\xE4tt saker, p\xE5 r\xE4tt s\xE4tt.":"More and more people no longer just search on Google, but ask an AI assistant directly: \u201CWhich carpenter in Haninge can redo my kitchen?\u201D The answer is based on what can be read about your business online \u2013 so your website needs to say the right things, in the right way.","Fr\xE5n placering till omn\xE4mnande":"From ranking to being mentioned","I vanlig s\xF6kning handlar det om att hamna h\xF6gt i en lista. I ett AI-svar finns ingen lista \u2013 antingen n\xE4mns ditt f\xF6retag, eller s\xE5 g\xF6r det inte det. Och n\xE4r det n\xE4mns m\xE5ste informationen st\xE4mma.":"In regular search, it's about ranking high in a list. In an AI answer there is no list \u2013 either your business is mentioned or it isn't. And when it is mentioned, the information has to be correct.","Tre saker att b\xF6rja med":"Three things to start with","Beskriv tydligt vad ni g\xF6r, f\xF6r vem och var \u2013 med samma ord p\xE5 alla sidor.":"Describe clearly what you do, for whom and where \u2013 using the same words on every page.","Svara p\xE5 de fr\xE5gor kunderna faktiskt st\xE4ller, till exempel i en sektion med vanliga fr\xE5gor.":"Answer the questions customers actually ask, for example in a section with common questions.","H\xE5ll kontaktuppgifter, \xF6ppettider och tj\xE4nster uppdaterade, b\xE5de p\xE5 sajten och i Googles f\xF6retagsprofil.":"Keep contact details, opening hours and services up to date, both on the site and in your Google Business Profile.","Det mesta som g\xF6r dig synlig f\xF6r AI g\xF6r dig ocks\xE5 b\xE4ttre p\xE5 Google. D\xE4rf\xF6r ing\xE5r b\xE5de s\xF6kmotoroptimering (SEO) och AI-optimering i alla hemsidor vi bygger.":"Most of what makes you visible to AI also makes you better on Google. That's why both search engine optimisation (SEO) and AI optimisation are included in every website we build.","S\xE5 syns ditt f\xF6retag n\xE4r kunder fr\xE5gar AI | Elevate Studio":"How your business shows up when customers ask AI | Elevate Studio","Allt fler s\xF6ker inte l\xE4ngre bara p\xE5 Google, utan st\xE4ller fr\xE5gan direkt till en AI-assistent: \u201DVilken snickare i Haninge kan bygga om mitt k\xF6k?\u201D Svaret \u2026":"More and more people no longer just search on Google, but ask an AI assistant directly: \u201CWhich carpenter in Haninge can redo my kitchen?\u201D The answer \u2026","Fr\xE5gan om vad en hemsida kostar f\xE5r svar som spretar fr\xE5n n\xE5gra hundralappar till hundratusentals kronor. Skillnaden ligger s\xE4llan i sj\xE4lva sidan, utan i vad som ing\xE5r \u2013 och i vad som tillkommer efter\xE5t.":"Ask what a website costs and the answers range from a few hundred kronor to hundreds of thousands. The difference rarely lies in the site itself, but in what's included \u2013 and what comes on top afterwards.","Det h\xE4r brukar priset best\xE5 av":"What the price usually consists of","En startkostnad f\xF6r design och bygge av sidan.":"A start-up cost for designing and building the site.","En l\xF6pande kostnad f\xF6r dom\xE4n, drift och hosting.":"An ongoing cost for domain, operation and hosting.","Support och \xE4ndringar efter lansering \u2013 ing\xE5r de, eller betalar du per timme?":"Support and changes after launch \u2013 are they included, or do you pay by the hour?","Funktioner som bokning, offertformul\xE4r eller chatt, som ofta priss\xE4tts separat.":"Features like booking, quote forms or chat, which are often priced separately.","Fem fr\xE5gor att st\xE4lla innan du v\xE4ljer leverant\xF6r":"Five questions to ask before you choose a supplier","\xC4r priset fast, eller kan det bli dyrare under arbetets g\xE5ng?":"Is the price fixed, or can it get more expensive as the work goes on?","Vem \xE4ger dom\xE4nen \u2013 du eller leverant\xF6ren?":"Who owns the domain \u2013 you or the supplier?","Vad ing\xE5r i supporten, och hur l\xE4nge?":"What's included in the support, and for how long?","Vad kostar det efter f\xF6rsta \xE5ret?":"What does it cost after the first year?","Finns det n\xE5gon bindningstid?":"Is there a minimum contract period?","S\xE5 g\xF6r vi":"How we do it","Hos oss f\xE5r du ett fast pris i en offert innan vi b\xF6rjar. Starter kostar 3 000 kr i startavgift och d\xE4refter 99\u2013199 kr per \xE5r, och under f\xF6rsta \xE5ret ing\xE5r upp till 10 timmars support och \xE4ndringar per m\xE5nad. Dom\xE4nen \xE4r alltid din. P\xE5 v\xE5r prissida ser du vad som ing\xE5r i varje paket, och du kan ladda ner ett exempel p\xE5 hur v\xE5rt avtal ser ut.":"With us you get a fixed price in a quote before we start. Starter costs SEK 3,000 as a start-up fee and then SEK 99\u2013199 per year, and during the first year up to 10 hours of support and changes per month are included. The domain is always yours. On our prices page you can see what's included in each package, and you can download an example of what our agreement looks like.","Fr\xE5gan om vad en hemsida kostar f\xE5r svar som spretar fr\xE5n n\xE5gra hundralappar till hundratusentals kronor. Skillnaden ligger s\xE4llan i sj\xE4lva sidan, utan i \u2026":"Ask what a website costs and the answers range from a few hundred kronor to hundreds of thousands. The difference rarely lies in the site itself, but in \u2026",Plattform:"Platform","Grunden i allt som visas i en webbl\xE4sare \u2013 och det som avg\xF6r om en sida k\xE4nns snabb, tydlig och tillg\xE4nglig.":"The foundation of everything shown in a browser \u2013 and what decides whether a page feels fast, clear and accessible.","Ramverk kommer och g\xE5r, men allt som syns p\xE5 sk\xE4rmen blir till slut HTML och CSS. Vi l\xE4gger mycket omsorg p\xE5 semantisk struktur och v\xE4l organiserad CSS, eftersom det \xE4r d\xE4r prestanda och tillg\xE4nglighet vinns eller f\xF6rloras.":"Frameworks come and go, but everything on the screen eventually becomes HTML and CSS. We put a lot of care into semantic structure and well-organised CSS, because that's where performance and accessibility are won or lost.","med HTML & CSS":"with HTML & CSS","Semantisk struktur":"Semantic structure","R\xE4tt element f\xF6r r\xE4tt inneh\xE5ll g\xF6r sidan begriplig f\xF6r b\xE5de sk\xE4rml\xE4sare och s\xF6kmotorer.":"The right element for the right content makes the page understandable for both screen readers and search engines.","Moderna layouter":"Modern layouts","Flexbox, grid och scroll-snap ger responsiva layouter utan tunga bibliotek.":"Flexbox, grid and scroll-snap give responsive layouts without heavy libraries.",Designvariabler:"Design variables","F\xE4rger, typografi och avst\xE5nd samlas i CSS-variabler som g\xF6r teman enkla att byta.":"Colours, typography and spacing are gathered in CSS variables that make themes easy to switch.","S\xE5 anv\xE4nds det":"How it's used","p\xE5 den h\xE4r sajten":"on this site","Hela den h\xE4r sajten \xE4r handskriven HTML och CSS utan ramverk.":"This whole site is hand-written HTML and CSS without a framework.","Den gr\xF6na och beige f\xE4rgskalan styrs av ett f\xE5tal CSS-variabler, s\xE5 hela sajten kan byta f\xE4rg genom att \xE4ndra dem.":"The green and beige colour scheme is controlled by a handful of CSS variables, so the whole site can change colour by changing them.","Karusellerna p\xE5 mobil \xE4r byggda med scroll-snap i ren CSS.":"The carousels on mobile are built with scroll-snap in pure CSS.","Fler plattformar":"More platforms",V\u00E5ra:"Our",plattformar:"platforms","Verktygen och teknikerna vi bygger med \u2013 samma verktyg som anv\xE4ndes f\xF6r att bygga just den h\xE4r sajten.":"The tools and technologies we build with \u2013 the same tools that were used to build this very site.","Vi v\xE4ljer tekniken efter uppdraget, inte tv\xE4rtom.":"We choose the technology to fit the job, not the other way round.","Ibland \xE4r ett ramverk r\xE4tt, ibland r\xE4cker ren HTML, CSS och lite JavaScript. Det viktiga \xE4r att l\xF6sningen \xE4r snabb, tillg\xE4nglig och l\xE4tt att f\xF6rvalta f\xF6r dem som ska ta hand om den efter lansering.":"Sometimes a framework is right, sometimes plain HTML, CSS and a little JavaScript is enough. What matters is that the solution is fast, accessible and easy to maintain for those who look after it after launch.","Plattformar | Elevate Studio":"Platforms | Elevate Studio","Spr\xE5ket som g\xF6r webbsidor interaktiva, och som vi anv\xE4nder b\xE5de i webbl\xE4saren och p\xE5 servern.":"The language that makes web pages interactive, and that we use both in the browser and on the server.","Vi anv\xE4nder JavaScript d\xE4r det tillf\xF6r n\xE5got: menyer, formul\xE4r, animationer och dynamiskt inneh\xE5ll. Sidan ska fungera \xE4ven om skriptet inte hunnit laddas, och vi skickar s\xE5 lite kod som m\xF6jligt till bes\xF6karen.":"We use JavaScript where it adds something: menus, forms, animations and dynamic content. The page should work even if the script hasn't loaded yet, and we send as little code as possible to the visitor.","med JavaScript":"with JavaScript","Progressiv f\xF6rb\xE4ttring":"Progressive enhancement","Grundfunktionen fungerar utan skript \u2013 JavaScript g\xF6r upplevelsen b\xE4ttre, inte m\xF6jlig.":"The basic function works without scripts \u2013 JavaScript makes the experience better, not possible.","Tillg\xE4nglig interaktion":"Accessible interaction","Menyer och flikar som styrs med tangentbord och ber\xE4ttar sitt l\xE4ge f\xF6r sk\xE4rml\xE4sare.":"Menus and tabs that can be controlled by keyboard and announce their state to screen readers.","Sm\xE5, fokuserade skript utan on\xF6diga beroenden.":"Small, focused scripts without unnecessary dependencies.","Megamenyn, hamburgermenyn och recensionskarusellen styrs av n\xE5gra f\xE5 rader JavaScript.":"The mega menu, the hamburger menu and the review carousel are controlled by a few lines of JavaScript.","Korten som tonar in n\xE4r man scrollar anv\xE4nder IntersectionObserver.":"The cards that fade in as you scroll use IntersectionObserver.","Allt respekterar inst\xE4llningen f\xF6r reducerad r\xF6relse i operativsystemet.":"Everything respects the reduced motion setting in the operating system.","En plattform f\xF6r att k\xF6ra JavaScript utanf\xF6r webbl\xE4saren \u2013 p\xE5 servrar, i byggsteg och i testmilj\xF6er.":"A platform for running JavaScript outside the browser \u2013 on servers, in build steps and in test environments.","Node.js l\xE5ter oss anv\xE4nda samma spr\xE5k i hela kedjan. Vi anv\xE4nder det f\xF6r API:er och integrationer, men lika ofta f\xF6r de verktyg som g\xF6r utvecklingsarbetet snabbare och s\xE4krare.":"Node.js lets us use the same language throughout the chain. We use it for APIs and integrations, but just as often for the tools that make development faster and safer.","med Node.js":"with Node.js","API:er och integrationer":"APIs and integrations","L\xE4tta tj\xE4nster som kopplar ihop webbplatsen med aff\xE4rssystem och tredjepartstj\xE4nster.":"Lightweight services that connect the website with business systems and third-party services.",Byggverktyg:"Build tools","Kompilering, optimering av bilder och generering av sidor.":"Compilation, image optimisation and page generation.",Testautomation:"Test automation","Skript som k\xF6r webbl\xE4sartester och j\xE4mf\xF6r sk\xE4rmdumpar.":"Scripts that run browser tests and compare screenshots.","Sk\xE4rmdumparna och testerna av den h\xE4r sajten k\xF6rs med Node.js-skript.":"The screenshots and tests of this site are run with Node.js scripts.","PDF:en med v\xE5rt exempelavtal skapas automatiskt fr\xE5n avtalssidan med ett Node.js-skript.":"The PDF of our example agreement is created automatically from the agreement page with a Node.js script.","Ett verktyg f\xF6r att styra riktiga webbl\xE4sare automatiskt \u2013 f\xF6r tester, sk\xE4rmdumpar och kvalitetskontroll.":"A tool for controlling real browsers automatically \u2013 for tests, screenshots and quality control.","Med Playwright klickar, skriver och scrollar vi oss igenom tj\xE4nster precis som en anv\xE4ndare \u2013 fast tusentals g\xE5nger och p\xE5 flera webbl\xE4sare. Det f\xE5ngar fel innan de n\xE5r produktion.":"With Playwright we click, type and scroll our way through services just like a user \u2013 but thousands of times and in several browsers. It catches bugs before they reach production.","med Playwright":"with Playwright",Fl\u00F6destester:"Flow tests","Viktiga fl\xF6den som k\xF6p, inloggning och formul\xE4r testas vid varje \xE4ndring.":"Important flows like purchases, logins and forms are tested with every change.","Visuell regression":"Visual regression","Sk\xE4rmdumpar j\xE4mf\xF6rs pixel f\xF6r pixel f\xF6r att uppt\xE4cka oavsiktliga \xE4ndringar.":"Screenshots are compared pixel by pixel to detect unintended changes.","Flera enheter":"Multiple devices","Samma tester k\xF6rs i olika sk\xE4rmstorlekar och webbl\xE4sare.":"The same tests run in different screen sizes and browsers.","Varje sida testas vid 1440, 1024 och 390 pixlars bredd innan den publiceras.":"Every page is tested at 1440, 1024 and 390 pixels wide before it's published.","Testerna kontrollerar att ingen sida g\xE5r att scrolla i sidled p\xE5 mobilen.":"The tests check that no page can be scrolled sideways on mobile.","Menyer, flikar och formul\xE4r klickas igenom automatiskt f\xF6r att hitta fel.":"Menus, tabs and forms are clicked through automatically to find bugs.","Ett l\xE4ttl\xE4st spr\xE5k som \xE4r oslagbart f\xF6r automatisering, analys och verktyg som sparar tid.":"An easy-to-read language that is unbeatable for automation, analysis and time-saving tools.","Python anv\xE4nder vi n\xE4r n\xE5got beh\xF6ver r\xE4knas, analyseras eller automatiseras: dataanalys, migrering av inneh\xE5ll, bildbehandling och sm\xE5 verktyg som g\xF6r ett \xE5terkommande jobb p\xE5 sekunder.":"We use Python when something needs to be calculated, analysed or automated: data analysis, content migration, image processing and small tools that do a recurring job in seconds.","med Python":"with Python",Inneh\u00E5llsmigrering:"Content migration","Flytt av tusentals sidor och bilder mellan system utan manuellt arbete.":"Moving thousands of pages and images between systems without manual work.",Dataanalys:"Data analysis","Bearbetning av bes\xF6ks- och f\xF6rs\xE4ljningsdata inf\xF6r beslut.":"Processing visitor and sales data to support decisions.",Generering:"Generation","Statiska sidor, bilder och rapporter som skapas automatiskt.":"Static pages, images and reports created automatically.","Alla undersidor p\xE5 den h\xE4r sajten genereras av ett litet Python-skript med gemensam header och footer.":"All subpages on this site are generated by a small Python script with a shared header and footer.","Den stora 404-siffran ritades om till en SVG direkt fr\xE5n typsnittets konturer med Python.":"The big 404 number was redrawn as an SVG straight from the font's outlines with Python.","Bilderna p\xE5 sajten besk\xE4rs och komprimeras automatiskt med Pillow.":"The images on the site are cropped and compressed automatically with Pillow.","Ett bibliotek f\xF6r att bygga gr\xE4nssnitt av \xE5teranv\xE4ndbara komponenter \u2013 perfekt n\xE4r en tj\xE4nst har mycket interaktion.":"A library for building interfaces from reusable components \u2013 perfect when a service has a lot of interaction.","N\xE4r en tj\xE4nst beh\xF6ver hantera mycket tillst\xE5nd \u2013 inloggning, filter, formul\xE4r i flera steg eller realtidsdata \u2013 blir React ofta r\xE4tt verktyg. Komponentt\xE4nket passar ocks\xE5 bra ihop med ett designsystem.":"When a service needs to handle a lot of state \u2013 logins, filters, multi-step forms or real-time data \u2013 React is often the right tool. Component thinking also fits well with a design system.","med React":"with React","Webbappar och portaler":"Web apps and portals","Kundportaler, bokningsfl\xF6den och verktyg med mycket logik i gr\xE4nssnittet.":"Customer portals, booking flows and tools with a lot of logic in the interface.","Designsystem i kod":"Design system in code","Komponenter som speglar designsystemet och delas mellan flera produkter.":"Components that mirror the design system and are shared between several products.","Server-rendering":"Server rendering","Tillsammans med ramverk som Next.js f\xF6r snabba f\xF6rsta visningar och bra s\xF6kbarhet.":"Together with frameworks like Next.js for fast first loads and good searchability.","Den h\xE4r sajten beh\xF6vde inte React \u2013 en statisk sajt med lite JavaScript r\xE4ckte gott och blir dessutom snabbare.":"This site didn't need React \u2013 a static site with a little JavaScript was more than enough and is faster too.","Att v\xE4lja bort ett ramverk n\xE4r det inte beh\xF6vs \xE4r ocks\xE5 ett tekniskt beslut vi g\xE4rna tar.":"Choosing not to use a framework when it isn't needed is also a technical decision we're happy to make.","Starter kostar 3 000 kr och Pro 6 000 kr i startavgift, plus en \xE5rsavgift (99\u2013199 kr/\xE5r f\xF6r Starter, 299\u2013399 kr/\xE5r f\xF6r Pro). St\xF6rre projekt f\xE5r ett fast pris i en offert. Alla priser \xE4r exkl. moms.":"Starter costs SEK 3,000 and Pro SEK 6,000 as a start-up fee, plus an annual fee (SEK 99\u2013199/year for Starter, SEK 299\u2013399/year for Pro). Larger projects get a fixed price in a quote. All prices are excl. VAT.","Vi bygger hemsidor och kopplar p\xE5 bokningssystem, offertsystem och AI-chatt. Vi jobbar ocks\xE5 med SEO och AI-optimering, och tar hand om support och underh\xE5ll efter\xE5t.":"We build websites and add booking systems, quote systems and AI chat. We also work with SEO and AI optimisation, and take care of support and maintenance afterwards.","Ja, vi kan bygga in bokning s\xE5 att kunderna v\xE4ljer en tid direkt p\xE5 hemsidan \u2013 med notiser till er via e-post och SMS.":"Yes, we can build in booking so customers pick a time directly on your website \u2013 with notifications to you by email and text message.","Om bokningssystem":"About booking systems","Med ett offertfl\xF6de beskriver kunden jobbet steg f\xF6r steg, s\xE5 att ni f\xE5r en komplett f\xF6rfr\xE5gan. V\xE5ra egna offerter \xE4r p\xE5 tv\xE5 sidor med fast pris.":"With a quote form, the customer describes the job step by step, so you get a complete enquiry. Our own quotes are two pages with a fixed price.","Se ett exempel p\xE5 avtal":"See an example agreement","Vi bygger AI-chattar som svarar p\xE5 kundernas vanliga fr\xE5gor dygnet runt och skickar vidare f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar till er.":"We build AI chats that answer your customers' common questions around the clock and pass enquiries on to you.","Om AI-chatt":"About AI chat","Grundl\xE4ggande SEO och AI-optimering ing\xE5r i alla hemsidor vi bygger, s\xE5 att ni g\xE5r att hitta b\xE5de p\xE5 Google och i AI-tj\xE4nster.":"Basic SEO and AI optimisation are included in every website we build, so you can be found both on Google and in AI services.","Om SEO och AI-optimering":"About SEO and AI optimisation","Under f\xF6rsta \xE5ret ing\xE5r upp till 10 timmars support och redigering per m\xE5nad \u2013 till exempel text- och bild\xE4ndringar eller nya funktioner.":"During the first year, up to 10 hours of support and editing per month are included \u2013 for example text and image changes or new features.","Dom\xE4nen \xE4r och f\xF6rblir er. Hosting och eventuella externa avgifter st\xE5r specificerade i offerten.":"The domain is and remains yours. Hosting and any external fees are specified in the quote.","Vi finns i Uppsala och jobbar med f\xF6retag i hela Sverige \u2013 m\xF6ten g\xE5r lika bra p\xE5 distans.":"We're based in Uppsala and work with businesses all over Sweden \u2013 meetings work just as well remotely.","Ring Carl p\xE5 +46 76 022 83 61 eller mejla info@elevatestudio.nu. Du kan ocks\xE5 fylla i formul\xE4ret, s\xE5 h\xF6r vi av oss s\xE5 fort vi kan.":"Call Carl on +46 76 022 83 61 or email info@elevatestudio.nu. You can also fill in the form, and we'll get back to you as soon as we can.","Vad kostar det?":"What does it cost?","Vad g\xF6r ni?":"What do you do?","Prata med n\xE5gon":"Talk to someone",Skriver:"Typing","Hej! Vad undrar du? V\xE4lj en fr\xE5ga nedan eller skriv sj\xE4lv.":"Hi! What would you like to know? Pick a question below or type your own.","Det ser inte ut som en e-postadress. F\xF6rs\xF6k igen, eller mejla info@elevatestudio.nu.":"That doesn't look like an email address. Try again, or email info@elevatestudio.nu.","N\xE5got gick fel. Mejla g\xE4rna info@elevatestudio.nu direkt.":"Something went wrong. Feel free to email info@elevatestudio.nu directly.","Absolut! Ring Carl p\xE5 +46 76 022 83 61 eller mejla info@elevatestudio.nu. Vill du att vi h\xF6r av oss? Skriv din e-postadress h\xE4r.":"Absolutely! Call Carl on +46 76 022 83 61 or email info@elevatestudio.nu. Would you like us to contact you? Type your email address here.","Vill bli kontaktad":"I'd like to be contacted","Det vet jag inte s\xE4kert \u2013 men vi svarar g\xE4rna sj\xE4lva. Skriv din e-postadress s\xE5 mejlar vi dig ett svar.":"I'm not sure about that \u2013 but we're happy to answer ourselves. Type your email address and we'll email you an answer.","Skickar \u2026":"Sending \u2026","Tack! Du st\xE5r nu p\xE5 listan.":"Thanks! You're now on the list.","Tack! Vi \xE5terkommer s\xE5 fort vi kan.":"Thanks! We'll get back to you as soon as we can.","Det tar l\xE4ngre tid \xE4n vanligt \u2026 mejla oss g\xE4rna p\xE5 info@elevatestudio.nu om inget h\xE4nder.":"This is taking longer than usual \u2026 feel free to email us at info@elevatestudio.nu if nothing happens.","N\xE5got gick fel. Mejla oss g\xE4rna direkt p\xE5 info@elevatestudio.nu.":"Something went wrong. Feel free to email us directly at info@elevatestudio.nu.","\xD6ppnar sidan i en riktig webbl\xE4sare \u2026":"Opening the page in a real browser \u2026","M\xE4ter hur snabbt inneh\xE5llet visas \u2026":"Measuring how quickly the content appears \u2026","Kontrollerar bilder, skript och typsnitt \u2026":"Checking images, scripts and fonts \u2026","Granskar tillg\xE4nglighet och kontraster \u2026":"Reviewing accessibility and contrast \u2026","G\xE5r igenom SEO och metadata \u2026":"Going through SEO and metadata \u2026","Letar efter s\xE4kerhetsbrister och fel \u2026":"Looking for security flaws and errors \u2026","Sammanst\xE4ller resultatet \u2026":"Compiling the results \u2026","B\xE4sta praxis":"Best practices","F\xF6rsta inneh\xE5ll":"First content","St\xF6rsta inneh\xE5ll":"Largest content",Blockeringstid:"Blocking time",Layoutskift:"Layout shift",Hastighetsindex:"Speed index","Vi laddar kritisk CSS f\xF6rst och skjuter upp skript som inte beh\xF6vs direkt, s\xE5 att sidan syns tidigare.":"We load critical CSS first and defer scripts that aren't needed right away, so the page appears sooner.","Vi komprimerar bilderna utan synlig kvalitetsf\xF6rlust och automatiserar det f\xF6r nya bilder.":"We compress the images without visible loss of quality and automate it for new images.","Vi konverterar bilder till moderna format som WebP eller AVIF, som ofta \xE4r h\xE4lften s\xE5 stora.":"We convert images to modern formats like WebP or AVIF, which are often half the size.","Vi levererar r\xE4tt bildstorlek till varje sk\xE4rm i st\xE4llet f\xF6r att skicka stora bilder till mobilen.":"We deliver the right image size for each screen instead of sending large images to mobiles.","Vi laddar bilder f\xF6rst n\xE4r de n\xE4rmar sig sk\xE4rmen (lazy loading).":"We load images only when they approach the screen (lazy loading).","Vi rensar bort oanv\xE4nd JavaScript och delar upp koden s\xE5 att varje sida bara laddar det den beh\xF6ver.":"We remove unused JavaScript and split the code so each page only loads what it needs.","Vi tar bort oanv\xE4nd CSS och bryter ut det som beh\xF6vs f\xF6r f\xF6rsta visningen.":"We remove unused CSS and extract what's needed for the first view.","Vi minifierar JavaScript i byggsteget.":"We minify JavaScript in the build step.","Vi minifierar CSS i byggsteget.":"We minify CSS in the build step.","Vi snabbar upp servern med cachning, b\xE4ttre hosting eller ett CDN n\xE4ra bes\xF6karna.":"We speed up the server with caching, better hosting or a CDN close to the visitors.","Vi sl\xE5r p\xE5 gzip- eller Brotli-komprimering p\xE5 servern.":"We turn on gzip or Brotli compression on the server.","Vi st\xE4ller in l\xE5nga cachetider f\xF6r bilder, typsnitt och skript s\xE5 att \xE5terkommande bes\xF6k g\xE5r blixtsnabbt.":"We set long cache times for images, fonts and scripts so returning visits are lightning fast.","Vi tar bort on\xF6diga omdirigeringar s\xE5 att bes\xF6karen kommer direkt till r\xE4tt sida.":"We remove unnecessary redirects so the visitor lands directly on the right page.","Vi f\xF6rbereder anslutningar till viktiga externa tj\xE4nster tidigt.":"We prepare connections to important external services early.","Vi ser till att text syns direkt medan typsnitten laddas.":"We make sure text is visible right away while the fonts load.","Vi g\xE5r igenom tredjepartsskript (annonser, chattar, sp\xE5rning) och laddar dem smartare eller tar bort det som inte beh\xF6vs.":"We review third-party scripts (ads, chats, tracking) and load them smarter or remove what isn't needed.","Vi bantar sidans totala storlek genom att optimera bilder, skript och typsnitt.":"We reduce the page's total size by optimising images, scripts and fonts.","Vi f\xF6renklar sidans struktur s\xE5 att webbl\xE4saren f\xE5r mindre att r\xE4kna p\xE5.":"We simplify the page structure so the browser has less to calculate.","Vi minskar tung JavaScript som tar l\xE5ng tid att k\xF6ra p\xE5 mobiler.":"We reduce heavy JavaScript that takes a long time to run on mobiles.","Vi flyttar tunga ber\xE4kningar bort fr\xE5n huvudtr\xE5den s\xE5 att sidan svarar direkt p\xE5 klick.":"We move heavy computations off the main thread so the page responds to clicks right away.","Vi prioriterar sidans viktigaste bild eller rubrik s\xE5 att den visas snabbare.":"We prioritise the page's most important image or headline so it appears faster.","Vi minskar det som m\xE5ste laddas innan n\xE5got alls kan visas.":"We reduce what has to load before anything at all can be shown.","Vi delar upp l\xE5nga skript s\xE5 att sidan kan svara p\xE5 klick och scroll direkt.":"We split long scripts so the page can respond to clicks and scrolling right away.","Vi reserverar plats f\xF6r bilder, annonser och typsnitt s\xE5 att inneh\xE5llet inte hoppar n\xE4r sidan laddar.":"We reserve space for images, ads and fonts so the content doesn't jump while the page loads.","Vi optimerar ordningen inneh\xE5llet laddas i s\xE5 att sidan upplevs snabbare.":"We optimise the order in which content loads so the page feels faster.","Vi justerar f\xE4rgerna s\xE5 att texten blir l\xE4sbar f\xF6r alla, \xE4ven med nedsatt syn.":"We adjust the colours so the text is readable for everyone, including people with impaired vision.","Vi skriver beskrivande alternativtexter s\xE5 att bilder fungerar med sk\xE4rml\xE4sare och i s\xF6k.":"We write descriptive alt texts so images work with screen readers and in search.","Vi ger alla knappar tydliga namn som sk\xE4rml\xE4sare kan l\xE4sa upp.":"We give all buttons clear names that screen readers can read out.","Vi ger alla l\xE4nkar beskrivande texter.":"We give all links descriptive texts.","Vi kopplar etiketter till alla formul\xE4rf\xE4lt.":"We connect labels to all form fields.","Vi r\xE4ttar rubrikordningen s\xE5 att sidan g\xE5r att navigera med sk\xE4rml\xE4sare.":"We fix the heading order so the page can be navigated with screen readers.","Vi anger sidans spr\xE5k s\xE5 att sk\xE4rml\xE4sare uttalar texten r\xE4tt.":"We set the page language so screen readers pronounce the text correctly.","Vi g\xF6r knappar och l\xE4nkar tillr\xE4ckligt stora f\xF6r att tr\xE4ffa med fingret.":"We make buttons and links large enough to hit with a finger.","Vi r\xE4ttar felaktiga ARIA-attribut.":"We fix incorrect ARIA attributes.","Vi skriver en tydlig sidtitel som lockar till klick i s\xF6kresultaten.":"We write a clear page title that attracts clicks in search results.","Vi skriver s\xE4ljande metabeskrivningar f\xF6r varje sida.":"We write compelling meta descriptions for every page.",'Vi byter ut "L\xE4s mer"-l\xE4nkar mot beskrivande texter som b\xE5de Google och bes\xF6kare f\xF6rst\xE5r.':'We replace "Read more" links with descriptive texts that both Google and visitors understand.',"Vi ser till att Google f\xE5r indexera sidan.":"We make sure Google is allowed to index the page.","Vi r\xE4ttar robots.txt s\xE5 att s\xF6kmotorerna hittar r\xE4tt sidor.":"We fix robots.txt so search engines find the right pages.","Vi l\xE4gger in korrekta canonical-l\xE4nkar s\xE5 att Google vet vilken sida som \xE4r originalet.":"We add correct canonical links so Google knows which page is the original.","Vi r\xE4ttar spr\xE5kversionerna s\xE5 att r\xE4tt sida visas i r\xE4tt land.":"We fix the language versions so the right page is shown in the right country.","Vi l\xE4gger till strukturerad data som kan ge rikare s\xF6kresultat.":"We add structured data that can give richer search results.","Vi \xF6kar textstorleken s\xE5 att sidan \xE4r l\xE4sbar p\xE5 mobil utan att zooma.":"We increase the text size so the page is readable on mobile without zooming.","Vi g\xF6r sidan mobilanpassad.":"We make the page mobile-friendly.","Vi flyttar hela sajten till s\xE4ker HTTPS.":"We move the whole site to secure HTTPS.","Vi r\xE4ttar JavaScript-felen som uppst\xE5r n\xE4r sidan laddas.":"We fix the JavaScript errors that occur when the page loads.","Vi r\xE4ttar de problem som webbl\xE4saren varnar f\xF6r.":"We fix the problems the browser warns about.","Vi byter ut f\xF6r\xE5ldrade webbl\xE4sarfunktioner innan de slutar fungera.":"We replace outdated browser features before they stop working.","Vi visar bilderna i r\xE4tt proportioner.":"We show the images in the right proportions.","Vi levererar bilder i r\xE4tt uppl\xF6sning f\xF6r skarpa sk\xE4rmar.":"We deliver images in the right resolution for sharp screens.","Vi l\xE4gger till en s\xE4kerhetspolicy (CSP) som skyddar mot skadliga skript.":"We add a security policy (CSP) that protects against malicious scripts.","Vi ser \xF6ver tredjepartscookies inf\xF6r att webbl\xE4sarna fasar ut dem.":"We review third-party cookies ahead of browsers phasing them out.","Vi analyserar orsaken och optimerar koden, bilderna eller servern s\xE5 att sidan blir snabbare.":"We analyse the cause and optimise the code, images or server so the page gets faster.","Vi \xE5tg\xE4rdar problemet s\xE5 att sidan fungerar f\xF6r alla bes\xF6kare och uppfyller tillg\xE4nglighetskraven.":"We fix the problem so the page works for all visitors and meets accessibility requirements.","Vi r\xE4ttar problemet enligt moderna riktlinjer f\xF6r s\xE4kerhet och kvalitet.":"We fix the problem according to modern guidelines for security and quality.","Vi \xE5tg\xE4rdar problemet s\xE5 att Google f\xF6rst\xE5r och rankar sidan b\xE4ttre.":"We fix the problem so Google understands and ranks the page better.","S\xE4kerhetspolicy (CSP) saknas eller \xE4r svag":"Security policy (CSP) is missing or weak","Vi inf\xF6r en Content Security Policy som hindrar skadliga skript fr\xE5n att k\xF6ras p\xE5 sajten.":"We introduce a Content Security Policy that stops malicious scripts from running on the site.","Cookies saknar s\xE4kerhetsflaggor":"Cookies lack security flags","Vi s\xE4tter Secure, HttpOnly och SameSite p\xE5 alla cookies.":"We set Secure, HttpOnly and SameSite on all cookies.","F\xF6r \xF6ppen delning mellan dom\xE4ner (CORS)":"Too open sharing between domains (CORS)","Vi begr\xE4nsar vilka andra sajter som f\xE5r l\xE4sa ert inneh\xE5ll.":"We limit which other sites may read your content.","Bes\xF6kare skickas inte s\xE4kert till HTTPS":"Visitors are not sent securely to HTTPS","Vi ser till att alla bes\xF6k g\xE5r direkt till en krypterad HTTPS-adress.":"We make sure all visits go directly to an encrypted HTTPS address.","Referrer-policy saknas":"Referrer policy is missing","Vi begr\xE4nsar vilken information som skickas vidare n\xE4r bes\xF6kare klickar sig bort fr\xE5n sajten.":"We limit what information is passed on when visitors click away from the site.","HTTPS tvingas inte (HSTS)":"HTTPS is not enforced (HSTS)","Vi sl\xE5r p\xE5 HSTS s\xE5 att webbl\xE4sare alltid anv\xE4nder krypterad anslutning.":"We turn on HSTS so browsers always use an encrypted connection.","Externa skript kontrolleras inte (SRI)":"External scripts are not verified (SRI)","Vi l\xE4gger till integritetskontroll f\xF6r skript som laddas fr\xE5n andra dom\xE4ner.":"We add integrity checks for scripts loaded from other domains.","X-Content-Type-Options saknas":"X-Content-Type-Options is missing","Vi l\xE4gger till nosniff s\xE5 att webbl\xE4saren inte gissar filtyper.":"We add nosniff so the browser doesn't guess file types.","Sajten kan b\xE4ddas in av andra (clickjacking)":"The site can be embedded by others (clickjacking)","Vi sp\xE4rrar inb\xE4ddning med frame-ancestors s\xE5 att ingen kan lura bes\xF6kare via en falsk ram.":"We block embedding with frame-ancestors so nobody can trick visitors through a fake frame.","Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy saknas":"Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy is missing","Vi isolerar sajten fr\xE5n f\xF6nster som \xF6ppnas av andra dom\xE4ner.":"We isolate the site from windows opened by other domains.","Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy saknas":"Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy is missing","Vi styr vilka externa resurser som f\xE5r b\xE4ddas in.":"We control which external resources may be embedded.","Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy saknas":"Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy is missing","Vi styr vilka andra sajter som f\xE5r anv\xE4nda era resurser.":"We control which other sites may use your resources.","Testet kunde inte genomf\xF6ras":"The test could not be completed","Be oss g\xF6ra en manuell genomg\xE5ng":"Ask us for a manual review","Vi \xE5tg\xE4rdar inst\xE4llningen p\xE5 servern enligt moderna s\xE4kerhetsriktlinjer.":"We fix the server setting according to modern security guidelines.","S\xE5 fixar vi det:":"How we fix it:","Inga st\xF6rre problem hittades":"No major problems found","Sajten klarar testerna bra. Vi hj\xE4lper g\xE4rna till med n\xE4sta steg, till exempel konvertering och inneh\xE5ll.":"The site does well in the tests. We're happy to help with the next step, for example conversion and content.","Prestandadelen kunde inte k\xF6ras just nu.":"The performance part couldn't be run right now.","S\xE4kerhetstestet nedan \xE4r komplett. Vill du ha hela testet? L\xE4mna din e-post s\xE5 k\xF6r vi det \xE5t dig och mejlar resultatet.":"The security test below is complete. Want the full test? Leave your email and we'll run it for you and email you the results.","Sk\xE4rmbild av den testade sidan":"Screenshot of the tested page",Laddtider:"Load times","Det h\xE4r kan f\xF6rb\xE4ttras":"What can be improved","Vill du att vi fixar det h\xE4r?":"Would you like us to fix this?","Vi g\xE5r igenom resultatet med dig och ger ett f\xF6rslag med fast pris.":"We go through the results with you and give you a proposal with a fixed price.","Skicka resultatet till oss":"Send the results to us","M\xE4tningen g\xF6rs med Google PageSpeed Insights (Lighthouse) och MDN HTTP Observatory. Resultatet kan variera n\xE5got mellan k\xF6rningar.":"Measured with Google PageSpeed Insights (Lighthouse) and MDN HTTP Observatory. Results may vary slightly between runs.","M\xE4tningen g\xF6rs med MDN HTTP Observatory. Resultatet kan variera n\xE5got mellan k\xF6rningar.":"Measured with MDN HTTP Observatory. Results may vary slightly between runs.","Din e-post":"Your email","K\xF6r testet \xE5t mig":"Run the test for me","Tack! Vi k\xF6r testet och mejlar dig resultatet.":"Thanks! We'll run the test and email you the results.","N\xE5got gick fel. Mejla info@elevatestudio.nu s\xE5 hj\xE4lper vi dig.":"Something went wrong. Email info@elevatestudio.nu and we'll help you.","Googles testtj\xE4nst har n\xE5tt sin gr\xE4ns f\xF6r just nu.":"Google's test service has reached its limit for now.","Vi kunde inte n\xE5 Googles testtj\xE4nst.":"We couldn't reach Google's test service.","Google kunde inte ladda sidan.":"Google couldn't load the page.","ok\xE4nt fel":"unknown error","Testtj\xE4nsterna svarar inte just nu. L\xE4mna din e-post s\xE5 k\xF6r vi testet \xE5t dig och mejlar resultatet.":"The test services aren't responding right now. Leave your email and we'll run the test for you and email you the results.","Skriv en giltig adress, till exempel dittforetag.se":"Enter a valid address, for example yourcompany.com",S\u00E4kerhet:"Security","Testad sida":"Tested page","Hemsidor \u2192":"Websites \u2192","Support och underh\xE5ll \u2192":"Support and maintenance \u2192","SEO och AI-optimering \u2192":"SEO and AI optimisation \u2192","Vi \xE4r en liten webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala som bygger hemsidor som ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar \u2013 f\xF6r f\xF6retag i Uppsala, i hela Uppsala l\xE4n och i resten av Sverige.":"We are a small web agency in Uppsala building websites that bring in enquiries \u2013 for businesses in Uppsala, across Uppsala County and the rest of Sweden.","Det h\xE4r g\xF6r en webbyr\xE5 \xE5t er":"What a web agency does for you","S\xE5 g\xE5r det till":"How it works","F\xF6rsta m\xF6tet: vi l\xE4r k\xE4nna ert f\xF6retag, era kunder och vad hemsidan ska ge.":"First meeting: we get to know your business, your customers and what the website should achieve.","Utkast p\xE5 en dag: ni ser ett f\xF6rsta utkast efter ungef\xE4r en dag.":"Draft in a day: you see a first draft after about a day.","Finjustering: ni f\xE5r tv\xE5 korrekturv\xE4ndor, s\xE5 att allt blir r\xE4tt.":"Fine-tuning: you get two rounds of revisions, so everything is right.","Lansering: sidan g\xE5r live, indexeras av Google och b\xF6rjar ta emot f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar.":"Launch: the site goes live, is indexed by Google and starts receiving enquiries.","Uppf\xF6ljning: vi f\xF6ljer upp vad som ger kunder och f\xF6rb\xE4ttrar l\xF6pande.":"Follow-up: we track what brings in customers and keep improving.","Syns n\xE4r kunder i Uppsala s\xF6ker":"Be found when customers in Uppsala search","N\xE4r n\xE5gon s\xF6ker p\xE5 en tj\xE4nst i Uppsala visar Google f\xF6rst de f\xF6retag som har en tydlig hemsida, en komplett f\xF6retagsprofil och bra recensioner. Vi bygger sidan s\xE5 att Google f\xF6rst\xE5r vad ni g\xF6r och var ni finns \u2013 och s\xE5 att AI-tj\xE4nster som ChatGPT kan beskriva er r\xE4tt n\xE4r n\xE5gon fr\xE5gar efter ett f\xF6retag i n\xE4rheten.":"When someone searches for a service in Uppsala, Google first shows the businesses with a clear website, a complete business profile and good reviews. We build the site so Google understands what you do and where you are \u2013 and so AI services like ChatGPT can describe you correctly when someone asks for a business nearby.","Vi hj\xE4lper f\xF6retag i hela Uppsala l\xE4n":"We help businesses across Uppsala County","Uppsala, Knivsta, Enk\xF6ping, \xD6sthammar, Tierp, Heby och \xC4lvkarleby \u2013 och g\xE4rna Sigtuna, M\xE4rsta och Stockholm ocks\xE5. Vi tr\xE4ffas d\xE4r det passar er eller p\xE5 distans.":"Uppsala, Knivsta, Enk\xF6ping, \xD6sthammar, Tierp, Heby and \xC4lvkarleby \u2013 and happily Sigtuna, M\xE4rsta and Stockholm too. We meet wherever suits you, or remotely.","Vad kostar en hemsida hos en webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala?":"What does a website from a web agency in Uppsala cost?","Hos oss kostar Starter 3 000 kr och Pro 6 000 kr i startavgift, plus en l\xE5g \xE5rsavgift. St\xF6rre projekt f\xE5r ett fast pris i en offert innan vi b\xF6rjar.":"With us, Starter costs SEK 3,000 and Pro SEK 6,000 as a start-up fee, plus a low annual fee. Larger projects get a fixed price in a quote before we start.","Vad g\xF6r en webbyr\xE5?":"What does a web agency do?","En webbyr\xE5 planerar, designar och bygger hemsidor \u2013 och hj\xE4lper ofta till med s\xE5dant som SEO, bokning, formul\xE4r och support efter lansering. Hos oss ing\xE5r grundl\xE4ggande SEO och AI-optimering i alla hemsidor.":"A web agency plans, designs and builds websites \u2013 and often helps with things like SEO, booking, forms and support after launch. With us, basic SEO and AI optimisation are included in every website.","Hur v\xE4ljer man webbyr\xE5?":"How do you choose a web agency?","Fr\xE5ga efter ett fast pris, vem som \xE4ger dom\xE4nen, vad som ing\xE5r i supporten och vad det kostar efter f\xF6rsta \xE5ret. Be ocks\xE5 att f\xE5 se exempel p\xE5 hemsidor byr\xE5n har byggt.":"Ask for a fixed price, who owns the domain, what's included in the support and what it costs after the first year. Also ask to see examples of websites the agency has built.","Webbyr\xE5 Uppsala \u2013 hemsidor till fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr":"Web agency Uppsala \u2013 websites at a fixed price from SEK 3,000","Elevate Studio \xE4r en webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala som bygger hemsidor f\xF6r f\xF6retag till fast pris fr\xE5n 3 000 kr. F\xF6rsta utkastet efter ungef\xE4r en dag. M\xF6t oss i Uppsala eller p\xE5 distans.":"Elevate Studio is a web agency in Uppsala building business websites at a fixed price from SEK 3,000. First draft after about a day. Meet us in Uppsala or remotely.","28 oktober 2026":"28 October 2026","Bygga hemsida sj\xE4lv eller anlita en webbyr\xE5?":"Build a website yourself or hire a web agency?","Bygga hemsida sj\xE4lv eller anlita en webbyr\xE5? | Elevate Studio":"Build a website yourself or hire a web agency? | Elevate Studio","Webbdesign och webbutveckling i Uppsala":"Web design and web development in Uppsala","Beh\xF6ver ni en ny hemsida i Uppsala, eller vill ni bygga om den ni har? Vi st\xE5r f\xF6r b\xE5de webbdesign och webbutveckling \u2013 fr\xE5n f\xF6rsta skissen till en f\xE4rdig sida som fungerar p\xE5 mobilen, syns p\xE5 Google och tar emot f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar. Vill ni synas b\xE4ttre lokalt hj\xE4lper vi ocks\xE5 till med SEO i Uppsala med omnejd.":"Do you need a new website in Uppsala, or want to rebuild the one you have? We handle both web design and web development \u2013 from the first sketch to a finished site that works on mobile, shows up on Google and receives enquiries. If you want to be more visible locally, we also help with SEO in Uppsala and the surrounding area.","Hemsidor och webbdesign f\xF6r f\xF6retag i Uppsala | Elevate Studio":"Websites and web design for businesses in Uppsala | Elevate Studio","SEO i Uppsala och AI-optimering \u2013 syns p\xE5 Google och i AI-s\xF6k":"SEO in Uppsala and AI optimisation \u2013 show up on Google and in AI search","Det har aldrig varit enklare att skapa en hemsida sj\xE4lv. Med verktyg som Wix, Squarespace och WordPress kan vem som helst f\xE5 upp en sida p\xE5 en kv\xE4ll. Fr\xE5gan \xE4r snarare vad hemsidan ska g\xF6ra f\xF6r ditt f\xF6retag \u2013 och vad din tid \xE4r v\xE4rd.":"It has never been easier to create a website yourself. With tools like Wix, Squarespace and WordPress, anyone can get a site up in an evening. The real question is what the website should do for your business \u2013 and what your time is worth.","Det har aldrig varit enklare att skapa en hemsida sj\xE4lv. Med verktyg som Wix, Squarespace och WordPress kan vem som helst f\xE5 upp en sida p\xE5 en kv\xE4ll. \u2026":"It has never been easier to create a website yourself. With tools like Wix, Squarespace and WordPress, anyone can get a site up in an evening. \u2026","N\xE4r det r\xE4cker att bygga hemsidan sj\xE4lv":"When building the website yourself is enough","Du beh\xF6ver bara ett enkelt visitkort p\xE5 n\xE4tet med kontaktuppgifter.":"You only need a simple online business card with contact details.","Du har tid och tycker att det \xE4r roligt att l\xE4ra dig verktyget.":"You have the time and enjoy learning the tool.","Det \xE4r inte s\xE5 viktigt att synas h\xF6gt p\xE5 Google.":"Ranking high on Google isn't that important.","N\xE4r en webbyr\xE5 l\xF6nar sig":"When a web agency pays off","Hemsidan ska ge f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar, inte bara finnas.":"The website should bring in enquiries, not just exist.","Du vill synas n\xE4r kunder s\xF6ker p\xE5 din tj\xE4nst p\xE5 din ort.":"You want to show up when customers search for your service in your area.","Du beh\xF6ver bokning, offertformul\xE4r eller en chatt som svarar kunderna.":"You need booking, quote forms or a chat that answers customers.","Du vill slippa tekniken och l\xE4gga tiden p\xE5 ditt eget jobb.":"You want to avoid the technical side and spend your time on your own work.","Det m\xE5nga gl\xF6mmer n\xE4r de skapar hemsidan sj\xE4lva":"What many forget when they create the website themselves","Tiden: att bygga, skriva texter och h\xE5lla sidan uppdaterad tar ofta mycket l\xE4ngre tid \xE4n man tror.":"Time: building, writing texts and keeping the site up to date often takes much longer than you think.","L\xF6pande kostnader: byggverktygen tar ofta en m\xE5nadsavgift s\xE5 l\xE4nge sidan finns.":"Running costs: website builders often charge a monthly fee for as long as the site exists.","Synligheten: en snygg mall syns inte automatiskt p\xE5 Google \u2013 det kr\xE4ver tydliga tj\xE4nstesidor, r\xE4tt rubriker och snabba sidor.":"Visibility: a nice template doesn't automatically show up on Google \u2013 that takes clear service pages, the right headings and fast pages.","Som webbyr\xE5 i Uppsala bygger vi hemsidor till fast pris: Starter kostar 3 000 kr i startavgift och d\xE4refter 99\u2013199 kr per \xE5r. Du ser ett f\xF6rsta utkast efter ungef\xE4r en dag, dom\xE4nen \xE4r alltid din och under f\xF6rsta \xE5ret ing\xE5r upp till 10 timmars support och \xE4ndringar per m\xE5nad.":"As a web agency in Uppsala we build websites at a fixed price: Starter costs SEK 3,000 as a start-up fee and then SEK 99\u2013199 per year. You see a first draft after about a day, the domain is always yours and during the first year up to 10 hours of support and changes per month are included.","Fyra steg fr\xE5n f\xF6rsta m\xF6tet till en hemsida som ger f\xF6rfr\xE5gningar. Vi tar hand om det tekniska, ni bidrar med kunskapen om ert f\xF6retag.":"Four steps from the first meeting to a website that brings in enquiries. We take care of the technical side, you bring the knowledge about your business."},p:[["^(.+) \u2013 exempel p\xE5 hemsida \\| Elevate Studio$","$1 \u2013 example website | Elevate Studio"],["^(.+) \u2013 s\xE5 anv\xE4nder vi det i hemsidor \\| Elevate Studio$","$1 \u2013 how we use it in websites | Elevate Studio"],["^(.+) \u2013 exempel p\xE5 hemsida p\xE5 en dator$","$1 \u2013 example website on a laptop"],["^(.+) \u2013 kund hos Elevate Studio$","$1 \u2013 a client of Elevate Studio"],["^(.+) p\xE5 en dator$","$1 on a laptop"],["^(.+) p\xE5 en mobil$","$1 on a phone"],["^(.+) \u2013 exempel p\xE5 hemsida$","$1 \u2013 example website"],["^Tack! Vi svarar dig p\xE5 (.+) s\xE5 fort vi kan\\.$","Thanks! We'll reply to $1 as soon as we can."],["^S\xE4kerhet (.*)$","Security $1"],["^(-?\\d+) po\xE4ng$","$1 points"],["^Testad sida \\(mobil\\)$","Tested page (mobile)"],["^Testad sida \\(dator\\)$","Tested page (desktop)"],["^Sidan kunde inte testas \\((.*)\\)\\.$","The page could not be tested ($1)."],["^(\\d+) s$","$1 s"]]};
